            ['start_time' => 344.68, 'end_time' => 345.08, 'target_text' => 'Mashallah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 94],
            ['start_time' => 345.1, 'end_time' => 346.88, 'target_text' => 'May Allah make it easy.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah memudahkan urusan kita.', 'order' => 95],
            ['start_time' => 346.98, 'end_time' => 350.58, 'target_text' => 'It\'s Scottish water, but mashallah, it\'s good, pure, and clean.', 'source_text' => 'Ia sememangnya air Scotland, tetapi masya-Allah, ia sangat enak, murni, dan bersih.', 'order' => 96],
            ['start_time' => 350.68, 'end_time' => 356.38, 'target_text' => 'But look, there was a man who gave water from a well that wasn\'t clean in the sense that, you know, when', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi lihatlah, ada seorang lelaki yang memberi minum air dari sebuah perigi yang tidaklah begitu bersih dalam erti kata,', 'order' => 97],
            ['start_time' => 356.48, 'end_time' => 360.75, 'target_text' => 'you draw water from a well with your shoe, it has a little bit of dirt in it, right?', 'source_text' => 'apabila anda menceduk air telaga menggunakan kasut anda, pasti ada sedikit debu tanah di dalamnya, betul?', 'order' => 98],
            ['start_time' => 360.85, 'end_time' => 363.19, 'target_text' => 'It\'s not like the one we have today.', 'source_text' => 'Itu tidaklah sebersih bekalan air yang kita nikmati hari ini.', 'order' => 99],
            ['start_time' => 363.3, 'end_time' => 365.38, 'target_text' => 'And he was giving that water to a dog.', 'source_text' => 'Dan dia memberikan air itu kepada seekor anjing yang kehausan.', 'order' => 100],
            ['start_time' => 365.48, 'end_time' => 366.25, 'target_text' => 'What is a dog?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah itu anjing?', 'order' => 101],
            ['start_time' => 366.36, 'end_time' => 367.74, 'target_text' => 'A dog is not a human.', 'source_text' => 'Seekor anjing bukanlah manusia.', 'order' => 102],
            ['start_time' => 367.84, 'end_time' => 372.84, 'target_text' => 'A dog has no bearing on a human being\'s status in the eyes of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Haiwan anjing tidak menentukan darjat seorang manusia di sisi Allah.', 'order' => 103],
            ['start_time' => 372.94, 'end_time' => 374.71, 'target_text' => 'But a dog is simply a creation of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Namun anjing itu sememangnya salah satu daripada makhluk ciptaan Allah.', 'order' => 104],
            ['start_time' => 374.81, 'end_time' => 379.87, 'target_text' => 'Perhaps there is a connection between us and a dog, which is why there are some additional rules regarding', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin ada kaitan tertentu antara kita dengan haiwan ini, sebab itulah terdapat beberapa peraturan tambahan mengenai', 'order' => 105],
            ['start_time' => 379.97, 'end_time' => 381.7, 'target_text' => 'interaction with dogs in Islam.', 'source_text' => 'interaksi dengan anjing di dalam Islam.', 'order' => 106],
            ['start_time' => 381.8, 'end_time' => 388.5, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a very sensitive issue because people ask: "Is it permissible to interact with dogs as a Muslim?" It\'s', 'source_text' => 'Ia merupakan isu yang sangat sensitif kerana orang selalu bertanya: "Bolehkah seorang Muslim berinteraksi dengan anjing?" Ia', 'order' => 107],
            ['start_time' => 388.6, 'end_time' => 390.96, 'target_text' => 'definitely allowed, but there are some rules you should know.', 'source_text' => 'sememangnya dibenarkan, tetapi terdapat hukum dan adab tertentu yang perlu anda ketahui.', 'order' => 108],
            ['start_time' => 391.06, 'end_time' => 391.95, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what it\'s all about.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah intipati ketetapan yang digariskan.', 'order' => 109],
            ['start_time' => 392.05, 'end_time' => 393.53, 'target_text' => 'It\'s not that we hate dogs.', 'source_text' => 'Bukannya bermakna kita membenci anjing.', 'order' => 110],
            ['start_time' => 393.63, 'end_time' => 394.93, 'target_text' => 'No, we don\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, kita sama sekali tidak membencinya.', 'order' => 111],
            ['start_time' => 395.03, 'end_time' => 399.91, 'target_text' => 'To the point that even if you saw pigs, it is haram to be mean and cruel to a pig.', 'source_text' => 'Malah sehingga ke tahap sekiranya anda melihat khinzir sekalipun, hukumnya haram bersikap zalim dan kejam terhadap haiwan tersebut.', 'order' => 112],
            ['start_time' => 400.01, 'end_time' => 401.59, 'target_text' => 'You\'re not allowed to consume it, right?', 'source_text' => 'Anda memang diharamkan memakannya, bukan?', 'order' => 113],
            ['start_time' => 401.69, 'end_time' => 402.97, 'target_text' => 'But you have to be kind.', 'source_text' => 'Namun anda tetap dituntut untuk berbuat ihsan.', 'order' => 114],
            ['start_time' => 403.07, 'end_time' => 403.8, 'target_text' => 'It\'s an animal.', 'source_text' => 'Ia tetap makhluk bernyawa.', 'order' => 115],
            ['start_time' => 403.9, 'end_time' => 409.43, 'target_text' => 'If you give water to a pig, I am sure you would be rewarded by Allah in an unimaginable way.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda memberi minum air kepada seekor khinzir yang kehausan, saya yakin Allah pasti akan memberi ganjaran pahala yang tidak terbayang besarnya.', 'order' => 116],
            ['start_time' => 409.53, 'end_time' => 411.78, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty grant us ease.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengurniakan kemudahan kepada kita.', 'order' => 117],
            ['start_time' => 411.88, 'end_time' => 418.83, 'target_text' => 'But who has a higher status in the eyes of Allah, a human or a dog?', 'source_text' => 'Namun siapakah yang memiliki darjat yang jauh lebih mulia di sisi Allah, manusia atau anjing?', 'order' => 118],
            ['start_time' => 418.93, 'end_time' => 420.08, 'target_text' => 'A human.', 'source_text' => 'Tentulah manusia.', 'order' => 119],
            ['start_time' => 420.18, 'end_time' => 421.33, 'target_text' => 'Ashraf ul Makhluqat.', 'source_text' => 'Asyraf al-Makhluqat (Sebaik-baik makhluk ciptaan).', 'order' => 120],
            ['start_time' => 421.43, 'end_time' => 425.5, 'target_text' => 'Humanity is the noblest of Allah\'s creatures.', 'source_text' => 'Umat manusia merupakan makhluk yang paling mulia di sisi Allah.', 'order' => 121],
            ['start_time' => 425.6, 'end_time' => 432.58, 'target_text' => 'And then, imagine if you\'re quenching a human being\'s thirst, will you get more or less of a reward?', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu bayangkan jika anda menghilangkan dahaga seorang manusia, adakah anda akan mendapat ganjaran yang lebih besar atau lebih kecil?', 'order' => 122],
            ['start_time' => 432.68, 'end_time' => 434.16, 'target_text' => 'You\'re going to get more.', 'source_text' => 'Anda pasti akan mendapat pahala yang jauh lebih besar.', 'order' => 123],
            ['start_time' => 434.26, 'end_time' => 436.07, 'target_text' => 'It depends on your intention, obviously.', 'source_text' => 'Ia bergantung kepada niat keikhlasan anda, sudah semestinya.', 'order' => 124],
            ['start_time' => 436.17, 'end_time' => 440.04, 'target_text' => 'Innamal a\'malu bin niyyat, but you are giving Zamzam.', 'source_text' => 'Innamal a\'malu bin niyyat (Setiap amalan bergantung pada niat), apatah lagi jika anda memberi minum air Zamzam.', 'order' => 125],
            ['start_time' => 440.14, 'end_time' => 443.48, 'target_text' => 'Zamzam is the purest water that exists on Earth.', 'source_text' => 'Air Zamzam adalah air yang paling suci dan murni yang wujud di atas muka bumi ini.', 'order' => 126],
            ['start_time' => 443.58, 'end_time' => 447.04, 'target_text' => 'We\'re not going to get anything purer than Zamzam, are we?', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak akan dapat menjumpai air yang lebih murni daripada air Zamzam, bukan?', 'order' => 127],
            ['start_time' => 447.14, 'end_time' => 452.32, 'target_text' => 'Zamzam will arise; the hadith says that Zamzam is so pure that it will have an effect for any reason and', 'source_text' => 'Air Zamzam mempunyai keistimewaan luar biasa; hadis menyebut bahawa khasiat air Zamzam adalah mengikut apa jua tujuan dan', 'order' => 128],
            ['start_time' => 452.42, 'end_time' => 453.9, 'target_text' => 'intention for which it is drunk.', 'source_text' => 'niat orang yang meminumnya.', 'order' => 129],
            ['start_time' => 454.0, 'end_time' => 458.6, 'target_text' => 'We drink it with a certain Niyah, inshallah Allah will give you that.', 'source_text' => 'Kita meminumnya dengan niat tertentu, insya-Allah Allah akan mengurniakan hajat tersebut kepada anda.', 'order' => 130],
            ['start_time' => 458.7, 'end_time' => 461.0, 'target_text' => 'Especially Shifa, it contains a cure.', 'source_text' => 'Terutamanya niat untuk syifa\', kerana ia mengandungi penawar penyakit.', 'order' => 131],
            ['start_time' => 461.1, 'end_time' => 463.23, 'target_text' => 'We drink Zamzam, mashallah.', 'source_text' => 'Kita meminum air Zamzam, masya-Allah.', 'order' => 132],
            ['start_time' => 463.33, 'end_time' => 467.87, 'target_text' => 'And many of us have Zamzam at home, even if it \'s just a few drops, mashallah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ramai antara kita menyimpan air Zamzam di rumah masing-masing, walaupun sekadar beberapa titis sahaja.', 'order' => 133],
            ['start_time' => 467.96, 'end_time' => 469.82, 'target_text' => 'Even if it\'s just a little.', 'source_text' => 'Walaupun hanya sedikit.', 'order' => 134],
            ['start_time' => 469.92, 'end_time' => 476.58, 'target_text' => 'But sometimes, brothers and sisters, we tend to forget that our duty is to be good and kind to one another.', 'source_text' => 'Namun kadangkala, wahai saudara-saudariku, kita sering terlupa bahawa kewajipan utama kita adalah berbuat baik dan berkasih sayang sesama kita.', 'order' => 135],
            ['start_time' => 476.68, 'end_time' => 484.44, 'target_text' => 'We must come closer to one another and make sure we understand the Hadith of the dog in a much deeper way,', 'source_text' => 'Kita perlu merapatkan ukhuwah sesama kita dan memastikan kita memahami hadis tentang anjing itu dengan kefahaman yang jauh lebih mendalam,', 'order' => 136],
            ['start_time' => 484.54, 'end_time' => 492.16, 'target_text' => 'saying that if that man was kind to a dog by giving it water that today we might not even drink.', 'source_text' => 'iaitu apabila lelaki itu mengasihi seekor anjing dengan memberinya air telaga yang mungkin hari ini kita sendiri tidak sanggup meminumnya.', 'order' => 137],
            ['start_time' => 492.26, 'end_time' => 497.92, 'target_text' => 'Imagine what the reward would be for you and me if we gave drinking water in a bottle to another human being,', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan betapa besarnya ganjaran buat anda dan saya sekiranya kita menghadiahkan sebotol air minuman bersih kepada seorang insan lain,', 'order' => 138],
            ['start_time' => 498.02, 'end_time' => 503.51, 'target_text' => 'even more so to a thirsty human being, someone who worships Allah, if that were the case.', 'source_text' => 'terutamanya kepada insan yang dahaga, yang menyembah dan beriman kepada Allah.', 'order' => 139],
            ['start_time' => 503.61, 'end_time' => 505.14, 'target_text' => 'So, be understanding with each other.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, bersikap toleransi dan saling memahamilah antara satu sama lain.', 'order' => 140],
            ['start_time' => 505.24, 'end_time' => 512.82, 'target_text' => 'They never know which of their actions will tip the scales, inshallah, granting Jannatul Firdaus to you and', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak pernah tahu amalan kebajikan manakah yang bakal memberatkan timbangan mizan, seterusnya melayakkan anda dan saya memasuki Jannatul Firdaus,', 'order' => 141],
            ['start_time' => 512.92, 'end_time' => 513.63, 'target_text' => 'me.', 'source_text' => 'insya-Allah.', 'order' => 142],
            ['start_time' => 513.73, 'end_time' => 516.17, 'target_text' => 'But now we have a problem.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi sekarang kita menghadapi satu persoalan.', 'order' => 143],
            ['start_time' => 516.27, 'end_time' => 517.2, 'target_text' => 'What\'s the problem?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah persoalannya?', 'order' => 144],
            ['start_time' => 517.3, 'end_time' => 518.4, 'target_text' => 'I\'m very busy at work.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sangat sibuk di tempat kerja.', 'order' => 145],
            ['start_time' => 518.5, 'end_time' => 520.7, 'target_text' => 'I interact with people of the opposite sex.', 'source_text' => 'Saya perlu berurusan dengan orang berlainan jantina.', 'order' => 146],
            ['start_time' => 520.8, 'end_time' => 524.14, 'target_text' => 'Is it haram to interact with the opposite sex?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah haram berurusan dengan individu berlainan jantina?', 'order' => 147],
            ['start_time' => 524.24, 'end_time' => 525.27, 'target_text' => 'Is it haram?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah ia haram?', 'order' => 148],
            ['start_time' => 525.37, 'end_time' => 526.79, 'target_text' => 'No, not at all.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, sama sekali tidak haram mutlak.', 'order' => 149],
            ['start_time' => 526.89, 'end_time' => 533.37, 'target_text' => 'If I\'m allowed to interact with a dog under certain rules, I\'m definitely allowed to interact with the opposite', 'source_text' => 'Jika saya dibenarkan berinteraksi dengan anjing di bawah peraturan syarak tertentu, maka sudah pasti saya dibenarkan berurusan dengan orang yang berlainan', 'order' => 150],
            ['start_time' => 533.47, 'end_time' => 537.01, 'target_text' => 'sex under some rules, some things that need to be taken into account.', 'source_text' => 'jantina berlandaskan adab dan batas yang telah ditetapkan.', 'order' => 151],
            ['start_time' => 537.11, 'end_time' => 539.23, 'target_text' => 'You know, you shouldn\'t cross certain lines.', 'source_text' => 'Anda maklum, anda dilarang melangkaui batas-batas tertentu.', 'order' => 152],
            ['start_time' => 539.33, 'end_time' => 540.05, 'target_text' => 'That exists.', 'source_text' => 'Garis panduan itu memang ada.', 'order' => 153],
            ['start_time' => 540.15, 'end_time' => 547.12, 'target_text' => 'Then people say, " Sheikh, why did you talk to this woman?" "Why not?" "What did I do?" Nothing was forbidden.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu ada yang menegur, "Syeikh, kenapa bercakap dengan wanita ini?" Saya jawab, "Mengapa tidak? Apa salahnya?" Tiada batas haram yang dilanggar.', 'order' => 154],
            ['start_time' => 547.22, 'end_time' => 548.25, 'target_text' => 'There was respect.', 'source_text' => 'Interaksi itu berlangsung dengan penuh rasa hormat.', 'order' => 155],
            ['start_time' => 548.35, 'end_time' => 550.48, 'target_text' => 'We treated her with kindness and dignity.', 'source_text' => 'Kami melayannya dengan sopan dan menjaga maruah.', 'order' => 156],
            ['start_time' => 550.58, 'end_time' => 552.54, 'target_text' => 'We tried to do what we had to do.', 'source_text' => 'Kami sekadar menjalankan urusan yang perlu diselesaikan.', 'order' => 157],
            ['start_time' => 552.64, 'end_time' => 554.9, 'target_text' => 'We lowered our gaze, we did what we had to do.', 'source_text' => 'Kami menundukkan pandangan dan menjaga batasan sewajarnya.', 'order' => 158],
            ['start_time' => 555.0, 'end_time' => 558.55, 'target_text' => 'All those rules were followed, but we interacted.', 'source_text' => 'Segala adab syariah dipatuhi, tetapi urusan muamalat tetap berjalan.', 'order' => 159],
            ['start_time' => 558.65, 'end_time' => 565.0, 'target_text' => 'You go to a pharmacy, you need to look for medicine, there\'s a young woman there and she \'s looking at you.', 'source_text' => 'Anda pergi ke farmasi untuk membeli ubat, di kaunter ada seorang wanita muda bertugas dan dia menyapa anda.', 'order' => 160],
            ['start_time' => 565.1, 'end_time' => 565.92, 'target_text' => 'Good morning, sir.', 'source_text' => 'Selamat pagi, encik.', 'order' => 161],
            ['start_time' => 566.02, 'end_time' => 566.77, 'target_text' => 'How are you, sir?', 'source_text' => 'Apa khabar, encik?', 'order' => 162],
            ['start_time' => 566.87, 'end_time' => 570.11, 'target_text' => 'Are you going to say Allahu Akbar?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda terus menjerit Allahu Akbar kerana panik?', 'order' => 163],
            ['start_time' => 570.21, 'end_time' => 576.49, 'target_text' => 'Right in your heart and mind, you are conscious of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Di dalam hati dan fikiran anda, anda sentiasa mengingati Allah.', 'order' => 164],
            ['start_time' => 576.59, 'end_time' => 580.83, 'target_text' => 'So you say, "Sister, I\'m looking for paracetamol." This is what I need.', 'source_text' => 'Maka anda menjawab dengan sopan, "Cik, saya sedang mencari parasetamol." Inilah ubat yang saya perlukan.', 'order' => 165],
            ['start_time' => 580.93, 'end_time' => 582.77, 'target_text' => '"And so on." And what did you do?', 'source_text' => '"Dan sebagainya." Dan apakah sebenarnya yang telah anda lakukan?', 'order' => 166],
            ['start_time' => 582.87, 'end_time' => 586.2, 'target_text' => 'You called her sister and interacted with her in a beautiful way.', 'source_text' => 'Anda memanggilnya dengan panggilan hormat dan berurusan dengannya secara sangat berbudi bahasa.', 'order' => 167],
            ['start_time' => 586.3, 'end_time' => 586.96, 'target_text' => 'And guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan cuba teka apa kesannya?', 'order' => 168],
            ['start_time' => 587.06, 'end_time' => 590.08, 'target_text' => 'She might even become interested in the religion of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dia mungkin tertarik untuk mengenali keindahan agama Allah.', 'order' => 169],
            ['start_time' => 590.18, 'end_time' => 591.32, 'target_text' => 'Right or wrong?', 'source_text' => 'Betul atau salah?', 'order' => 170],
            ['start_time' => 591.42, 'end_time' => 598.22, 'target_text' => 'She will say, "These people are very, very respectful and polite." "That\'s what Islam is." Respect, education,', 'source_text' => 'Dia akan berkata, "Orang Islam sangat beradab, berakhlak dan bersopan santun." Itulah keperibadian Islam yang sebenar: hormat, berilmu,', 'order' => 171],
            ['start_time' => 598.32, 'end_time' => 599.86, 'target_text' => 'kindness, while worshipping only Allah.', 'source_text' => 'dan berbuat ihsan, sambil mengabdikan diri hanya kepada Allah.', 'order' => 172],
            ['start_time' => 599.96, 'end_time' => 604.61, 'target_text' => 'What you should be concerned about is making sure that Allah is pleased.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara utama yang patut anda utamakan adalah memastikan keredhaan Allah terpelihara.', 'order' => 173],
            ['start_time' => 604.71, 'end_time' => 608.34, 'target_text' => 'If Allah is pleased, what more do you want?', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya Allah redha kepada anda, apa lagi yang anda dambakan?', 'order' => 174],
            ['start_time' => 608.44, 'end_time' => 609.7, 'target_text' => 'I did something good.', 'source_text' => 'Saya telah melakukan suatu kebaikan.', 'order' => 175],
            ['start_time' => 609.8, 'end_time' => 612.91, 'target_text' => 'Now, in my interactions, perhaps I\'ve made a few mistakes, haven\'t I?', 'source_text' => 'Kini, dalam urusan pergaulan saya, mungkin saya ada melakukan sedikit kesilapan, bukan?', 'order' => 176],
            ['start_time' => 613.01, 'end_time' => 615.82, 'target_text' => 'I went to work, I made a few mistakes.', 'source_text' => 'Saya keluar bekerja, saya mungkin terbuat beberapa kesilapan kecil.', 'order' => 177],
            ['start_time' => 615.92, 'end_time' => 618.18, 'target_text' => 'Perhaps I was a little distracted.', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin fikiran saya sedikit terleka.', 'order' => 178],
            ['start_time' => 618.28, 'end_time' => 621.02, 'target_text' => 'The other day, we went to a restaurant.', 'source_text' => 'Hari itu, kami pergi menjamu selera di sebuah restoran.', 'order' => 179],
            ['start_time' => 621.12, 'end_time' => 626.28, 'target_text' => 'And mashallah, alhamdulillah, la ilaha illallah, the owners were Muslims.', 'source_text' => 'Dan masya-Allah, alhamdulillah, la ilaha illallah, pemilik restoran itu beragama Islam.', 'order' => 180],
            ['start_time' => 626.38, 'end_time' => 626.99, 'target_text' => 'TRUE?', 'source_text' => 'Betul?', 'order' => 181],
            ['start_time' => 627.09, 'end_time' => 629.77, 'target_text' => 'And there was some background music.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ketika itu ada alunan muzik latar berkumandang.', 'order' => 182],
            ['start_time' => 629.87, 'end_time' => 630.71, 'target_text' => 'We didn\'t say anything.', 'source_text' => 'Kami tidak menegur atau berkata apa-apa.', 'order' => 183],
            ['start_time' => 630.81, 'end_time' => 633.07, 'target_text' => 'We just went in and said salaam alaikum.', 'source_text' => 'Kami hanya melangkah masuk dan memberi salam secara mesra.', 'order' => 184],
            ['start_time' => 633.17, 'end_time' => 634.62, 'target_text' => 'We sat down.', 'source_text' => 'Kami pun duduk.', 'order' => 185],
            ['start_time' => 634.72, 'end_time' => 637.98, 'target_text' => 'In a short time, there was no more background music.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak lama kemudian, alunan muzik latar tersebut terus dihentikan.', 'order' => 186],
            ['start_time' => 638.08, 'end_time' => 638.87, 'target_text' => 'What happened?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang berlaku?', 'order' => 187],
            ['start_time' => 638.97, 'end_time' => 639.76, 'target_text' => 'What happened?', 'source_text' => 'Apa sebenarnya yang telah berlaku?', 'order' => 188],
            ['start_time' => 639.86, 'end_time' => 646.35, 'target_text' => 'Just out of respect, I think they decided, you know, these guys with beards came in, maybe we should turn', 'source_text' => 'Semata-mata atas rasa hormat, saya fikir pemiliknya berkata, mereka yang berjanggut ini masuk, mungkin elok kita matikan', 'order' => 189],
            ['start_time' => 646.45, 'end_time' => 646.92, 'target_text' => 'this off.', 'source_text' => 'muzik ini.', 'order' => 190],
            ['start_time' => 647.02, 'end_time' => 651.49, 'target_text' => 'I would have thought that perhaps the Quran would start playing in a little while.', 'source_text' => 'Saya menjangkakan mungkin selepas itu bacaan ayat Al-Quran akan dimainkan menggantikannya.', 'order' => 191],
            ['start_time' => 651.59, 'end_time' => 652.56, 'target_text' => 'But that did n\'t happen.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi perkara itu tidak berlaku.', 'order' => 192],
            ['start_time' => 652.66, 'end_time' => 653.32, 'target_text' => 'The food arrived.', 'source_text' => 'Makanan yang dipesan pun sampai.', 'order' => 193],
            ['start_time' => 653.42, 'end_time' => 654.52, 'target_text' => 'It was pretty good.', 'source_text' => 'Rasanya sungguh enak.', 'order' => 194],
            ['start_time' => 654.62, 'end_time' => 655.86, 'target_text' => 'I didn\'t ask anything.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tidak meminta atau menuntut apa-apa.', 'order' => 195],
            ['start_time' => 655.96, 'end_time' => 658.88, 'target_text' => 'Nobody asked for anything to be turned off.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada siapa pun antara kami yang menyuruh muzik itu dimatikan.', 'order' => 196],
            ['start_time' => 658.98, 'end_time' => 664.19, 'target_text' => 'Often, we don\'t even notice the background music until someone says, " Can you hear what\'s going on?" I said', 'source_text' => 'Kerap kali kita sendiri tidak menyedari adanya muzik latar sehingga ada orang berkata, "Kamu dengar tak lagu apa yang sedang berkumandang?" Saya menjawab,', 'order' => 197],
            ['start_time' => 664.29, 'end_time' => 668.56, 'target_text' => ', "Brother, why did you say that?" I didn\'t hear it until you told me, you know?', 'source_text' => '"Saudaraku, mengapa kamu bangkitkan perkara itu? Saya tidak perasan langsung sehinggalah kamu beritahu saya."', 'order' => 198],
            ['start_time' => 668.66, 'end_time' => 670.28, 'target_text' => '"Our minds are preoccupied with something.', 'source_text' => 'Fikiran kita sebenarnya sedang menumpukan perhatian kepada perkara lain.', 'order' => 199],
            ['start_time' => 670.38, 'end_time' => 671.79, 'target_text' => 'Many times we don\'t hear things.', 'source_text' => 'Sering kali kita langsung tidak menghiraukan bunyi di sekeliling.', 'order' => 200],
            ['start_time' => 671.89, 'end_time' => 677.97, 'target_text' => 'And when you draw our attention to it, then we notice it." Oh, oh, why did you tell me that?', 'source_text' => 'Dan apabila kamu menarik perhatian kami kepadanya, barulah kami tersedar." Wahai sahabat, kenapalah kamu beritahu saya hal itu?', 'order' => 201],
            ['start_time' => 678.07, 'end_time' => 678.67, 'target_text' => '"That\'s right.', 'source_text' => '"Betul juga kata tuan.', 'order' => 202],
            ['start_time' => 678.77, 'end_time' => 684.41, 'target_text' => 'But in all of that, some people sometimes, due to peer', 'source_text' => 'Namun di sebalik semua itu, sesetengah insan kadangkala akibat terpengaruh dengan rakan', 'order' => 203],
            ['start_time' => 684.51, 'end_time' => 689.31, 'target_text' => 'pressure, societal pressure, community pressure, or pressure from those around them, end up doing bad things', 'source_text' => 'sebaya, tekanan masyarakat, komuniti, atau desakan orang sekeliling, akhirnya terjerumus melakukan perbuatan mungkar', 'order' => 204],
            ['start_time' => 689.41, 'end_time' => 697.16, 'target_text' => 'like falling into drugs, falling into addiction, acquiring bad habits, and the list goes on.', 'source_text' => 'seperti terjebak dengan dadah, ketagihan arak, tabiat buruk, dan pelbagai lagi senarai keburukan.', 'order' => 205],
            ['start_time' => 697.26, 'end_time' => 703.46, 'target_text' => 'But Allah Almighty, when He loves us, gives us a nudge and brings us back to Him.', 'source_text' => 'Namun Allah Yang Maha Kuasa, apabila Dia menyayangi hamba-Nya, Dia memberi teguran halus dan menarik kita kembali kepada-Nya.', 'order' => 206],
            ['start_time' => 703.56, 'end_time' => 705.72, 'target_text' => 'Today we are sitting here in this place.', 'source_text' => 'Hari ini kita sedang duduk bersama di tempat yang mulia ini.', 'order' => 207],
            ['start_time' => 705.82, 'end_time' => 708.37, 'target_text' => 'Is n\'t it known as the House of Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah tempat ini dikenali sebagai Rumah Allah (masjid)?', 'order' => 208],
            ['start_time' => 708.47, 'end_time' => 711.05, 'target_text' => 'You are sitting here, you are more than welcome.', 'source_text' => 'Anda berada di sini, dan kehadiran anda amat dialu-alukan.', 'order' => 209],
            ['start_time' => 711.15, 'end_time' => 713.4, 'target_text' => 'You are a guest of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Anda adalah tetamu Allah yang dimuliakan.', 'order' => 210],
            ['start_time' => 713.5, 'end_time' => 718.15, 'target_text' => 'We are here, mashallah, not to push you away, but to tell you that this is the right place.', 'source_text' => 'Kami berada di sini, masya-Allah, bukan untuk menjauhkan anda, tetapi untuk menegaskan bahawa inilah tempat yang sebenar buat anda.', 'order' => 211],
            ['start_time' => 718.25, 'end_time' => 720.09, 'target_text' => 'If you want to come, come here.', 'source_text' => 'Jika anda ingin mencari ketenangan, datanglah ke sini.', 'order' => 212],
            ['start_time' => 720.19, 'end_time' => 725.93, 'target_text' => 'If I could change anything here and now, I would just ask everyone to open their windows, but don\'t worry,', 'source_text' => 'Jika ada sesuatu yang ingin saya minta ubah di sini sekarang, saya cuma ingin meminta agar tingkap dibuka, tetapi jangan risau,', 'order' => 213],
            ['start_time' => 726.03, 'end_time' => 727.17, 'target_text' => 'it\'s not my place.', 'source_text' => 'ini bukan rumah saya peribadi.', 'order' => 214],
            ['start_time' => 727.27, 'end_time' => 727.95, 'target_text' => 'It\'s your place.', 'source_text' => 'Ini adalah masjid anda bersama.', 'order' => 215],
            ['start_time' => 728.05, 'end_time' => 730.08, 'target_text' => 'It\'s up to you to decide what you want to do.', 'source_text' => 'Terpulang kepada anda untuk membuat keputusan terbaik.', 'order' => 216],
            ['start_time' => 730.18, 'end_time' => 731.81, 'target_text' => 'But may Allah Almighty grant us...', 'source_text' => 'Namun semoga Allah Yang Maha Kuasa mengurniakan kita...', 'order' => 217],
            ['start_time' => 731.91, 'end_time' => 735.49, 'target_text' => 'What did you think of my way of saying, \'Guys, it\'s a little hot in here?\'"', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana pandangan anda tentang cara halus saya menyatakan, \'Tuan-tuan, ruang di sini agak panas sedikit?\'"', 'order' => 218],
            ['start_time' => 735.59, 'end_time' => 736.99, 'target_text' => '"Masha', 'source_text' => '"Masya-', 'order' => 219],
            ['start_time' => 737.09, 'end_time' => 738.49, 'target_text' => 'Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Allah.', 'order' => 220],
            ['start_time' => 738.59, 'end_time' => 740.46, 'target_text' => 'Brother, you walked Zimbabwe.', 'source_text' => 'Saudaraku, anda pernah menjelajah negara Zimbabwe.', 'order' => 221],
            ['start_time' => 740.56, 'end_time' => 743.47, 'target_text' => 'Yes, Zimbabwe is much cooler than this, my dear brother.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, cuaca di Zimbabwe jauh lebih sejuk dan nyaman berbanding di sini, saudaraku yang dikasihi.', 'order' => 222],
            ['start_time' => 743.57, 'end_time' => 748.96, 'target_text' => 'Now, uh, the inside of buildings, masha Allah, is much, much cooler.', 'source_text' => 'Sekarang, suasana di dalam bangunan di sana, masya-Allah, jauh lebih sejuk.', 'order' => 223],
            ['start_time' => 749.06, 'end_time' => 749.86, 'target_text' => 'Allahumma barik.', 'source_text' => 'Allahumma barik (Semoga Allah memberkati).', 'order' => 224],
            ['start_time' => 749.96, 'end_time' => 751.79, 'target_text' => 'But the outside is a bit...', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi suasana di luar pula agak...', 'order' => 225],
            ['start_time' => 751.89, 'end_time' => 757.46, 'target_text' => 'it \'s cooler outside here, but what good is it to be so cool outside at this time of night when we\'re sweating', 'source_text' => 'udara di luar Aberdeen ini memang sejuk, namun apa gunanya sejuk di luar pada waktu malam begini jika kita berpeluh', 'order' => 226],
            ['start_time' => 757.56, 'end_time' => 757.93, 'target_text' => 'inside?', 'source_text' => 'di bahagian dalam masjid?', 'order' => 227],
            ['start_time' => 757.94, 'end_time' => 758.57, 'target_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahul musta\'an (Kepada Allah jua tempat memohon pertolongan).', 'order' => 228],
            ['start_time' => 758.67, 'end_time' => 761.45, 'target_text' => 'Because of the number of people, and do you know why we\'re sweating?', 'source_text' => 'Ini kerana ramainya para jemaah yang hadir, dan tahukah anda mengapa kita berpeluh?', 'order' => 229],
            ['start_time' => 761.55, 'end_time' => 763.3, 'target_text' => 'Let me tell you why.', 'source_text' => 'Biar saya beritahu puncanya.', 'order' => 230],
            ['start_time' => 763.4, 'end_time' => 765.82, 'target_text' => 'Because of the warmth of our hearts.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana kehangatan kasih sayang yang terpancar dari hati kita semua.', 'order' => 231],
            ['start_time' => 765.92, 'end_time' => 767.02, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 232],
            ['start_time' => 767.12, 'end_time' => 768.78, 'target_text' => 'Warmth of hearts.', 'source_text' => 'Kehangatan tautan hati.', 'order' => 233],
            ['start_time' => 768.88, 'end_time' => 770.75, 'target_text' => 'Lovely people, radiant faces.', 'source_text' => 'Masyarakat yang penyayang, wajah-wajah yang berseri keimanan.', 'order' => 234],
            ['start_time' => 770.85, 'end_time' => 773.34, 'target_text' => 'Did that make a difference, boys?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah tiupan angin itu memberi perbezaan yang selesa, anak-anak muda sekalian?', 'order' => 235],
            ['start_time' => 773.44, 'end_time' => 776.45, 'target_text' => 'Air conditioning in the Arabian summer.', 'source_text' => 'Bagaikan pendingin hawa di tengah musim panas padang pasir.', 'order' => 236],
            ['start_time' => 776.55, 'end_time' => 777.01, 'target_text' => 'Eh?', 'source_text' => 'Bukan?', 'order' => 237],
            ['start_time' => 777.11, 'end_time' => 777.51, 'target_text' => 'Beautiful.', 'source_text' => 'Alhamdulillah sangat menyamankan.', 'order' => 238],
            ['start_time' => 777.57, 'end_time' => 778.39, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 239],
            ['start_time' => 778.49, 'end_time' => 779.0, 'target_text' => 'Tabarak Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Tabarakallah.', 'order' => 240],
            ['start_time' => 779.1, 'end_time' => 781.08, 'target_text' => 'Now, why did I say what I said?', 'source_text' => 'Sekarang, mengapakah saya menyampaikan teguran dengan cara sebegitu?', 'order' => 241],
            ['start_time' => 781.18, 'end_time' => 781.88, 'target_text' => 'Do you know?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda sebabnya?', 'order' => 242],
            ['start_time' => 781.98, 'end_time' => 783.31, 'target_text' => 'Because I\'m your brother.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana saya adalah saudara anda.', 'order' => 243],
            ['start_time' => 783.41, 'end_time' => 785.03, 'target_text' => 'In some cases, your younger brother.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi sesetengah anda, saya adalah adik anda.', 'order' => 244],
            ['start_time' => 785.13, 'end_time' => 786.62, 'target_text' => 'In other cases, your older brother.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi sesetengah yang lain, saya adalah abang anda.', 'order' => 245],
            ['start_time' => 786.72, 'end_time' => 791.54, 'target_text' => 'If I hadn\'t opened my mouth, I would have finished the whole talk regretting why I didn\'t say that They opened', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya tidak bersuara, saya mungkin menamatkan seluruh ceramah ini dalam keadaan menyesal mengapa saya tidak meminta agar mereka membuka', 'order' => 246],
            ['start_time' => 791.64, 'end_time' => 792.04, 'target_text' => 'the windows.', 'source_text' => 'tingkap masjid.', 'order' => 247],
            ['start_time' => 792.13, 'end_time' => 795.58, 'target_text' => 'So I had to say it in a very diplomatic way.', 'source_text' => 'Maka saya perlu menyampaikannya secara sangat berhemah dan diplomasi.', 'order' => 248],
            ['start_time' => 795.68, 'end_time' => 796.56, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 249],
            ['start_time' => 796.66, 'end_time' => 797.7, 'target_text' => 'Very technical.', 'source_text' => 'Pendekatan yang sangat halus.', 'order' => 250],
            ['start_time' => 797.8, 'end_time' => 801.44, 'target_text' => 'But didn\'t it make them open the windows?', 'source_text' => 'Namun bukankah akhirnya mereka membuka tingkap tersebut?', 'order' => 251],
            ['start_time' => 801.54, 'end_time' => 801.98, 'target_text' => 'Alhamdulillah.', 'source_text' => 'Alhamdulillah.', 'order' => 252],
            ['start_time' => 802.08, 'end_time' => 803.57, 'target_text' => 'So it worked.', 'source_text' => 'Maka kaedah itu membuahkan hasil.', 'order' => 253],
            ['start_time' => 803.67, 'end_time' => 809.19, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why I say that sometimes when we tell them something, they may not realize how we\'re saying it, but', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah saya katakan bahawa kadangkala apabila kita menegur seseorang, mereka mungkin tidak sedar bagaimana cara kita menyampaikannya, tetapi', 'order' => 254],
            ['start_time' => 809.29, 'end_time' => 811.36, 'target_text' => 'we arrive at the same end result.', 'source_text' => 'kita berjaya mencapai matlamat dan keputusan akhir yang sama.', 'order' => 255],
            ['start_time' => 811.46, 'end_time' => 812.49, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what\'s important.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah perkara yang paling penting.', 'order' => 256],
            ['start_time' => 812.59, 'end_time' => 813.92, 'target_text' => 'The end result is what matters.', 'source_text' => 'Hasil akhir dan natijah yang dicapai itulah yang utama.', 'order' => 257],
            ['start_time' => 814.02, 'end_time' => 815.26, 'target_text' => 'How I said it is different.', 'source_text' => 'Kaedah penyampaian saya mungkin berbeza.', 'order' => 258],
            ['start_time' => 815.36, 'end_time' => 820.13, 'target_text' => 'You\'ll hear from all the scholars and from those who want to remind you to Allah that you should pray five', 'source_text' => 'Anda akan mendengar daripada seluruh para alim ulama dan pendakwah yang mengingatkan anda kepada Allah tentang kewajipan solat lima', 'order' => 259],
            ['start_time' => 820.23, 'end_time' => 820.87, 'target_text' => 'times a day.', 'source_text' => 'waktu sehari semalam.', 'order' => 260],
            ['start_time' => 820.97, 'end_time' => 824.52, 'target_text' => 'But each one will use a different method to tell you the exact same thing.', 'source_text' => 'Namun setiap seorang daripada mereka menggunakan pendekatan berbeza untuk menyampaikan mesej yang sama persis.', 'order' => 261],
            ['start_time' => 824.62, 'end_time' => 826.55, 'target_text' => 'The idea is to arrive at the end result.', 'source_text' => 'Tujuannya adalah memastikan matlamat akhir itu tercapai.', 'order' => 262],
            ['start_time' => 826.65, 'end_time' => 829.89, 'target_text' => 'Do you know what the ultimate end result is for a moment?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apakah kemuncak matlamat akhir bagi setiap insan beriman?', 'order' => 263],
            ['start_time' => 829.99, 'end_time' => 830.6, 'target_text' => 'Say it.', 'source_text' => 'Sebutlah ia bersama-sama.', 'order' => 264],
            ['start_time' => 830.7, 'end_time' => 831.64, 'target_text' => 'Jannatul Firdaus.', 'source_text' => 'Jannatul Firdaus.', 'order' => 265],
            ['start_time' => 831.74, 'end_time' => 835.5, 'target_text' => 'Jannatul Firdaus, one of the only places better than Aberdeen.', 'source_text' => 'Jannatul Firdaus, satu-satunya tempat yang jauh lebih indah dan hebat daripada Aberdeen.', 'order' => 266],
            ['start_time' => 835.61, 'end_time' => 836.32, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 267],
            ['start_time' => 836.42, 'end_time' => 837.95, 'target_text' => 'May Allah protect you.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah sentiasa merahmati dan memelihara anda.', 'order' => 268],
            ['start_time' => 838.05, 'end_time' => 841.5, 'target_text' => 'I see the boys are smiling because they don\'t agree with me, right?', 'source_text' => 'Saya nampak anak-anak muda tersenyum kerana mungkin kurang bersetuju dengan gurauan saya, bukan?', 'order' => 269],
            ['start_time' => 841.6, 'end_time' => 845.17, 'target_text' => 'There are many other more beautiful places, but inshallah, for me, it\'s something great.', 'source_text' => 'Banyak lagi tempat yang indah di dunia ini, tetapi insya-Allah bagi saya, berada di sini bersama anda adalah sesuatu yang amat bermakna.', 'order' => 270],
            ['start_time' => 845.27, 'end_time' => 848.0, 'target_text' => 'Because it\'s not like I come to Aberdeen all the time.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana bukannya selalu saya berpeluang menjejakkan kaki ke Aberdeen ini.', 'order' => 271],
            ['start_time' => 848.1, 'end_time' => 849.03, 'target_text' => 'Masha Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 272],
            ['start_time' => 849.13, 'end_time' => 856.66, 'target_text' => 'But, nevertheless, I was saying that sometimes we develop bad habits and get into things we\'re not happy with,', 'source_text' => 'Namun demikian, tadi saya ada menyebut bahawa kadangkala kita terjebak dengan tabiat buruk dan terjerumus ke dalam perkara yang kita sesali,', 'order' => 273],
            ['start_time' => 856.76, 'end_time' => 857.97, 'target_text' => 'as time goes on.', 'source_text' => 'seiring berlalunya masa.', 'order' => 274],
            ['start_time' => 858.07, 'end_time' => 864.09, 'target_text' => 'At some point, because of our friends who might be involved in addictions and various other distractions, we', 'source_text' => 'Pada satu saat, akibat pengaruh rakan-rakan yang mungkin terjebak dengan ketagihan dan pelbagai kelalaian dunia, kita', 'order' => 275],
            ['start_time' => 864.19, 'end_time' => 865.32, 'target_text' => 'get happy.', 'source_text' => 'menyangka diri kita bahagia berseronok.', 'order' => 276],
            ['start_time' => 865.42, 'end_time' => 874.56, 'target_text' => 'And we don\'t realize that Allah Almighty, by His favor and mercy, will bring us back to His home because we', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita tidak menyedari bahawa Allah Yang Maha Esa, dengan limpah kurnia dan rahmat-Nya, akan memimpin kita kembali ke rumah-Nya kerana kita', 'order' => 277],
            ['start_time' => 874.66, 'end_time' => 878.45, 'target_text' => 'have a spark of faith in our hearts.', 'source_text' => 'masih mempunyai sekelumit bibit keimanan di dalam sanubari.', 'order' => 278],
            ['start_time' => 878.55, 'end_time' => 885.42, 'target_text' => 'You know there\'s a Hadith where the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, says that a time will', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda terdapat sebuah hadis di mana Rasulullah SAW bersabda bahawa akan tiba suatu saat di mana...', 'order' => 279],
            ['start_time' => 885.52, 'end_time' => 885.82, 'target_text' => 'come when...', 'source_text' => 'ketika...', 'order' => 280],
            ['start_time' => 885.83, 'end_time' => 887.36, 'target_text' => 'could you move aside a little?', 'source_text' => 'bolehkah anda beralih sedikit ke tepi?', 'order' => 281],
            ['start_time' => 887.46, 'end_time' => 891.15, 'target_text' => 'Because every day we deal with this movement, and everyone complains that the video cuts out.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana setiap hari kami menghadapi masalah pergerakan ini, dan para penonton mengadu rakaman video terhalang.', 'order' => 282],
            ['start_time' => 891.25, 'end_time' => 892.97, 'target_text' => 'So you have to move aside a little.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu anda perlu beralih sedikit ke tepi.', 'order' => 283],
            ['start_time' => 893.07, 'end_time' => 902.94, 'target_text' => 'But my beloved brothers, there\'s a Hadith that says that Allah Almighty will instruct the angels at that time', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi wahai saudaraku yang dikasihi, ada sebuah hadis yang menyatakan bahawa Allah Yang Maha Kuasa akan memerintahkan para malaikat pada hari kiamat', 'order' => 284],
            ['start_time' => 903.04, 'end_time' => 910.03, 'target_text' => 'to say: Take out of Jahannam anyone who has even the weight of an atom of faith.', 'source_text' => 'dengan berfirman: Keluarkanlah dari neraka Jahanam sesiapa sahaja yang di dalam hatinya ada iman walau sebesar zarah.', 'order' => 285],
            ['start_time' => 910.13, 'end_time' => 915.75, 'target_text' => 'So We have faith, Allah will bring us to His House according to His will.', 'source_text' => 'Maka selagi kita memiliki iman, Allah pasti memandu kita kembali ke rumah-Nya mengikut kehendak dan izin-Nya.', 'order' => 286],
            ['start_time' => 915.85, 'end_time' => 920.55, 'target_text' => 'And I always say, my brother, when you do something wrong, my beloved sister, when you have sinned against', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya sering berpesan, saudaraku, apabila anda terlanjur melakukan kesilapan, dan saudariku yang dikasihi, apabila anda berdosa kepada', 'order' => 287],
            ['start_time' => 920.65, 'end_time' => 925.3, 'target_text' => 'Allah, if you have a feeling of remorse in your heart, it is a sign that you are a believer.', 'source_text' => 'Allah, sekiranya timbul rasa penyesalan di dalam hati anda, ketahuilah bahawa itu petanda kukuh bahawa anda seorang yang beriman.', 'order' => 288],
            ['start_time' => 925.4, 'end_time' => 929.56, 'target_text' => 'Because if you were not a believer, why would you repent?', 'source_text' => 'Kerana jika anda bukan seorang mukmin, mengapakah hati anda terdorong untuk bertaubat?', 'order' => 289],
            ['start_time' => 929.66, 'end_time' => 931.42, 'target_text' => 'What', 'source_text' => 'Apakah', 'order' => 290],
            ['start_time' => 931.52, 'end_time' => 933.29, 'target_text' => 'is', 'source_text' => 'itu', 'order' => 291],
            ['start_time' => 933.39, 'end_time' => 935.15, 'target_text' => 'repentance?', 'source_text' => 'penyesalan taubat?', 'order' => 292],
            ['start_time' => 935.25, 'end_time' => 937.02, 'target_text' => 'Mu\'im.', 'source_text' => 'Ciri seorang mukmin sejati.', 'order' => 293],
            ['start_time' => 937.12, 'end_time' => 942.84, 'target_text' => 'If your good deed makes you a little happy, you know, when you get up early for Fajr prayer, Tahajud, you', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya amalan kebajikan anda membahagiakan hati anda, contohnya apabila anda bangun awal menunaikan solat Subuh, solat Tahajud, anda', 'order' => 294],
            ['start_time' => 942.94, 'end_time' => 946.33, 'target_text' => 'did something good, you gave charity, you went to Mecca for Umrah, etc.', 'source_text' => 'melakukan kebaikan, bersedekah, menunaikan umrah di Makkah, dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 295],
            ['start_time' => 946.43, 'end_time' => 952.99, 'target_text' => 'If that makes you feel happy inside, content and fulfilled, and your bad deed makes you feel remorse and sadness,', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya perkara itu membuatkan hati anda berasa lapang, tenang dan gembira, manakala perbuatan dosa menimbulkan rasa sesal dan dukacita,', 'order' => 296],
            ['start_time' => 953.09, 'end_time' => 955.39, 'target_text' => 'that is a sign that you are a believer.', 'source_text' => 'maka itulah bukti jelas bahawa anda adalah seorang yang beriman.', 'order' => 297],
            ['start_time' => 955.5, 'end_time' => 956.85, 'target_text' => 'There is responsibility within you.', 'source_text' => 'Wujud rasa tanggungjawab keimanan yang hidup di dalam jiwa anda.', 'order' => 298],
            ['start_time' => 956.95, 'end_time' => 958.52, 'target_text' => 'That is why you feel that way.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah sebabnya anda merasai getaran perasaan tersebut.', 'order' => 299],
            ['start_time' => 958.62, 'end_time' => 964.23, 'target_text' => 'If there were no responsibility within you, Subhanallah, you would not need to feel good or bad about anything.', 'source_text' => 'Jika tiada secebis keimanan dan tanggungjawab di dalam jiwa anda, subhanallah, anda tidak akan peduli sama ada perbuatan anda baik atau buruk.', 'order' => 300],
            ['start_time' => 964.33, 'end_time' => 970.5, 'target_text' => 'So, my beloved brothers and sisters, Allah brings you to His House and you are sitting here with all the', 'source_text' => 'Maka, wahai saudara-saudariku yang dikasihi, Allah telah memimpin anda ke Rumah-Nya dan anda duduk bersama di sini dengan semua', 'order' => 301],
            ['start_time' => 970.6, 'end_time' => 974.31, 'target_text' => 'people of the same City or town and mashallah, what are we listening to?', 'source_text' => 'penduduk dari bandar yang sama ini, dan masya-Allah, apakah yang sedang kita dengarkan bersama?', 'order' => 302],
            ['start_time' => 974.41, 'end_time' => 978.5, 'target_text' => 'We are listening to someone saying to us, " Come, let\'s go to Allah together." Come.', 'source_text' => 'Kita sedang mendengar seseorang menyeru kepada kita, "Marilah kita kembali kepada Allah bersama-sama." Marilah.', 'order' => 303],
            ['start_time' => 978.6, 'end_time' => 980.4, 'target_text' => 'I have weaknesses, you have weaknesses.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ada kelemahan diri, anda juga ada kelemahan diri.', 'order' => 304],
            ['start_time' => 980.5, 'end_time' => 985.5, 'target_text' => 'I have sinned, you have sinned, but surely, shouldn\'t', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah melakukan dosa, anda juga pernah berbuat dosa, namun wajarkah', 'order' => 305],
            ['start_time' => 986.93, 'end_time' => 988.73, 'target_text' => 'we', 'source_text' => 'kita', 'order' => 306],
            ['start_time' => 990.16, 'end_time' => 991.96, 'target_text' => 'stop', 'source_text' => 'menghentikan', 'order' => 307],
            ['start_time' => 993.39, 'end_time' => 995.19, 'target_text' => 'that', 'source_text' => 'dosa itu', 'order' => 308],
            ['start_time' => 996.62, 'end_time' => 998.42, 'target_text' => 'now?', 'source_text' => 'sekarang juga?', 'order' => 309],
            ['start_time' => 999.86, 'end_time' => 1001.43, 'target_text' => 'Is n\'t it time?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah sudah tiba masanya?', 'order' => 310],
            ['start_time' => 1001.53, 'end_time' => 1007.78, 'target_text' => 'Isn\'t it time for believers, for their hearts to turn to Allah, to revelation and truth?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah sudah sampai waktunya bagi orang-orang yang beriman, agar hati mereka tunduk mengingati Allah, wahyu dan kebenaran?', 'order' => 311],
            ['start_time' => 1007.88, 'end_time' => 1009.3, 'target_text' => 'Is n\'t it time?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah sudah tiba ketikanya?', 'order' => 312],
            ['start_time' => 1009.4, 'end_time' => 1010.78, 'target_text' => 'What are you waiting for?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah lagi yang anda tunggu-tunggukan?', 'order' => 313],
            ['start_time' => 1010.88, 'end_time' => 1013.89, 'target_text' => 'How much longer do you want to wait before returning to Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa lama lagi anda mahu bertangguh sebelum kembali bertaubat kepada Allah?', 'order' => 314],
            ['start_time' => 1013.99, 'end_time' => 1020.24, 'target_text' => 'Come slowly but surely if necessary, but make sure that the movement is in the right direction, not the wrong', 'source_text' => 'Melangkahlah perlahan-lahan tetapi pasti sekiranya perlu, namun pastikan langkah itu menuju ke arah yang benar, bukan ke arah', 'order' => 315],
            ['start_time' => 1020.34, 'end_time' => 1020.73, 'target_text' => 'direction.', 'source_text' => 'yang salah.', 'order' => 316],
            ['start_time' => 1020.74, 'end_time' => 1023.28, 'target_text' => 'You are struggling with your prayer, guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Anda sedang bergelut untuk menjaga solat fardu anda, cuba teka apa hakikatnya?', 'order' => 317],
            ['start_time' => 1023.38, 'end_time' => 1026.2, 'target_text' => 'We all have our struggles.', 'source_text' => 'Kita semua ada ujian dan kepayahan masing-masing.', 'order' => 318],
            ['start_time' => 1026.3, 'end_time' => 1031.63, 'target_text' => 'But weakness would be going from four to three and from three to two—that is a loss.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi kelemahan yang nyata adalah apabila daripada empat waktu merosot ke tiga waktu, dan dari tiga waktu turun ke dua waktu—itu adalah satu kerugian besar.', 'order' => 319],
            ['start_time' => 1031.73, 'end_time' => 1039.21, 'target_text' => 'Successful is the one who, from two, when struggling, goes to three because of their dedication and love of', 'source_text' => 'Orang yang berjaya adalah mereka yang bermula daripada dua waktu, walau bersusah-payah, meningkat ke tiga waktu atas dasar iltizam dan kecintaan kepada', 'order' => 320],
            ['start_time' => 1039.31, 'end_time' => 1039.72, 'target_text' => 'Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Allah.', 'order' => 321],
            ['start_time' => 1039.82, 'end_time' => 1047.05, 'target_text' => 'My beloved children, my beloved youth, my mothers, my sisters, my brothers, My elders, whoever they may be,', 'source_text' => 'Wahai anak-anakku, para pemuda, para ibu, saudara-saudariku, dan para warga emas sekalian,', 'order' => 322],
            ['start_time' => 1047.15, 'end_time' => 1048.8, 'target_text' => 'let us do better than yesterday.', 'source_text' => 'marilah kita berusaha menjadi lebih baik daripada hari kelmarin.', 'order' => 323],
            ['start_time' => 1048.9, 'end_time' => 1051.06, 'target_text' => 'Let us always strive to be stronger.', 'source_text' => 'Marilah kita sentiasa bertekad membina kekuatan iman.', 'order' => 324],
            ['start_time' => 1051.16, 'end_time' => 1057.37, 'target_text' => 'It is very sad to see people sometimes; they are close to Allah and then they distance themselves.', 'source_text' => 'Sungguh menyedihkan melihat ada insan yang pada mulanya begitu dekat dengan Allah, namun kemudian menjauhkan diri mereka.', 'order' => 325],
            ['start_time' => 1057.47, 'end_time' => 1059.02, 'target_text' => 'That is not a good sign.', 'source_text' => 'Itu bukan petanda yang baik.', 'order' => 326],
            ['start_time' => 1059.12, 'end_time' => 1064.66, 'target_text' => 'I say that if you are going to sin, do not encourage others to sin, because you might abandon the sin at', 'source_text' => 'Saya berpesan sekiranya anda terlanjur berbuat dosa, jangan sesekali menghasut orang lain melakukan dosa yang sama, kerana anda mungkin bertaubat', 'order' => 327],
            ['start_time' => 1064.77, 'end_time' => 1072.41, 'target_text' => 'some point, and those you encouraged might become a sadaka in the wrong sense.', 'source_text' => 'pada suatu ketika nanti, sedangkan mereka yang anda hasut akan menjadi \'sedekah jariah\' pada jalan yang salah.', 'order' => 328],
            ['start_time' => 1072.51, 'end_time' => 1074.2, 'target_text' => 'What is a sadaka in the wrong sense?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah maksud \'sedekah jariah\' pada jalan yang salah?', 'order' => 329],
            ['start_time' => 1074.3, 'end_time' => 1079.76, 'target_text' => 'In the same way that I would receive a reward for doing a good deed, I will also be a sinner for doing', 'source_text' => 'Sebagaimana saya beroleh pahala apabila melakukan amalan soleh, saya juga akan menanggung dosa apabila melakukan', 'order' => 330],
            ['start_time' => 1079.86, 'end_time' => 1084.91, 'target_text' => 'a bad one, but if my good deed encouraged others to do good, I will continue to receive a good deed as long', 'source_text' => 'kemungkaran. Namun jika amalan baik saya mendorong orang lain berbuat kebaikan, pahala kebaikan itu akan terus mengalir kepada saya selagi', 'order' => 331],
            ['start_time' => 1085.01, 'end_time' => 1086.47, 'target_text' => 'as they do good.', 'source_text' => 'mereka terus beramal soleh.', 'order' => 332],
            ['start_time' => 1086.57, 'end_time' => 1094.08, 'target_text' => 'And if my bad deed encouraged others to do bad, I will continue to receive a sin as long as they do bad', 'source_text' => 'Dan sekiranya perbuatan maksiat saya mendorong orang lain berbuat jahat, dosa kejahatan itu akan terus mengalir selagi mereka melakukannya', 'order' => 333],
            ['start_time' => 1094.18, 'end_time' => 1097.01, 'target_text' => 'because they saw me.', 'source_text' => 'kerana mereka mencontohi perbuatan saya.', 'order' => 334],
            ['start_time' => 1107.26, 'end_time' => 1112.39, 'target_text' => 'A very frightening hadith where the Prophet says, first, speaks of those who set a good example; they receive', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat hadis yang sangat menggetarkan jiwa di mana Rasulullah SAW mula-mula menyebut tentang mereka yang memulakan sunnah teladan yang baik; mereka beroleh', 'order' => 335],
            ['start_time' => 1112.49, 'end_time' => 1118.34, 'target_text' => 'a reward for the deed they performed and they receive a reward for all those who followed that good deed.', 'source_text' => 'pahala amalan mereka sendiri berserta pahala semua orang yang mencontohi amalan kebajikan tersebut.', 'order' => 336],
            ['start_time' => 1118.44, 'end_time' => 1121.11, 'target_text' => 'But those who set a bad example, they receive a sin.', 'source_text' => 'Sebaliknya mereka yang memulakan contoh teladan yang buruk, mereka memikul dosa perbuatan mereka.', 'order' => 337],
            ['start_time' => 1121.21, 'end_time' => 1126.64, 'target_text' => 'Because of that particular example they set, they receive a sin for all who followed them.', 'source_text' => 'Dan disebabkan teladan buruk yang dimulakan itu, mereka turut memikul dosa semua orang yang mengikutinya.', 'order' => 338],
            ['start_time' => 1126.74, 'end_time' => 1134.83, 'target_text' => 'So I say, my brothers, when you\'re smoking your marijuana, feel in your heart: I need to quit this habit.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu saya tegaskan, saudaraku, sekiranya anda sedang menghisap ganja, sematkanlah azam di dalam hati: Aku wajib meninggalkan tabiat buruk ini.', 'order' => 339],
            ['start_time' => 1134.93, 'end_time' => 1138.95, 'target_text' => 'But never call out to other young people who are innocent and do nothing, saying, " Guys, do you know what', 'source_text' => 'Namun jangan sesekali anda mengajak anak-anak muda lain yang suci dan tidak berdosa dengan berkata, "Kawan-kawan, kamu tahu tak', 'order' => 340],
            ['start_time' => 1139.05, 'end_time' => 1139.74, 'target_text' => 'this is all about?', 'source_text' => 'tentang kenikmatan benda ini?', 'order' => 341],
            ['start_time' => 1139.84, 'end_time' => 1140.78, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s try it, guys.', 'source_text' => 'Marilah kita cuba bersama-sama.', 'order' => 342],
            ['start_time' => 1140.88, 'end_time' => 1141.85, 'target_text' => 'It\'s pretty good.', 'source_text' => 'Benda ini sangat menyeronokkan.', 'order' => 343],
            ['start_time' => 1141.95, 'end_time' => 1147.1, 'target_text' => 'You know, nobody who smoked marijuana died from the coronavirus." That\'s what they say.', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah kamu, tiada seorang pun penghisap ganja yang mati akibat koronavirus." Itulah dakyah dusta yang mereka sebarkan.', 'order' => 344],
            ['start_time' => 1147.2, 'end_time' => 1151.1, 'target_text' => '"La hawla wala quwwata illa billah." Have you ever heard that?', 'source_text' => '"La hawla wa la quwwata illa billah." Pernahkah anda mendengar alasan karut sebegitu?', 'order' => 345],
            ['start_time' => 1151.2, 'end_time' => 1153.23, 'target_text' => 'I\'m glad you haven\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bersyukur sekiranya anda tidak pernah mendengarnya.', 'order' => 346],
            ['start_time' => 1153.34, 'end_time' => 1155.28, 'target_text' => 'Because it\'s not true.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana dakwaan itu sama sekali dusta.', 'order' => 347],
            ['start_time' => 1155.38, 'end_time' => 1157.77, 'target_text' => 'But that\'s what they claimed to get others to use marijuana.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi itulah tipu daya yang mereka gunakan untuk menjerumuskan orang lain menghisap ganja.', 'order' => 348],
            ['start_time' => 1157.87, 'end_time' => 1162.12, 'target_text' => 'I said, " But why are you using marijuana now all of a sudden?" "They used to hide it, now they say: \'Sheikh,', 'source_text' => 'Saya bertanya, "Mengapakah kamu tiba-tiba menghisap ganja sekarang?" Dahulu mereka menyembunyikannya, kini mereka mengaku secara terbuka: \'Syeikh,', 'order' => 349],
            ['start_time' => 1162.22, 'end_time' => 1166.8, 'target_text' => 'you know, I have a weakness.\'" "I only consume marijuana." "La ilaha illallah." " Keep it away.', 'source_text' => 'tuan tahu saya ada satu kelemahan.\' \'Saya cuma hisap ganja sahaja.\' \'La ilaha illallah.\' Jauhkanlah benda itu.', 'order' => 350],
            ['start_time' => 1166.9, 'end_time' => 1167.71, 'target_text' => 'Who am I?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah saya?', 'order' => 351],
            ['start_time' => 1167.82, 'end_time' => 1168.6, 'target_text' => 'I am not your Lord.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bukannya Tuhan kamu.', 'order' => 352],
            ['start_time' => 1168.7, 'end_time' => 1169.79, 'target_text' => 'Why do you have to tell me?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapakah anda perlu menceritakan maksiat anda kepada saya?', 'order' => 353],
            ['start_time' => 1169.88, 'end_time' => 1171.48, 'target_text' => 'You don\'t have to confess to me.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak perlu membuat pengakuan dosa di hadapan saya.', 'order' => 354],
            ['start_time' => 1171.58, 'end_time' => 1172.45, 'target_text' => 'This is Islam.', 'source_text' => 'Inilah ajaran Islam.', 'order' => 355],
            ['start_time' => 1172.55, 'end_time' => 1175.35, 'target_text' => 'In Islam, confession is only to your Lord, not to anyone else.', 'source_text' => 'Di dalam Islam, pengakuan dosa dan taubat hanyalah ditujukan semata-mata kepada Tuhanmu, bukan kepada mana-mana manusia.', 'order' => 356],
            ['start_time' => 1175.45, 'end_time' => 1175.91, 'target_text' => 'You want help?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda memerlukan bantuan rawatan?', 'order' => 357],
            ['start_time' => 1176.02, 'end_time' => 1178.91, 'target_text' => 'Go and get it, but don\'t come around proudly saying, \'You know what?', 'source_text' => 'Dapatkanlah rawatan pemulihan, tetapi janganlah datang dengan rasa megah sambil berkata, \'Tuan tahu apa?', 'order' => 358],
            ['start_time' => 1179.01, 'end_time' => 1180.0, 'target_text' => 'I only have one addiction.', 'source_text' => 'Saya cuma ada satu sahaja ketagihan.', 'order' => 359],
            ['start_time' => 1180.1, 'end_time' => 1186.15, 'target_text' => 'I\'m addicted to zina.\' You don\'t have to say, \'I just did it.\' That \'I just did it\' is an insult to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ketagih berzina.\' Anda tidak wajar berkata, \'Saya cuma melakukannya secara suka-suka.\' Ungkapan \'suka-suka\' itu sendiri adalah satu penghinaan kepada Allah.', 'order' => 360],
            ['start_time' => 1186.25, 'end_time' => 1187.22, 'target_text' => 'How can you say that?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah tergamak anda berkata begitu?', 'order' => 361],
            ['start_time' => 1187.32, 'end_time' => 1187.87, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a sin.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah satu perbuatan dosa.', 'order' => 362],
            ['start_time' => 1187.97, 'end_time' => 1189.77, 'target_text' => 'It\'s', 'source_text' => 'Ia merupakan', 'order' => 363],
            ['start_time' => 1191.26, 'end_time' => 1192.11, 'target_text' => 'a huge sin.', 'source_text' => 'suatu dosa yang teramat besar.', 'order' => 364],
            ['start_time' => 1192.21, 'end_time' => 1194.54, 'target_text' => 'You think it\'s small, but no, it\'s not.', 'source_text' => 'Anda menyangka ia dosa kecil, walhal hakikatnya ia dosa yang sangat berat.', 'order' => 365],
            ['start_time' => 1194.64, 'end_time' => 1197.61, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why we ask Allah to strengthen us and grant us goodness.', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah kita memohon kepada Allah agar meneguhkan hati kita dan mengurniakan kebaikan.', 'order' => 366],
            ['start_time' => 1197.71, 'end_time' => 1201.97, 'target_text' => 'When you\'ve taken off your hijab, for example, don\'t encourage others to do it.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda misalnya telah menanggalkan hijab, jangan sesekali menghasut wanita lain untuk berbuat demikian.', 'order' => 367],
            ['start_time' => 1202.08, 'end_time' => 1206.89, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t flaunt it or tell people, \'Guys, I took it off because, you know, I don\'t think this or that.\' There', 'source_text' => 'Jangan bermegah atau memberitahu orang lain, \'Saya membukanya kerana bagi saya begini dan begitu.\' Kelak', 'order' => 368],
            ['start_time' => 1206.99, 'end_time' => 1210.18, 'target_text' => 'will be people who had no doubts.', 'source_text' => 'akan ada orang lain yang asalnya tidak ragu-ragu menjadi goyah.', 'order' => 369],
            ['start_time' => 1210.29, 'end_time' => 1216.39, 'target_text' => 'By sowing doubt, one day, 10 years later, and it I\'ve seen it, when you put the hijab back on, but they', 'source_text' => 'Dengan menyemai keraguan itu, suatu hari nanti 10 tahun kemudian—dan saya pernah menyaksikannya sendiri—apabila anda kembali memakai hijab, namun mereka', 'order' => 370],
            ['start_time' => 1216.49, 'end_time' => 1219.76, 'target_text' => 'all went astray because of you, what\'s going to happen?', 'source_text' => 'semua telah tersesat akibat hasutan anda dahulu, apakah yang bakal menimpa anda?', 'order' => 371],
            ['start_time' => 1219.86, 'end_time' => 1223.09, 'target_text' => 'We hope and pray that Allah will forgive you, and that Allah will forgive us all.', 'source_text' => 'Kita sentiasa berharap dan berdoa semoga Allah mengampunkan anda, dan semoga Allah mengampunkan kita semua.', 'order' => 372],
            ['start_time' => 1223.19, 'end_time' => 1228.17, 'target_text' => 'So I have a very, very interesting message for you tonight.', 'source_text' => 'Malam ini saya ada satu pesanan yang sangat penting dan menarik buat anda semua.', 'order' => 373],
            ['start_time' => 1228.27, 'end_time' => 1230.08, 'target_text' => 'I want to change my life.', 'source_text' => 'Aku ingin mengubah kehidupanku.', 'order' => 374],
            ['start_time' => 1230.18, 'end_time' => 1231.78, 'target_text' => 'I want to improve it.', 'source_text' => 'Aku ingin memperbaiki diriku.', 'order' => 375],
            ['start_time' => 1231.88, 'end_time' => 1234.22, 'target_text' => 'I want to get closer to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Aku ingin menghampirkan diri kepada Allah.', 'order' => 376],
            ['start_time' => 1234.33, 'end_time' => 1237.1, 'target_text' => 'Any of us could say this, and we should be saying it.', 'source_text' => 'Setiap seorang daripada kita mampu mengucapkannya, dan memang sepatutnya kita melafazkannya.', 'order' => 377],
            ['start_time' => 1237.2, 'end_time' => 1238.57, 'target_text' => 'I want to be better.', 'source_text' => 'Aku ingin menjadi insan yang lebih baik.', 'order' => 378],
            ['start_time' => 1238.66, 'end_time' => 1239.44, 'target_text' => 'I\'ve committed sins.', 'source_text' => 'Aku pernah bergelumang dengan dosa.', 'order' => 379],
            ['start_time' => 1239.54, 'end_time' => 1241.7, 'target_text' => 'I\'ve done many bad things in my life.', 'source_text' => 'Banyak kesilapan dan perkara buruk yang telah aku lakukan sepanjang hidupku.', 'order' => 380],
            ['start_time' => 1241.8, 'end_time' => 1246.47, 'target_text' => 'I\'m at a point in my life where I feel like I might die at any moment.', 'source_text' => 'Kini aku berada pada satu fasa kehidupan di mana aku merasakan bahawa ajalku boleh tiba pada bila-bila masa sahaja.', 'order' => 381],
            ['start_time' => 1246.57, 'end_time' => 1247.54, 'target_text' => 'You never know.', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak pernah mengetahui bila saat kematian kita.', 'order' => 382],
            ['start_time' => 1247.64, 'end_time' => 1253.39, 'target_text' => 'There are healthy, fit people who go to the gym regularly, who eat healthily, and suddenly, at 35, 40 years', 'source_text' => 'Ada orang yang tubuhnya sangat sihat, cergas bersenam di gimnasium, menjaga pemakanan, namun secara tiba-tiba pada usia 35 atau 40', 'order' => 383],
            ['start_time' => 1253.49, 'end_time' => 1258.34, 'target_text' => 'old, a heart attack, boom, and they\'ve returned to Allah, and you wonder what their condition is.', 'source_text' => 'tahun, terkena serangan jantung lalu menghembuskan nafas terakhir kembali kepada Allah, dan anda tertanya-tanya bagaimana keadaan pengakhiran mereka.', 'order' => 384],
            ['start_time' => 1258.44, 'end_time' => 1261.88, 'target_text' => 'May Allah make it easy for us on the day He calls us.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah memudahkan urusan kita pada hari Dia memanggil kita kembali.', 'order' => 385],
            ['start_time' => 1261.98, 'end_time' => 1270.04, 'target_text' => 'But I need to make sure I improve, because with your intention and the strength and power of your intention,', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi saya mesti memastikan diri saya sentiasa bertambah baik, kerana dengan keikhlasan niat dan keteguhan tekad anda,', 'order' => 386],
            ['start_time' => 1270.14, 'end_time' => 1277.43, 'target_text' => 'Allah will grant you Paradise even if you don\'t You have completed the cycle and the path you intended to', 'source_text' => 'Allah akan mengurniakan syurga kepada anda sekalipun anda belum sempat menamatkan seluruh sasaran amalan yang anda niatkan', 'order' => 387],
            ['start_time' => 1277.53, 'end_time' => 1278.03, 'target_text' => 'finish.', 'source_text' => 'untuk disempurnakan.', 'order' => 388],
            ['start_time' => 1278.13, 'end_time' => 1285.99, 'target_text' => 'If I try to become a Hafiz and I start today, learning a small part each day, progressing, and then one day', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya berniat menjadi seorang hafiz Al-Quran dan bermula hari ini, menghafal sedikit demi sedikit setiap hari secara istiqamah, lalu suatu hari nanti', 'order' => 389],
            ['start_time' => 1286.09, 'end_time' => 1292.4, 'target_text' => 'I die, Allah will write my name among the Huffaz and those who memorized the Quran, even if I only did five', 'source_text' => 'saya meninggal dunia, Allah tetap akan mencatat nama saya dalam kalangan para hafiz yang memelihara Al-Quran, sekalipun saya baru sempat menghafal lima', 'order' => 390],
            ['start_time' => 1292.5, 'end_time' => 1293.22, 'target_text' => 'juz.', 'source_text' => 'juzuk.', 'order' => 391],
            ['start_time' => 1293.32, 'end_time' => 1299.83, 'target_text' => 'As long as the intention was there, I started it, I continued it, and the only thing that stopped me was', 'source_text' => 'Selagi mana niat ikhlas itu wujud, saya telah memulakannya, saya meneruskannya secara berterusan, dan satu-satunya perkara yang menghentikan langkah saya hanyalah', 'order' => 392],
            ['start_time' => 1299.92, 'end_time' => 1300.45, 'target_text' => 'death.', 'source_text' => 'kematian.', 'order' => 393],
            ['start_time' => 1300.55, 'end_time' => 1301.68, 'target_text' => 'Allah will write it for you.', 'source_text' => 'Allah pasti akan mencatatkannya sebagai ganjaran sempurna buat anda.', 'order' => 394],
            ['start_time' => 1301.78, 'end_time' => 1302.58, 'target_text' => 'There is no doubt.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada sebarang keraguan padanya.', 'order' => 395],
            ['start_time' => 1302.68, 'end_time' => 1306.84, 'target_text' => 'Because Allah says that He will judge you by your intentions, and this was the intention.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana Allah menegaskan bahawa Dia menilai hamba-Nya berdasarkan niat mereka, dan itulah niat sebenar anda.', 'order' => 396],
            ['start_time' => 1306.94, 'end_time' => 1312.93, 'target_text' => 'Similarly, when a person comes to salah every day and performs their prayer, say Fajr, in a certain place,', 'source_text' => 'Demikian juga keadaannya bagi seseorang yang melazimi solat berjemaah setiap hari, katakan solat Subuh di masjid,', 'order' => 397],
            ['start_time' => 1313.03, 'end_time' => 1318.61, 'target_text' => 'on a day when they are sick or indisposed, they can do it somewhere else, at home or whatever, but guess', 'source_text' => 'pada hari di mana dia jatuh sakit atau ada keuzuran lalu solat di rumah, cuba teka apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 398],
            ['start_time' => 1318.71, 'end_time' => 1319.09, 'target_text' => 'what?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda?', 'order' => 399],
            ['start_time' => 1319.1, 'end_time' => 1325.02, 'target_text' => 'The angels will write that they attended that particular salah in the mosque, simply because the only thing', 'source_text' => 'Para malaikat tetap akan mencatat pahala solat berjemaah di masjid untuknya, semata-mata kerana satu-satunya perkara', 'order' => 400],
            ['start_time' => 1325.12, 'end_time' => 1328.6, 'target_text' => 'that prevented them from coming was an illness over which they had no control.', 'source_text' => 'yang menghalang mereka daripada hadir ialah penyakit yang di luar kawalan mereka.', 'order' => 401],
            ['start_time' => 1328.69, 'end_time' => 1332.44, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "We will write that deed for you." Who is Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman, "Kami akan mencatat pahala amalan itu untukmu." Siapakah Allah?', 'order' => 402],
            ['start_time' => 1332.54, 'end_time' => 1334.61, 'target_text' => 'Allah is the most honorable.', 'source_text' => 'Allah Maha Mulia.', 'order' => 403],
            ['start_time' => 1334.71, 'end_time' => 1336.37, 'target_text' => 'Allah is the most generous.', 'source_text' => 'Allah Maha Pemurah.', 'order' => 404],
            ['start_time' => 1336.47, 'end_time' => 1337.49, 'target_text' => 'The most generous.', 'source_text' => 'Maha Pemurah.', 'order' => 405],
            ['start_time' => 1337.59, 'end_time' => 1338.46, 'target_text' => 'Do you think you are generous?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda fikir anda seorang yang pemurah?', 'order' => 406],
            ['start_time' => 1338.56, 'end_time' => 1339.8, 'target_text' => 'Do you know what Allah does?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa yang Allah lakukan?', 'order' => 407],
            ['start_time' => 1339.9, 'end_time' => 1345.45, 'target_text' => 'Allah says: "That\'s fine, you have sinned all your life." Then there came a time when you went to Hajj or', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman: "Tidak mengapa, kamu telah berbuat dosa sepanjang hidup kamu." Kemudian tiba suatu masa apabila kamu pergi menunaikan Haji atau', 'order' => 408],
            ['start_time' => 1345.55, 'end_time' => 1350.83, 'target_text' => 'Umrah, or something happened, whatever it was, and you changed your life, you came back and left your sins', 'source_text' => 'Umrah, atau sesuatu telah berlaku, apa jua keadaannya, dan kamu mengubah hidup kamu, kamu kembali dan meninggalkan dosa-dosa kamu', 'order' => 409],
            ['start_time' => 1350.93, 'end_time' => 1351.22, 'target_text' => 'behind.', 'source_text' => 'di belakang.', 'order' => 410],
            ['start_time' => 1351.23, 'end_time' => 1354.57, 'target_text' => 'Nothing made you leave them except Me, that is, Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada apa yang membuatkan kamu meninggalkannya melainkan Aku, iaitu Allah.', 'order' => 411],
            ['start_time' => 1354.67, 'end_time' => 1356.44, 'target_text' => 'Nothing made you leave them except Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada apa yang membuatkan kamu meninggalkannya melainkan Allah.', 'order' => 412],
            ['start_time' => 1356.54, 'end_time' => 1359.69, 'target_text' => 'And you changed your life and began to do good works for My pleasure.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kamu mengubah hidup kamu lalu mula melakukan amalan kebaikan demi keredaan-Ku.', 'order' => 413],
            ['start_time' => 1359.79, 'end_time' => 1362.32, 'target_text' => 'I want to tell you what I\'m going to do for you, a reward.', 'source_text' => 'Aku ingin memberitahu kamu apa yang akan Aku lakukan untuk kamu, sebuah ganjaran.', 'order' => 414],
            ['start_time' => 1362.42, 'end_time' => 1367.73, 'target_text' => '"And in the Quran, Allah tells us: \'I will take those evil deeds and place them on the right side of the', 'source_text' => '"Dan di dalam al-Quran, Allah memberitahu kita: \'Aku akan mengambil amalan-amalan buruk itu dan meletakkannya di sebelah kanan timbangan,', 'order' => 415],
            ['start_time' => 1367.83, 'end_time' => 1374.33, 'target_text' => 'balance, considering them as good deeds, even though they were done as evil.\'" "Is there anyone more generous', 'source_text' => 'menganggapnya sebagai amalan kebaikan, walaupun ia dahulunya dilakukan sebagai kejahatan.\'" "Adakah sesiapa yang lebih pemurah', 'order' => 416],
            ['start_time' => 1374.43, 'end_time' => 1375.74, 'target_text' => 'than Allah?', 'source_text' => 'daripada Allah?', 'order' => 417],
            ['start_time' => 1375.84, 'end_time' => 1377.64, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak.', 'order' => 418],
            ['start_time' => 1397.42, 'end_time' => 1398.78, 'target_text' => 'What a beautiful verse.', 'source_text' => 'Betapa indahnya ayat ini.', 'order' => 419],
            ['start_time' => 1398.88, 'end_time' => 1400.91, 'target_text' => 'Surah al-Furqan, right at the end.', 'source_text' => 'Surah al-Furqan, betul-betul di bahagian akhir.', 'order' => 420],
            ['start_time' => 1401.01, 'end_time' => 1403.77, 'target_text' => 'Allah says: \'O Allah, We will punish those who do evil.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman: \'Wahai hamba-Ku, Kami akan menghukum mereka yang melakukan kejahatan.', 'order' => 421],
            ['start_time' => 1403.87, 'end_time' => 1411.05, 'target_text' => 'We will multiply the punishment for some, but for those who repented and performed good deeds afterward, We', 'source_text' => 'Kami akan melipatgandakan azab bagi sebahagian orang, namun bagi mereka yang bertaubat dan beramal soleh selepas itu, Kami', 'order' => 422],
            ['start_time' => 1411.15, 'end_time' => 1413.74, 'target_text' => 'will turn their evil deeds into good deeds.', 'source_text' => 'akan mengubah amalan buruk mereka menjadi amalan kebaikan.', 'order' => 423],
            ['start_time' => 1413.84, 'end_time' => 1417.2, 'target_text' => 'When you reach the Day of Resurrection, you will see so many good deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila kamu tiba di Hari Kebangkitan, kamu akan melihat begitu banyak amalan kebaikan.', 'order' => 424],
            ['start_time' => 1417.3, 'end_time' => 1424.32, 'target_text' => 'What is this, O Allah?" Allah says: \'You changed your life and returned to Me\'." I had to change all your', 'source_text' => 'Apakah ini, ya Allah?" Allah berfirman: \'Kamu telah mengubah hidupmu dan kembali kepada-Ku\'." Aku perlu mengubah semua', 'order' => 425],
            ['start_time' => 1424.42, 'end_time' => 1429.16, 'target_text' => 'bad deeds into good ones, because the only thing that stopped you from continuing with that was My love and', 'source_text' => 'amalan burukmu menjadi kebaikan, kerana satu-satunya perkara yang menghalangmu daripada meneruskannya adalah cinta-Ku dan', 'order' => 426],
            ['start_time' => 1429.26, 'end_time' => 1431.01, 'target_text' => 'My connection." That\'s all.', 'source_text' => 'hubungan dengan-Ku." Itu sahaja.', 'order' => 427],
            ['start_time' => 1431.11, 'end_time' => 1433.65, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why I give you the reward.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah sebabnya Aku memberimu ganjaran.', 'order' => 428],
            ['start_time' => 1433.75, 'end_time' => 1434.33, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 429],
            ['start_time' => 1434.43, 'end_time' => 1434.97, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 430],
            ['start_time' => 1435.07, 'end_time' => 1435.86, 'target_text' => 'That is Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah Allah.', 'order' => 431],
            ['start_time' => 1435.96, 'end_time' => 1437.56, 'target_text' => 'Now, wouldn\'t we love that?', 'source_text' => 'Sekarang, tidakkah kita mahukan perkara itu?', 'order' => 432],
            ['start_time' => 1437.66, 'end_time' => 1439.49, 'target_text' => 'What is Allah asking of you?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang Allah minta daripada anda?', 'order' => 433],
            ['start_time' => 1439.6, 'end_time' => 1440.48, 'target_text' => 'What does Islam say?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang dikatakan oleh Islam?', 'order' => 434],
            ['start_time' => 1440.59, 'end_time' => 1442.18, 'target_text' => 'Why is there an attack on Islam?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa wujud serangan terhadap Islam?', 'order' => 435],
            ['start_time' => 1442.28, 'end_time' => 1448.36, 'target_text' => 'Because Islam is the only religion that promotes the highest values ​​ and morals.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana Islam adalah satu-satunya agama yang mengangkat nilai dan akhlak yang paling tinggi.', 'order' => 436],
            ['start_time' => 1448.45, 'end_time' => 1453.09, 'target_text' => 'And your connection with your Creator alone, and with the One to whom you will return.', 'source_text' => 'Dan hubungan anda hanya dengan Pencipta anda semata-mata, dan dengan Dia yang kepada-Nya anda akan kembali.', 'order' => 437],
            ['start_time' => 1453.19, 'end_time' => 1455.53, 'target_text' => 'Look, maybe I\'m a famous person.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah, mungkin saya seorang yang terkenal.', 'order' => 438],
            ['start_time' => 1455.63, 'end_time' => 1457.44, 'target_text' => 'I want to tell you something.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ingin memberitahu anda sesuatu.', 'order' => 439],
            ['start_time' => 1457.54, 'end_time' => 1459.12, 'target_text' => 'Fame means nothing.', 'source_text' => 'Kemasyhuran itu tidak membawa apa-apa erti.', 'order' => 440],
            ['start_time' => 1459.22, 'end_time' => 1460.86, 'target_text' => 'It means zero.', 'source_text' => 'Ia bermaksud sifar.', 'order' => 441],
            ['start_time' => 1460.96, 'end_time' => 1464.31, 'target_text' => 'Probably the worst of humanity is also the most famous.', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin manusia yang paling jahat juga adalah yang paling terkenal.', 'order' => 442],
            ['start_time' => 1464.41, 'end_time' => 1465.6, 'target_text' => 'Satan is absolutely famous.', 'source_text' => 'Syaitan memang sangat terkenal.', 'order' => 443],
            ['start_time' => 1465.7, 'end_time' => 1467.6, 'target_text' => 'Do you know that?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda tentang hal itu?', 'order' => 444],
            ['start_time' => 1467.7, 'end_time' => 1469.63, 'target_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakil.', 'source_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakil.', 'order' => 445],
            ['start_time' => 1469.73, 'end_time' => 1471.44, 'target_text' => 'How many of you have heard of Satan?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa ramai daripada anda yang pernah mendengar tentang Syaitan?', 'order' => 446],
            ['start_time' => 1471.54, 'end_time' => 1472.75, 'target_text' => 'Raise your hand.', 'source_text' => 'Angkat tangan anda.', 'order' => 447],
            ['start_time' => 1472.85, 'end_time' => 1474.27, 'target_text' => 'It\'s the whole mosque.', 'source_text' => 'Seluruh masjid mengangkat tangan.', 'order' => 448],
            ['start_time' => 1474.37, 'end_time' => 1476.88, 'target_text' => 'Isn\'t Satan more famous than you and I?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah Syaitan lebih terkenal daripada anda dan saya?', 'order' => 449],
            ['start_time' => 1476.98, 'end_time' => 1479.7, 'target_text' => 'Does that make him a big rock star or something?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah itu menjadikannya bintang rock yang hebat atau sesuatu?', 'order' => 450],
            ['start_time' => 1479.8, 'end_time' => 1480.09, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak.', 'order' => 451],
            ['start_time' => 1480.1, 'end_time' => 1484.04, 'target_text' => 'Some of the people The most famous are among the worst.', 'source_text' => 'Sebahagian daripada orang yang paling terkenal adalah dalam kalangan yang paling jahat.', 'order' => 452],
            ['start_time' => 1484.14, 'end_time' => 1487.61, 'target_text' => 'Therefore, my being famous means nothing in the eyes of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, keterkenalan saya tidak membawa apa-apa erti di sisi Allah.', 'order' => 453],
            ['start_time' => 1487.71, 'end_time' => 1490.32, 'target_text' => 'La yaswa indallah janaha ba\'ud.', 'source_text' => 'La yaswa indallah janaha ba\'ud (Tidak bernilai di sisi Allah walau sebesar sayap nyamuk).', 'order' => 454],
            ['start_time' => 1490.42, 'end_time' => 1492.42, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, I tell you it means nothing.', 'source_text' => 'Wallahi, saya beritahu anda ia tidak membawa apa-apa erti.', 'order' => 455],
            ['start_time' => 1492.52, 'end_time' => 1496.18, 'target_text' => 'If I sit here and attract you to me, I have lost.', 'source_text' => 'Jika saya duduk di sini dan menarik perhatian anda kepada diri saya, saya telah rugi.', 'order' => 456],
            ['start_time' => 1496.28, 'end_time' => 1502.89, 'target_text' => 'But if I sit here and remind you of Allah, only on the Day of Judgment will we see what happened.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi jika saya duduk di sini dan mengingatkan anda kepada Allah, hanya pada Hari Pembalasan kelak kita akan melihat hasilnya.', 'order' => 457],
            ['start_time' => 1502.99, 'end_time' => 1504.43, 'target_text' => 'Only on the Day of Judgment.', 'source_text' => 'Hanya pada Hari Pembalasan.', 'order' => 458],
            ['start_time' => 1504.53, 'end_time' => 1506.85, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t be deceived by likes and followers.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan tertipu dengan tanda suka (likes) dan pengikut (followers).', 'order' => 459],
            ['start_time' => 1506.95, 'end_time' => 1511.78, 'target_text' => 'I tell you this from the position of someone who has many likes and followers.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bercakap ini daripada kedudukan seseorang yang mempunyai banyak tanda suka dan pengikut.', 'order' => 460],
            ['start_time' => 1511.88, 'end_time' => 1515.32, 'target_text' => 'And I want to tell you it means nothing.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya ingin memberitahu anda bahawa semua itu tidak membawa apa-apa erti.', 'order' => 461],
            ['start_time' => 1515.42, 'end_time' => 1522.14, 'target_text' => 'Those who are slaves to likes and followers will never taste contentment on Earth, I guarantee you.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka yang menjadi hamba kepada likes dan followers tidak akan pernah merasai ketenangan di muka bumi, saya jamin anda.', 'order' => 462],
            ['start_time' => 1522.24, 'end_time' => 1528.8, 'target_text' => 'There is not a single moment when Allah says that His contentment lies in likes and followers.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak ada satu detik pun di mana Allah menyatakan bahawa keredaan-Nya terletak pada likes dan followers.', 'order' => 463],
            ['start_time' => 1528.9, 'end_time' => 1531.43, 'target_text' => 'To get likes and followers, do you know what you have to do?', 'source_text' => 'Untuk mendapatkan likes dan followers, tahukah anda apa yang perlu anda lakukan?', 'order' => 464],
            ['start_time' => 1531.53, 'end_time' => 1533.7, 'target_text' => 'You have to do the most absurd things.', 'source_text' => 'Anda terpaksa melakukan perkara yang paling mengarut.', 'order' => 465],
            ['start_time' => 1533.8, 'end_time' => 1534.84, 'target_text' => 'The most absurd things.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara yang paling tidak masuk akal.', 'order' => 466],
            ['start_time' => 1534.94, 'end_time' => 1541.82, 'target_text' => 'You have to follow trends that make no sense and dedicate your whole life to it.', 'source_text' => 'Anda terpaksa mengikut trend yang langsung tidak masuk akal dan mengabdikan seluruh hidup anda untuknya.', 'order' => 467],
            ['start_time' => 1541.92, 'end_time' => 1543.95, 'target_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal Wakil.', 'source_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal Wakil.', 'order' => 468],
            ['start_time' => 1544.05, 'end_time' => 1545.21, 'target_text' => 'Look, the children knew what I was.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah, kanak-kanak tahu apa yang saya sebutkan.', 'order' => 469],
            ['start_time' => 1545.31, 'end_time' => 1546.38, 'target_text' => 'What did I say?', 'source_text' => 'Apa yang saya katakan?', 'order' => 470],
            ['start_time' => 1546.48, 'end_time' => 1548.04, 'target_text' => '67', 'source_text' => '67', 'order' => 471],
            ['start_time' => 1548.14, 'end_time' => 1549.38, 'target_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'order' => 472],
            ['start_time' => 1549.48, 'end_time' => 1550.71, 'target_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'order' => 473],
            ['start_time' => 1550.81, 'end_time' => 1551.53, 'target_text' => 'But what is that?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi apakah bendanya itu?', 'order' => 474],
            ['start_time' => 1551.63, 'end_time' => 1554.41, 'target_text' => 'If I ask them what 67 means, they don\'t know.', 'source_text' => 'Jika saya tanya mereka apa maksud 67, mereka tidak tahu.', 'order' => 475],
            ['start_time' => 1554.51, 'end_time' => 1555.27, 'target_text' => 'Nobody knows.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada siapa yang tahu.', 'order' => 476],
            ['start_time' => 1555.37, 'end_time' => 1558.02, 'target_text' => 'Not even the ones who first said 67.', 'source_text' => 'Malah mereka yang mula-mula menyebut 67 pun tidak tahu.', 'order' => 477],
            ['start_time' => 1558.12, 'end_time' => 1558.96, 'target_text' => 'And guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan teka apa?', 'order' => 478],
            ['start_time' => 1559.06, 'end_time' => 1561.86, 'target_text' => 'In 2027, they plan to say 78.', 'source_text' => 'Pada tahun 2027, mereka merancang untuk menyebut 78 pula.', 'order' => 479],
            ['start_time' => 1561.96, 'end_time' => 1562.84, 'target_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'order' => 480],
            ['start_time' => 1562.94, 'end_time' => 1563.63, 'target_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'order' => 481],
            ['start_time' => 1563.73, 'end_time' => 1564.81, 'target_text' => 'And that\'s life.', 'source_text' => 'Dan itulah kehidupan.', 'order' => 482],
            ['start_time' => 1564.91, 'end_time' => 1567.22, 'target_text' => 'And that\'s how we will continue.', 'source_text' => 'Dan begitulah keadaan kita akan berterusan.', 'order' => 483],
            ['start_time' => 1567.32, 'end_time' => 1572.25, 'target_text' => 'So, as fun as it is, never do it for likes and followers.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, walaupun ia menyeronokkan, jangan sekali-kali melakukannya demi mengejar likes dan followers.', 'order' => 484],
            ['start_time' => 1572.35, 'end_time' => 1576.68, 'target_text' => 'Another thing is, for us today,', 'source_text' => 'Satu perkara lagi, bagi kita pada hari ini,', 'order' => 485],
            ['start_time' => 1577.92, 'end_time' => 1586.57, 'target_text' => 'to gain likes and followers, many people have to be live for a very, very long time.', 'source_text' => 'untuk meraih likes dan followers, ramai orang terpaksa bersiaran langsung (live) untuk tempoh masa yang sangat lama.', 'order' => 486],
            ['start_time' => 1586.67, 'end_time' => 1587.29, 'target_text' => 'But guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi teka apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 487],
            ['start_time' => 1587.39, 'end_time' => 1590.0, 'target_text' => 'You weren\'t live with Allah at the time of the salah.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak bersiaran langsung (terhubung) dengan Allah pada waktu solat.', 'order' => 488],
            ['start_time' => 1590.1, 'end_time' => 1593.23, 'target_text' => 'You weren\'t live with Allah at the moment you needed to be.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak terhubung secara langsung dengan Allah pada saat anda amat memerlukannya.', 'order' => 489],
            ['start_time' => 1593.33, 'end_time' => 1595.3, 'target_text' => 'But you were live with everyone else.', 'source_text' => 'Sebaliknya anda bersiaran langsung dengan orang lain.', 'order' => 490],
            ['start_time' => 1595.4, 'end_time' => 1597.13, 'target_text' => 'Fine, you got a million followers.', 'source_text' => 'Baiklah, anda dapat satu juta pengikut.', 'order' => 491],
            ['start_time' => 1597.23, 'end_time' => 1600.86, 'target_text' => 'Big deal, a big deal for the Will that get you into Paradise?', 'source_text' => 'Hebat sangatkah, adakah kejayaan besar itu akan memasukkan anda ke dalam Syurga?', 'order' => 492],
            ['start_time' => 1600.95, 'end_time' => 1602.58, 'target_text' => 'Absolutely not.', 'source_text' => 'Sama sekali tidak.', 'order' => 493],
            ['start_time' => 1602.68, 'end_time' => 1606.02, 'target_text' => 'Unless you reminded them of goodness.', 'source_text' => 'Melainkan jika anda mengingatkan mereka kepada kebaikan.', 'order' => 494],
            ['start_time' => 1606.12, 'end_time' => 1607.85, 'target_text' => 'Unless you said something good.', 'source_text' => 'Melainkan jika anda menyampaikan sesuatu yang bermanfaat.', 'order' => 495],
            ['start_time' => 1607.95, 'end_time' => 1610.8, 'target_text' => 'Unless you truly were a person of integrity.', 'source_text' => 'Melainkan jika anda benar-benar seorang yang berintegriti.', 'order' => 496],
            ['start_time' => 1610.9, 'end_time' => 1612.38, 'target_text' => 'And you called people to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan anda menyeru manusia ke jalan Allah.', 'order' => 497],
            ['start_time' => 1612.48, 'end_time' => 1615.24, 'target_text' => 'Whether they liked you or not is irrelevant.', 'source_text' => 'Sama ada mereka menyukai anda atau tidak, itu langsung tidak penting.', 'order' => 498],
            ['start_time' => 1615.34, 'end_time' => 1619.04, 'target_text' => 'Allah will never ask you how many "likes" you had before entering Paradise.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tidak akan sesekali bertanya kepada anda berapa banyak "likes" yang anda kumpul sebelum memasuki Syurga.', 'order' => 499],
            ['start_time' => 1619.14, 'end_time' => 1620.49, 'target_text' => 'Not at all.', 'source_text' => 'Langsung tidak.', 'order' => 500],
            ['start_time' => 1620.59, 'end_time' => 1621.95, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t be deceived.', 'source_text' => 'Janganlah terpedaya.', 'order' => 501],
            ['start_time' => 1622.05, 'end_time' => 1629.21, 'target_text' => 'My dear young people, even if they are unknown, some of the people closest to Allah don\'t even have a single', 'source_text' => 'Wahai anak-anak muda yang dikasihi, walaupun mereka tidak dikenali, sebahagian insan yang paling dekat dengan Allah langsung tidak memiliki', 'order' => 502],
            ['start_time' => 1629.31, 'end_time' => 1630.71, 'target_text' => 'social media account.', 'source_text' => 'akaun media sosial.', 'order' => 503],
            ['start_time' => 1630.81, 'end_time' => 1631.71, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi al-Azim.', 'source_text' => 'Wallahi al-Azim.', 'order' => 504],
            ['start_time' => 1631.82, 'end_time' => 1636.32, 'target_text' => 'And they are so close to Allah that if they were to make a supplication, it would be fulfilled almost instantly.', 'source_text' => 'Dan mereka begitu dekat dengan Allah sehinggakan jika mereka berdoa, doa itu akan dimakbulkan hampir serta-merta.', 'order' => 505],
            ['start_time' => 1636.42, 'end_time' => 1639.63, 'target_text' => 'They are people with the gift of being mustajab ud-dawah.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka adalah golongan yang dikurniakan keistimewaan mustajab ud-da\'wah.', 'order' => 506],
            ['start_time' => 1639.73, 'end_time' => 1643.08, 'target_text' => 'Is there anyone whom Allah considers mustajab ud-dawah?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah sesiapa yang Allah anggap sebagai mustajab ud-da\'wah?', 'order' => 507],
            ['start_time' => 1643.18, 'end_time' => 1647.53, 'target_text' => 'That means that when they make a supplication, it is accepted by Allah quickly.', 'source_text' => 'Itu bermakna apabila mereka memanjatkan doa, ia diperkenankan oleh Allah dengan pantas.', 'order' => 508],
            ['start_time' => 1647.63, 'end_time' => 1653.09, 'target_text' => 'Is there anyone with that quality who has been told that the more "likes" and followers they have, the faster', 'source_text' => 'Adakah terdapat sesiapa yang memiliki sifat mulia itu diberitahu bahawa semakin banyak tanda "suka" dan pengikut yang mereka ada, semakin cepat', 'order' => 509],
            ['start_time' => 1653.19, 'end_time' => 1653.93, 'target_text' => 'they will get into Paradise?', 'source_text' => 'mereka akan masuk ke dalam Syurga?', 'order' => 510],
            ['start_time' => 1654.03, 'end_time' => 1655.28, 'target_text' => 'Will He accept their plea?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah Dia akan menerima permohonan mereka?', 'order' => 511],
            ['start_time' => 1655.38, 'end_time' => 1656.19, 'target_text' => 'No way.', 'source_text' => 'Sama sekali tidak.', 'order' => 512],
            ['start_time' => 1656.29, 'end_time' => 1657.23, 'target_text' => 'No way.', 'source_text' => 'Sama sekali tidak.', 'order' => 513],
            ['start_time' => 1657.33, 'end_time' => 1659.3, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t be fooled or deceived.', 'source_text' => 'Janganlah terpedaya atau tertipu.', 'order' => 514],
            ['start_time' => 1659.4, 'end_time' => 1660.87, 'target_text' => 'It\'s an enormous responsibility.', 'source_text' => 'Ia merupakan suatu tanggungjawab yang teramat besar.', 'order' => 515],
            ['start_time' => 1660.97, 'end_time' => 1662.53, 'target_text' => 'Do you know why?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda mengapa?', 'order' => 516],
            ['start_time' => 1662.63, 'end_time' => 1672.98, 'target_text' => 'My fear is that when you forward, like, comment, or promote something negative, it might be such a great responsibility', 'source_text' => 'Kebimbangan saya ialah apabila anda memanjangkan (forward), menyukai, memberi komen, atau mempromosikan sesuatu yang negatif, ia mungkin menjadi tanggungjawab yang begitu berat', 'order' => 517],
            ['start_time' => 1673.08, 'end_time' => 1677.61, 'target_text' => 'that it could be our downfall.', 'source_text' => 'sehingga boleh menyebabkan kebinasaan kita.', 'order' => 518],
            ['start_time' => 1677.71, 'end_time' => 1679.62, 'target_text' => 'Look, I want to tell you something.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah, saya ingin berkongsi sesuatu dengan anda.', 'order' => 519],
            ['start_time' => 1679.72, 'end_time' => 1681.56, 'target_text' => 'On Judgment Day, we will have a scale.', 'source_text' => 'Pada Hari Pembalasan kelak, kita akan mempunyai sebuah neraca timbangan.', 'order' => 520],
            ['start_time' => 1681.66, 'end_time' => 1683.61, 'target_text' => 'What kind of scale is that?', 'source_text' => 'Neraca timbangan apakah itu?', 'order' => 521],
            ['start_time' => 1683.71, 'end_time' => 1684.71, 'target_text' => 'Can someone tell me?', 'source_text' => 'Bolehkah sesiapa memberitahu saya?', 'order' => 522],
            ['start_time' => 1684.81, 'end_time' => 1685.81, 'target_text' => 'What is the scale?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah neraca timbangan tersebut?', 'order' => 523],
            ['start_time' => 1685.91, 'end_time' => 1687.06, 'target_text' => 'Yes, tell me.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, beritahu saya.', 'order' => 524],
            ['start_time' => 1687.16, 'end_time' => 1688.32, 'target_text' => 'The scale of good and bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Timbangan amalan baik dan amalan buruk.', 'order' => 525],
            ['start_time' => 1688.42, 'end_time' => 1689.78, 'target_text' => 'Good deeds and bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Amalan kebaikan dan amalan kejahatan.', 'order' => 526],
            ['start_time' => 1689.88, 'end_time' => 1692.44, 'target_text' => 'Which side is good and which side is bad?', 'source_text' => 'Sebelah manakah kebaikan dan sebelah manakah kejahatan?', 'order' => 527],
            ['start_time' => 1692.54, 'end_time' => 1693.44, 'target_text' => 'Yes.', 'source_text' => 'Ya.', 'order' => 528],
            ['start_time' => 1693.54, 'end_time' => 1695.51, 'target_text' => 'Right and left.', 'source_text' => 'Kanan dan kiri.', 'order' => 529],
            ['start_time' => 1695.61, 'end_time' => 1697.88, 'target_text' => 'Right is good and left is bad, right?', 'source_text' => 'Kanan adalah kebaikan dan kiri adalah kejahatan, betul?', 'order' => 530],
            ['start_time' => 1697.98, 'end_time' => 1698.51, 'target_text' => 'Correct.', 'source_text' => 'Tepat sekali.', 'order' => 531],
            ['start_time' => 1698.61, 'end_time' => 1700.97, 'target_text' => 'So, imagine you are standing before Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, bayangkan anda sedang berdiri di hadapan Allah.', 'order' => 532],
            ['start_time' => 1701.07, 'end_time' => 1703.28, 'target_text' => 'You are standing, there is a scale, right side, left side.', 'source_text' => 'Anda sedang berdiri, di situ ada sebuah neraca, sebelah kanan dan sebelah kiri.', 'order' => 533],
            ['start_time' => 1703.38, 'end_time' => 1706.99, 'target_text' => 'On the right they will put all your good deeds, and on the left they will put your bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Di sebelah kanan mereka akan meletakkan segala amalan kebaikan anda, dan di sebelah kiri mereka akan meletakkan amalan kejahatan anda.', 'order' => 534],
            ['start_time' => 1707.09, 'end_time' => 1711.68, 'target_text' => 'Now, there are so many bad deeds that appear one after another.', 'source_text' => 'Sekarang, begitu banyak amalan buruk yang muncul berturut-turut satu demi satu.', 'order' => 535],
            ['start_time' => 1711.78, 'end_time' => 1712.72, 'target_text' => 'What will it be?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah amalannya itu?', 'order' => 536],
            ['start_time' => 1712.82, 'end_time' => 1718.35, 'target_text' => 'A like, you shared a Rumor spreads, you said something negative about someone you don\'t even know.', 'source_text' => 'Satu tanda suka, anda menyebarkan khabar angin, anda mengatakan sesuatu yang buruk tentang seseorang yang langsung tidak anda kenali.', 'order' => 537],
            ['start_time' => 1718.45, 'end_time' => 1720.59, 'target_text' => 'It happens every day online.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara ini berlaku setiap hari di alam maya.', 'order' => 538],
            ['start_time' => 1720.69, 'end_time' => 1722.74, 'target_text' => 'You don\'t even know this person.', 'source_text' => 'Anda sendiri pun tidak mengenali orang ini.', 'order' => 539],
            ['start_time' => 1722.84, 'end_time' => 1723.99, 'target_text' => 'You ruined their life.', 'source_text' => 'Anda telah merosakkan kehidupan mereka.', 'order' => 540],
            ['start_time' => 1724.09, 'end_time' => 1730.87, 'target_text' => 'You damaged their reputation, even though they were truly good people, or you promoted someone who isn\'t worth', 'source_text' => 'Anda telah mencemarkan maruah mereka, walaupun hakikatnya mereka insan yang sangat baik, atau anda mempromosikan seseorang yang tidak layak', 'order' => 541],
            ['start_time' => 1730.97, 'end_time' => 1738.88, 'target_text' => 'promoting because of their behavior, which doesn\'t live up to the morals and values ​​ we align ourselves with.', 'source_text' => 'dipromosikan kerana kelakuannya yang tidak mencerminkan akhlak dan nilai yang kita pegang teguh.', 'order' => 542],
            ['start_time' => 1738.98, 'end_time' => 1739.15, 'target_text' => 'Subhanallah.', 'source_text' => 'Subhanallah.', 'order' => 543],
            ['start_time' => 1739.16, 'end_time' => 1739.96, 'target_text' => 'So, what happens?', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 544],
            ['start_time' => 1740.06, 'end_time' => 1743.54, 'target_text' => 'You see all those bad deeds piling up and piling up.', 'source_text' => 'Anda melihat semua amalan buruk itu semakin bertimbun-timbun.', 'order' => 545],
            ['start_time' => 1743.63, 'end_time' => 1744.62, 'target_text' => 'So, what\'s going to happen?', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, apa yang akan terjadi?', 'order' => 546],
            ['start_time' => 1744.71, 'end_time' => 1746.81, 'target_text' => 'All the good', 'source_text' => 'Segala amalan', 'order' => 547],
            ['start_time' => 1746.91, 'end_time' => 1748.62, 'target_text' => 'deeds', 'source_text' => 'kebaikan', 'order' => 548],
            ['start_time' => 1748.72, 'end_time' => 1750.44, 'target_text' => 'are', 'source_text' => 'akan', 'order' => 549],
            ['start_time' => 1750.54, 'end_time' => 1752.26, 'target_text' => 'going', 'source_text' => 'tiba', 'order' => 550],
            ['start_time' => 1752.36, 'end_time' => 1754.08, 'target_text' => 'to', 'source_text' => 'pada', 'order' => 551],
            ['start_time' => 1754.17, 'end_time' => 1755.89, 'target_text' => 'come', 'source_text' => 'saat', 'order' => 552],
            ['start_time' => 1755.99, 'end_time' => 1757.71, 'target_text' => 'to', 'source_text' => 'ketikanya', 'order' => 553],
            ['start_time' => 1757.81, 'end_time' => 1759.53, 'target_text' => 'pass.', 'source_text' => 'kelak.', 'order' => 554],
            ['start_time' => 1759.63, 'end_time' => 1761.34, 'target_text' => 'Allah', 'source_text' => 'Allah', 'order' => 555],
            ['start_time' => 1761.44, 'end_time' => 1765.11, 'target_text' => 'says that on that Day of Qiyamah, We will set the scales of justice.', 'source_text' => 'berfirman bahawa pada Hari Kiamat itu, Kami akan meletakkan timbangan keadilan.', 'order' => 556],
            ['start_time' => 1765.21, 'end_time' => 1767.18, 'target_text' => 'No one will be oppressed.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada seorang pun yang akan dizalimi.', 'order' => 557],
            ['start_time' => 1767.28, 'end_time' => 1769.0, 'target_text' => 'No soul will be wronged.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada satu jiwa pun yang akan dianiayai.', 'order' => 558],
            ['start_time' => 1769.1, 'end_time' => 1770.37, 'target_text' => 'Those are your deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah amalan-amalan anda.', 'order' => 559],
            ['start_time' => 1770.47, 'end_time' => 1772.25, 'target_text' => 'So, what is my duty?', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, apakah kewajipan saya?', 'order' => 560],
            ['start_time' => 1772.35, 'end_time' => 1776.58, 'target_text' => 'I\'m sitting here in the mosque in Abdeen trying to imagine it, and we won\'t be able to fully imagine it', 'source_text' => 'Saya duduk di sini di masjid Aberdeen cuba membayangkannya, dan kita memang tidak akan mampu membayangkannya secara sempurna', 'order' => 561],
            ['start_time' => 1776.68, 'end_time' => 1781.4, 'target_text' => 'because we do n\'t know, but just try to visualize it for a human mind.', 'source_text' => 'kerana kita tidak tahu, tetapi cubalah menggambarkannya mengikut kemampuan akal manusia.', 'order' => 562],
            ['start_time' => 1781.5, 'end_time' => 1782.14, 'target_text' => 'Here are my deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Inilah amalan-amalan saya.', 'order' => 563],
            ['start_time' => 1782.24, 'end_time' => 1783.32, 'target_text' => 'All of them are bad.', 'source_text' => 'Kesemuanya adalah buruk.', 'order' => 564],
            ['start_time' => 1783.42, 'end_time' => 1783.82, 'target_text' => 'All bad.', 'source_text' => 'Semuanya jahat.', 'order' => 565],
            ['start_time' => 1783.84, 'end_time' => 1795.55, 'target_text' => 'Things I know, things I do n\'t know because Allah says whoever did good, Even if it\'s the weight of a mustard', 'source_text' => 'Perkara yang saya sedari, perkara yang saya tidak sedari, kerana Allah berfirman sesiapa yang melakukan kebaikan walau seberat biji sawi,', 'order' => 566],
            ['start_time' => 1795.65, 'end_time' => 1799.15, 'target_text' => 'seed, He will see it, and evil will see it too.', 'source_text' => 'dia akan melihatnya, dan kejahatan pun dia akan melihatnya juga.', 'order' => 567],
            ['start_time' => 1799.25, 'end_time' => 1800.68, 'target_text' => 'So, it\'s all coming together.', 'source_text' => 'Maka semuanya sedang dikumpulkan bersama.', 'order' => 568],
            ['start_time' => 1800.78, 'end_time' => 1803.0, 'target_text' => 'Now, my good deeds are starting to pile up.', 'source_text' => 'Kini, amalan kebaikan saya mula bertimbun.', 'order' => 569],
            ['start_time' => 1803.1, 'end_time' => 1803.93, 'target_text' => 'And guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan teka apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 570],
            ['start_time' => 1804.03, 'end_time' => 1805.65, 'target_text' => 'There\'s still more evil than good.', 'source_text' => 'Masih terdapat lebih banyak kejahatan daripada kebaikan.', 'order' => 571],
            ['start_time' => 1805.75, 'end_time' => 1806.76, 'target_text' => 'And what am I doing?', 'source_text' => 'Dan apakah yang sedang saya lakukan?', 'order' => 572],
            ['start_time' => 1806.86, 'end_time' => 1810.66, 'target_text' => 'Maybe I\'m holding my breath, and I\'m just watching, wow, 1, 2, 3, and you say, inshallah, inshallah, inshallah,', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin saya sedang menahan nafas, dan saya hanya memerhatikan, wah, 1, 2, 3, dan anda berkata, insya-Allah, insya-Allah, insya-Allah,', 'order' => 573],
            ['start_time' => 1810.76, 'end_time' => 1815.12, 'target_text' => 'I\'ll make it, inshallah, I\'ll make it, inshallah, I\'ll make it, inshallah, I\'ll make it.', 'source_text' => 'aku akan berjaya, insya-Allah, aku akan berjaya, insya-Allah, aku akan selamat, insya-Allah, aku akan selamat.', 'order' => 574],
            ['start_time' => 1815.22, 'end_time' => 1816.13, 'target_text' => 'And guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan teka apa?', 'order' => 575],
            ['start_time' => 1816.23, 'end_time' => 1819.48, 'target_text' => 'It starts going up and down and down, which means it gets heavier and heavier.', 'source_text' => 'Ia mula bergerak naik dan turun, yang bermaksud ia menjadi semakin berat dan semakin berat.', 'order' => 576],
            ['start_time' => 1819.58, 'end_time' => 1820.9, 'target_text' => 'And you\'re so happy.', 'source_text' => 'Dan anda berasa sangat gembira.', 'order' => 577],
            ['start_time' => 1821.0, 'end_time' => 1822.4, 'target_text' => 'And it\'s almost there.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ia hampir mencecah kejayaan.', 'order' => 578],
            ['start_time' => 1822.5, 'end_time' => 1824.14, 'target_text' => 'And you need a few more deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Dan anda memerlukan beberapa lagi amalan kebaikan.', 'order' => 579],
            ['start_time' => 1824.24, 'end_time' => 1825.83, 'target_text' => 'And guess what Allah says?', 'source_text' => 'Dan teka apakah yang Allah firmankan?', 'order' => 580],
            ['start_time' => 1825.93, 'end_time' => 1831.3, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "Wallahi, if your right side surpasses your left, We will forget the entire left side and give', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman, "Wallahi, jika timbangan sebelah kananmu mengatasi sebelah kirimu, Kami akan melupakan seluruh sebelah kiri itu dan mengurniakan', 'order' => 581],
            ['start_time' => 1831.4, 'end_time' => 1833.85, 'target_text' => 'you Paradise." How does that sound?', 'source_text' => 'kepadamu Syurga." Bagaimana bunyinya itu?', 'order' => 582],
            ['start_time' => 1833.95, 'end_time' => 1834.76, 'target_text' => 'Imagine the mercy of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan betapa luasnya rahmat Allah.', 'order' => 583],
            ['start_time' => 1834.86, 'end_time' => 1841.2, 'target_text' => 'Allah didn\'t say you have to be sinless to go to Paradise.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tidak mengatakan anda mesti bebas dari dosa untuk memasuki Syurga.', 'order' => 584],
            ['start_time' => 1841.3, 'end_time' => 1842.44, 'target_text' => 'Jannah.', 'source_text' => 'Jannah.', 'order' => 585],
            ['start_time' => 1842.54, 'end_time' => 1850.29, 'target_text' => 'Allah says, "Those whose good deeds are more numerous, they will be the ones who succeed." So, yes, you have', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman, "Mereka yang timbangan kebaikannya lebih berat, mereka itulah orang-orang yang berjaya." Jadi, ya, anda ada', 'order' => 586],
            ['start_time' => 1850.39, 'end_time' => 1850.8, 'target_text' => 'bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'amalan buruk.', 'order' => 587],
            ['start_time' => 1850.9, 'end_time' => 1851.74, 'target_text' => 'I have bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ada amalan buruk.', 'order' => 588],
            ['start_time' => 1851.84, 'end_time' => 1852.77, 'target_text' => 'You have bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Anda ada amalan buruk.', 'order' => 589],
            ['start_time' => 1852.87, 'end_time' => 1853.63, 'target_text' => 'But guess what?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi teka apa?', 'order' => 590],
            ['start_time' => 1853.73, 'end_time' => 1856.27, 'target_text' => 'We have more good deeds than bad ones.', 'source_text' => 'Kita mempunyai lebih banyak amalan kebaikan daripada amalan kejahatan.', 'order' => 591],
            ['start_time' => 1856.37, 'end_time' => 1857.53, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what it is.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah hakikatnya.', 'order' => 592],
            ['start_time' => 1857.62, 'end_time' => 1862.89, 'target_text' => 'And we seek Allah\'s forgiveness as best we can for our bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita memohon keampunan Allah sebaik mungkin atas amalan buruk kita.', 'order' => 593],
            ['start_time' => 1862.99, 'end_time' => 1864.82, 'target_text' => 'And Allah will erase them.', 'source_text' => 'Dan Allah akan menghapuskannya.', 'order' => 594],
            ['start_time' => 1864.92, 'end_time' => 1868.16, 'target_text' => 'When you have more good deeds than bad ones, guess what happens?', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda mempunyai lebih banyak amalan kebaikan daripada kejahatan, teka apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 595],
            ['start_time' => 1868.26, 'end_time' => 1871.12, 'target_text' => 'You will succeed.', 'source_text' => 'Anda akan beroleh kejayaan.', 'order' => 596],
            ['start_time' => 1874.81, 'end_time' => 1879.71, 'target_text' => 'The hadith says, "Accompany your bad deed with good deeds, and it will be erased." Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Hadis menyatakan, "Iringilah perbuatan burukmu dengan perbuatan baik, nescaya ia akan menghapuskannya." Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 597],
            ['start_time' => 1879.81, 'end_time' => 1880.44, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 598],
            ['start_time' => 1880.54, 'end_time' => 1882.73, 'target_text' => 'That is the mercy of Allah, the favor of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah rahmat Allah, kurniaan Allah.', 'order' => 599],
            ['start_time' => 1882.83, 'end_time' => 1887.03, 'target_text' => 'So, I want to invite you today to do as many good deeds as you can.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, saya ingin mengajak anda hari ini untuk melakukan sebanyak mungkin amalan kebaikan.', 'order' => 600],
            ['start_time' => 1887.13, 'end_time' => 1888.05, 'target_text' => 'Do you know why?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda mengapa?', 'order' => 601],
            ['start_time' => 1888.15, 'end_time' => 1891.44, 'target_text' => 'Listen, you and I have many bad deeds that we are not proud of.', 'source_text' => 'Dengarlah, anda dan saya mempunyai banyak amalan buruk yang langsung tidak kita banggakan.', 'order' => 602],
            ['start_time' => 1891.54, 'end_time' => 1894.41, 'target_text' => 'You and I have many bad deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Anda dan saya mempunyai banyak perbuatan dosa.', 'order' => 603],
            ['start_time' => 1894.51, 'end_time' => 1898.58, 'target_text' => 'We would be ashamed if people had to see what we have done in our lives.', 'source_text' => 'Kita pasti akan merasa sangat malu sekiranya orang ramai dapat melihat apa yang telah kita lakukan dalam hidup kita.', 'order' => 604],
            ['start_time' => 1898.68, 'end_time' => 1899.22, 'target_text' => 'Do you agree?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda bersetuju?', 'order' => 605],
            ['start_time' => 1899.32, 'end_time' => 1900.02, 'target_text' => 'All of us.', 'source_text' => 'Kita semua begitu.', 'order' => 606],
            ['start_time' => 1900.12, 'end_time' => 1901.71, 'target_text' => 'We have so many secrets.', 'source_text' => 'Kita mempunyai begitu banyak rahsia.', 'order' => 607],
            ['start_time' => 1901.81, 'end_time' => 1904.28, 'target_text' => 'We have so many secrets.', 'source_text' => 'Kita mempunyai terlalu banyak rahsia peribadi.', 'order' => 608],
            ['start_time' => 1904.38, 'end_time' => 1907.3, 'target_text' => 'If Allah were not Merciful, it would expose us.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya Allah tidak Maha Pengasih, sudah tentu Dia akan membuka aib kita.', 'order' => 609],
            ['start_time' => 1907.4, 'end_time' => 1910.27, 'target_text' => 'I\'m sorry, I\'m not trying to say I\'m a bad person.', 'source_text' => 'Maafkan saya, saya bukan cuba mengatakan bahawa saya seorang yang jahat.', 'order' => 610],
            ['start_time' => 1910.37, 'end_time' => 1912.84, 'target_text' => 'But what I\'m trying to say is that we all have sins.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi apa yang ingin saya sampaikan ialah kita semua pernah melakukan dosa.', 'order' => 611],
            ['start_time' => 1912.94, 'end_time' => 1913.62, 'target_text' => 'We are sinners.', 'source_text' => 'Kita semua insan yang berdosa.', 'order' => 612],
            ['start_time' => 1913.72, 'end_time' => 1914.91, 'target_text' => 'We are Banu Adam.', 'source_text' => 'Kita adalah anak cucu Nabi Adam.', 'order' => 613],
            ['start_time' => 1915.01, 'end_time' => 1916.32, 'target_text' => 'We are Bashar.', 'source_text' => 'Kita hanyalah manusia biasa (basyar).', 'order' => 614],
            ['start_time' => 1916.42, 'end_time' => 1921.57, 'target_text' => 'How many of us have fallen asleep and missed a prayer for whatever reason?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa ramai antara kita yang pernah terlelap tidur lalu terlepas waktu solat atas apa jua alasan?', 'order' => 615],
            ['start_time' => 1921.67, 'end_time' => 1923.64, 'target_text' => 'May Allah never allow that to happen to us.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah tidak membiarkan perkara sedemikian berlaku kepada kita.', 'order' => 616],
            ['start_time' => 1923.74, 'end_time' => 1925.98, 'target_text' => 'But it\'s a very heavy feeling.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi ia merupakan suatu perasaan yang amat berat.', 'order' => 617],
            ['start_time' => 1926.08, 'end_time' => 1931.44, 'target_text' => 'The good thing is that the Hadith says Salat or Nasya, whether it\'s Salat or the Quran.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara yang melegakan ialah hadis menyebut tentang orang yang tertidur atau terlupa, sama ada tentang solat atau al-Quran.', 'order' => 618],
            ['start_time' => 1931.54, 'end_time' => 1938.41, 'target_text' => 'In a correct narration, the Prophet says that whoever falls asleep or forgets a prayer—sometimes forgetfulness', 'source_text' => 'Dalam riwayat yang sahih, Rasulullah bersabda bahawa sesiapa yang tertidur atau terlupa menunaikan solat—kadangkala sifat lupa itu', 'order' => 619],
            ['start_time' => 1938.51, 'end_time' => 1938.98, 'target_text' => 'happens.', 'source_text' => 'memang berlaku.', 'order' => 620],
            ['start_time' => 1939.08, 'end_time' => 1945.59, 'target_text' => 'Here in Aberdeen, one negative aspect is that at certain times of the year, the prayers fall at complicated', 'source_text' => 'Di sini di Aberdeen, satu aspek cabarannya ialah pada waktu-waktu tertentu dalam setahun, waktu solat jatuh pada masa yang agak rumit,', 'order' => 621],
            ['start_time' => 1945.69, 'end_time' => 1947.59, 'target_text' => 'times, difficult moments.', 'source_text' => 'detik-detik yang mencabar.', 'order' => 622],
            ['start_time' => 1947.69, 'end_time' => 1953.77, 'target_text' => 'You do Fajr, then Dhuhr, and then you don\'t even know when Asr started and ended; before you know it, it\'s', 'source_text' => 'Anda baru solat Subuh, kemudian Zuhur, dan selepas itu anda pun tidak perasan bila Asar bermula dan berakhir; sedar-sedar sahaja sudah masuk', 'order' => 623],
            ['start_time' => 1953.87, 'end_time' => 1957.9, 'target_text' => 'Maghrib, and then Maghrib and Isha, and you\'re confused about whether it\'s the same time or not.', 'source_text' => 'Maghrib, dan kemudian antara Maghrib dan Isyak, anda berasa keliru sama ada ia berlaku pada waktu yang sama atau tidak.', 'order' => 624],
            ['start_time' => 1958.0, 'end_time' => 1961.62, 'target_text' => 'Some scholars say you can pray these two together, and there\'s so much chaos.', 'source_text' => 'Sebahagian ulama menyatakan anda boleh menjamakkan kedua-dua solat ini, dan timbul banyak kekeliruan.', 'order' => 625],
            ['start_time' => 1961.71, 'end_time' => 1962.08, 'target_text' => 'And confusion.', 'source_text' => 'Dan salah faham.', 'order' => 626],
            ['start_time' => 1962.09, 'end_time' => 1963.38, 'target_text' => 'How do we do it?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah cara kita melaksanakannya?', 'order' => 627],
            ['start_time' => 1963.48, 'end_time' => 1967.68, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, we do the best we can and ask Allah to accept it and forgive our sins.', 'source_text' => 'Wallahi, kita lakukan yang terbaik mengikut kemampuan kita dan memohon agar Allah menerimanya serta mengampunkan dosa-dosa kita.', 'order' => 628],
            ['start_time' => 1967.78, 'end_time' => 1973.45, 'target_text' => 'So, since I have done bad deeds and want to tip the scales in the right direction, how do I begin?', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, memandangkan saya telah melakukan amalan buruk dan ingin memberatkan neraca timbangan ke arah kebaikan, bagaimanakah saya harus bermula?', 'order' => 629],
            ['start_time' => 1973.55, 'end_time' => 1974.33, 'target_text' => 'I\'ll teach you something.', 'source_text' => 'Saya akan ajarkan anda sesuatu.', 'order' => 630],
            ['start_time' => 1974.43, 'end_time' => 1976.23, 'target_text' => 'You begin by seeking Allah\'s forgiveness.', 'source_text' => 'Anda bermula dengan memohon keampunan daripada Allah (istighfar).', 'order' => 631],
            ['start_time' => 1976.33, 'end_time' => 1977.92, 'target_text' => 'I', 'source_text' => 'Saya', 'order' => 632],
            ['start_time' => 1978.02, 'end_time' => 1984.34, 'target_text' => 'once gave a talk at a school to some young people, some teenagers, and I told them: begin by seeking Allah\'s', 'source_text' => 'pernah menyampaikan ceramah di sebuah sekolah kepada sekumpulan anak muda, beberapa remaja, dan saya berpesan kepada mereka: mulakan dengan memohon keampunan', 'order' => 633],
            ['start_time' => 1984.44, 'end_time' => 1984.67, 'target_text' => 'forgiveness.', 'source_text' => 'daripada Allah.', 'order' => 634],
            ['start_time' => 1984.68, 'end_time' => 1987.27, 'target_text' => 'They said, "We have not sinned." Why should we apologize?', 'source_text' => 'Mereka berkata, "Kami tidak berbuat dosa. Mengapa kami perlu meminta maaf?"', 'order' => 635],
            ['start_time' => 1987.37, 'end_time' => 1989.61, 'target_text' => '" I was like, \'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tergamam, \'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 636],
            ['start_time' => 1989.71, 'end_time' => 1990.47, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 637],
            ['start_time' => 1990.58, 'end_time' => 1991.66, 'target_text' => 'We haven\'t sinned.', 'source_text' => 'Kami tidak berbuat dosa.', 'order' => 638],
            ['start_time' => 1991.76, 'end_time' => 1994.56, 'target_text' => 'Why should I ask for forgiveness?\' Wallahi, we do ask for forgiveness.', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa saya perlu memohon ampun?\' Wallahi, kita sememangnya wajib sentiasa memohon keampunan.', 'order' => 639],
            ['start_time' => 1994.65, 'end_time' => 1996.46, 'target_text' => 'Do you know how you ask for forgiveness?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda bagaimana cara untuk memohon keampunan?', 'order' => 640],
            ['start_time' => 1996.56, 'end_time' => 2003.93, 'target_text' => '\'Oh Allah, forgive me for the sins I know, the sins I don\'t know, the minor sins, the major sins, the sins', 'source_text' => '\'Ya Allah, ampunkanlah dosa-dosa yang aku ketahui, dosa-dosa yang tidak aku ketahui, dosa kecil, dosa besar, dosa', 'order' => 641],
            ['start_time' => 2004.03, 'end_time' => 2010.52, 'target_text' => 'I remember, the sins I don\'t remember, the sins I knew I committed, and the sins I committed without realizing', 'source_text' => 'yang aku ingati, dosa yang tidak aku ingati, dosa yang aku sedar melakukannya, dan dosa yang aku lakukan tanpa aku sedari.\'', 'order' => 642],
            ['start_time' => 2010.62, 'end_time' => 2011.68, 'target_text' => 'it.\' Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 643],
            ['start_time' => 2011.78, 'end_time' => 2014.26, 'target_text' => '\'Wa astaghfiruka lima la a\'lamuhu.\' Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => '\'Wa astaghfiruka lima la a\'lamuhu.\' Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 644],
            ['start_time' => 2014.36, 'end_time' => 2016.76, 'target_text' => '\'Oh Allah, I seek Your forgiveness for what I don\'t even know.', 'source_text' => '\'Ya Allah, aku memohon keampunan-Mu terhadap perkara yang langsung tidak aku ketahui.', 'order' => 645],
            ['start_time' => 2016.86, 'end_time' => 2019.58, 'target_text' => 'I\'m not even aware of it.\'', 'source_text' => 'Yang aku sendiri tidak menyedarinya.\'', 'order' => 646],
            ['start_time' => 2020.32, 'end_time' => 2025.23, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes nowadays, you know how stressful the environment can be, you\'re walking down the street and you don\'t', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala pada zaman ini, anda tahu betapa tingginya tekanan persekitaran kita, anda berjalan di sepanjang jalan dan anda sendiri', 'order' => 647],
            ['start_time' => 2025.33, 'end_time' => 2029.98, 'target_text' => 'even know, \'I look here, I look there, I look over there,\' you know, \'I saw something I shouldn\'t have seen.\'', 'source_text' => 'tidak sedar, \'Saya memandang ke sini, memandang ke sana, memandang ke penjuru itu,\' anda tahu, \'Saya ternampak sesuatu yang tidak sepatutnya saya lihat.\'', 'order' => 648],
            ['start_time' => 2030.09, 'end_time' => 2030.62, 'target_text' => 'What happened?', 'source_text' => 'Apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 649],
            ['start_time' => 2030.72, 'end_time' => 2031.94, 'target_text' => 'You just kept walking.', 'source_text' => 'Anda hanya terus berjalan begitu sahaja.', 'order' => 650],
            ['start_time' => 2032.04, 'end_time' => 2033.52, 'target_text' => 'Did you ever say, \'Astaghfirullah\'?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda pernah mengucapkan, \'Astaghfirullah\'?', 'order' => 651],
            ['start_time' => 2033.62, 'end_time' => 2034.46, 'target_text' => 'No, I didn\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, saya tidak mengucapkannya.', 'order' => 652],
            ['start_time' => 2034.56, 'end_time' => 2034.87, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa?', 'order' => 653],
            ['start_time' => 2034.88, 'end_time' => 2036.51, 'target_text' => 'Because everyone walks, everyone sees.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana semua orang berjalan, semua orang melihat.', 'order' => 654],
            ['start_time' => 2036.61, 'end_time' => 2040.92, 'target_text' => 'And some people, you know, when they fear Allah, they look..." And they say astaghfirullah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sesetengah orang, anda tahu, apabila mereka takutkan Allah, mereka memandang..." Dan mereka beristighfar.', 'order' => 655],
            ['start_time' => 2041.02, 'end_time' => 2042.06, 'target_text' => 'They look down.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka menundukkan pandangan ke bawah.', 'order' => 656],
            ['start_time' => 2042.16, 'end_time' => 2046.41, 'target_text' => 'A little more intelligent, they look there, say la hawla wala quwwata illa billah, and look down.', 'source_text' => 'Orang yang lebih bijak sedikit, mereka terpandang ke situ, lalu menyebut la hawla wa la quwwata illa billah, kemudian menundukkan pandangan.', 'order' => 657],
            ['start_time' => 2046.51, 'end_time' => 2051.75, 'target_text' => 'And the one who is even more intelligent, looks and says inshallah, and looks down.', 'source_text' => 'Dan orang yang lebih bijak lagi, dia memandang dan menyebut insya-Allah, kemudian menundukkan pandangan.', 'order' => 658],
            ['start_time' => 2051.85, 'end_time' => 2052.59, 'target_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu musta\'an.', 'order' => 659],
            ['start_time' => 2052.69, 'end_time' => 2054.54, 'target_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'source_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'order' => 660],
            ['start_time' => 2054.64, 'end_time' => 2056.12, 'target_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'source_text' => 'Hasbunallahu wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'order' => 661],
            ['start_time' => 2056.22, 'end_time' => 2059.84, 'target_text' => 'I hope that inshallah is for something halal, not haram.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berharap ucapan insya-Allah itu adalah untuk perkara yang halal, bukan perkara yang haram.', 'order' => 662],
            ['start_time' => 2059.93, 'end_time' => 2060.41, 'target_text' => 'Right?', 'source_text' => 'Betul bukan?', 'order' => 663],
            ['start_time' => 2060.51, 'end_time' => 2062.18, 'target_text' => 'May Allah bless you.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah merahmati anda.', 'order' => 664],
            ['start_time' => 2062.28, 'end_time' => 2064.12, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty bless you.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa merahmati anda.', 'order' => 665],
            ['start_time' => 2064.22, 'end_time' => 2068.21, 'target_text' => 'But nevertheless, in a more serious tone, sometimes the point I make is that sometimes we don\'t even realize', 'source_text' => 'Namun demikian, dalam nada yang lebih serius, kadangkala perkara yang ingin saya tekankan ialah kadang-kadang kita langsung tidak menyedari', 'order' => 666],
            ['start_time' => 2068.31, 'end_time' => 2072.72, 'target_text' => 'that we might have committed a minor sin, and sometimes we don\'t notice.', 'source_text' => 'bahawa kita mungkin telah melakukan dosa kecil, dan adakalanya kita tidak menghiraukannya.', 'order' => 667],
            ['start_time' => 2072.82, 'end_time' => 2077.86, 'target_text' => 'Say, ask Allah: " O Allah, forgive me for what I know and for what I don\'t know." When you seek Allah\'s', 'source_text' => 'Sebutlah, pohonlah kepada Allah: "Ya Allah, ampunkanlah aku atas apa yang aku ketahui dan atas apa yang tidak aku ketahui." Apabila anda memohon', 'order' => 668],
            ['start_time' => 2077.96, 'end_time' => 2080.19, 'target_text' => 'forgiveness, learn to be humble.', 'source_text' => 'keampunan Allah, belajarlah untuk bersikap rendah diri.', 'order' => 669],
            ['start_time' => 2080.29, 'end_time' => 2081.68, 'target_text' => 'Learn to be humble.', 'source_text' => 'Belajarlah untuk merendah diri (tawaduk).', 'order' => 670],
            ['start_time' => 2081.78, 'end_time' => 2090.46, 'target_text' => 'Your power, your authority, your money, your fame and popularity, your good looks, none of it That means nothing', 'source_text' => 'Kekuasaan anda, autoriti anda, wang ringgit anda, kemasyhuran dan populariti anda, rupa paras anda yang tampan atau jelita, tiada satu pun daripadanya. Semua itu tidak bernilai', 'order' => 671],
            ['start_time' => 2090.56, 'end_time' => 2093.71, 'target_text' => 'in the sight of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'di sisi Allah.', 'order' => 672],
            ['start_time' => 2093.81, 'end_time' => 2101.16, 'target_text' => 'In Allah ta\'ala la janzur.', 'source_text' => 'Inna Allaha ta\'ala la yanzuru (Sesungguhnya Allah Taala tidak melihat).', 'order' => 673],
            ['start_time' => 2101.26, 'end_time' => 2104.29, 'target_text' => 'Allah does not look at those material elements or those external things.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tidak memandang kepada unsur-unsur kebendaan atau perkara-perkara luaran tersebut.', 'order' => 674],
            ['start_time' => 2104.39, 'end_time' => 2108.54, 'target_text' => 'He does not look at your bodies, your forms, how you look, etc., etc.', 'source_text' => 'Dia tidak memandang kepada susuk tubuh anda, rupa paras anda, kecantikan zahir anda, dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 675],
            ['start_time' => 2108.64, 'end_time' => 2112.07, 'target_text' => 'Allah looks at the heart, and Allah looks at your deeds.', 'source_text' => 'Allah melihat kepada hati nurani, dan Allah melihat kepada amalan-amalan anda.', 'order' => 676],
            ['start_time' => 2112.17, 'end_time' => 2117.0, 'target_text' => 'And when we say that Allah looks at the heart, Satan comes along and keeps telling you that Allah looks at', 'source_text' => 'Dan apabila kita menyatakan bahawa Allah melihat kepada hati, syaitan pun datang dan terus-menerus membisikkan kepada anda bahawa Allah hanya melihat', 'order' => 677],
            ['start_time' => 2117.1, 'end_time' => 2117.72, 'target_text' => 'the heart.', 'source_text' => 'kepada hati.', 'order' => 678],
            ['start_time' => 2117.82, 'end_time' => 2119.95, 'target_text' => 'You might ask yourself, well, that\'s a true statement.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin tertanya-tanya pada diri sendiri, benarlah kenyataan itu.', 'order' => 679],
            ['start_time' => 2120.05, 'end_time' => 2122.49, 'target_text' => 'It is a true statement, but Satan is too cunning.', 'source_text' => 'Ia memang suatu kenyataan yang benar, tetapi syaitan sangat licik.', 'order' => 680],
            ['start_time' => 2122.59, 'end_time' => 2123.84, 'target_text' => 'Do you know what he does?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa yang dia lakukan?', 'order' => 681],
            ['start_time' => 2123.94, 'end_time' => 2128.32, 'target_text' => 'He says, "Listen, Allah doesn\'t look at your body, your soul, or anything." "He looks at your heart." And', 'source_text' => 'Dia berkata, "Dengarlah, Allah tidak memandang tubuhmu, rohmu, atau apa pun." "Dia hanya memandang hatimu." Dan', 'order' => 682],
            ['start_time' => 2128.42, 'end_time' => 2130.96, 'target_text' => 'he keeps repeating that He looks at your heart.', 'source_text' => 'dia terus mengulang-ulang bahawa Allah hanya melihat hatimu.', 'order' => 683],
            ['start_time' => 2131.06, 'end_time' => 2138.05, 'target_text' => 'Then you start to sin, and when someone advises you, you say, "Shut up." "Allah knows my heart." Ah, where', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian anda mula melakukan maksiat, dan apabila seseorang memberi nasihat, anda berkata, "Diamlah." "Allah tahu apa yang ada dalam hati saya." Ah, dari mana', 'order' => 684],
            ['start_time' => 2138.15, 'end_time' => 2139.84, 'target_text' => 'did you get that from?', 'source_text' => 'anda belajar alasan itu?', 'order' => 685],
            ['start_time' => 2139.94, 'end_time' => 2141.15, 'target_text' => 'From Satan, who else?', 'source_text' => 'Daripada syaitan, siapa lagi?', 'order' => 686],
            ['start_time' => 2141.25, 'end_time' => 2144.72, 'target_text' => 'Because it \'s a Kalimatul Haqqin.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana itu adalah Kalimatul Haqqin (kalimah yang benar).', 'order' => 687],
            ['start_time' => 2144.82, 'end_time' => 2149.02, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a true statement, but your intention is false.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah kenyataan yang benar, tetapi niat anda menggunakannya adalah salah.', 'order' => 688],
            ['start_time' => 2149.12, 'end_time' => 2154.05, 'target_text' => 'Isn\'t it my duty to advise you, my dear sister, my dear brother?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah kewajipan saya untuk saling menasihati, wahai saudariku dan saudaraku yang dikasihi?', 'order' => 689],
            ['start_time' => 2154.15, 'end_time' => 2156.47, 'target_text' => 'We need to learn how to dress appropriately.', 'source_text' => 'Kita perlu belajar cara berpakaian dengan sopan dan menutup aurat.', 'order' => 690],
            ['start_time' => 2156.57, 'end_time' => 2158.88, 'target_text' => 'Notice how I included the brothers.', 'source_text' => 'Perhatikan bagaimana saya turut menyertakan kaum lelaki.', 'order' => 691],
            ['start_time' => 2158.98, 'end_time' => 2162.26, 'target_text' => 'Because it\'s very unfair to point the finger only at the sisters.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana adalah sangat tidak adil untuk menuding jari hanya kepada kaum wanita sahaja.', 'order' => 692],
            ['start_time' => 2162.36, 'end_time' => 2164.45, 'target_text' => 'No, we are all guilty.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, kita semua ada kesilapan.', 'order' => 693],
            ['start_time' => 2164.55, 'end_time' => 2169.22, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes, some of the brothers wear clothes that are more shameful than all the sisters combined.', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala, sebahagian kaum lelaki memakai pakaian yang lebih mengaibkan berbanding semua wanita jika digabungkan.', 'order' => 694],
            ['start_time' => 2169.32, 'end_time' => 2180.36, 'target_text' => 'Because you come to the mosque, and you do sujud, look, people are already saying hasbunallah wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana anda datang ke masjid, dan anda sujud, lihatlah, jemaah sudah mula menyebut hasbunallah wa ni\'mal wakeel.', 'order' => 695],
            ['start_time' => 2180.45, 'end_time' => 2181.11, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa?', 'order' => 696],
            ['start_time' => 2181.21, 'end_time' => 2186.68, 'target_text' => 'Brother, I don\'t even want to use the word "shame" in the mosque.', 'source_text' => 'Saudaraku, saya sendiri tidak tergamak mahu menggunakan perkataan "aib" di dalam masjid.', 'order' => 697],
            ['start_time' => 2186.78, 'end_time' => 2192.54, 'target_text' => 'But you and I know it\'s very shameful, and no one talks about the men.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi anda dan saya tahu ia sangat memalukan, dan tiada siapa yang menegur tentang kaum lelaki.', 'order' => 698],
            ['start_time' => 2192.64, 'end_time' => 2194.96, 'target_text' => 'My brother, you need to dress appropriately.', 'source_text' => 'Wahai saudaraku, anda perlu berpakaian dengan sopan dan sempurna.', 'order' => 699],
            ['start_time' => 2195.06, 'end_time' => 2197.16, 'target_text' => 'You must take care of your dress code.', 'source_text' => 'Anda wajib menjaga etika berpakaian anda.', 'order' => 700],
            ['start_time' => 2197.26, 'end_time' => 2199.45, 'target_text' => 'You are very busy worrying about all the sisters.', 'source_text' => 'Anda terlalu sibuk merisaukan tentang semua saudari wanita.', 'order' => 701],
            ['start_time' => 2199.55, 'end_time' => 2202.67, 'target_text' => 'Yes, we are, but We care about our brothers and sisters.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, memang benar, tetapi kita mengambil berat tentang saudara dan saudari kita.', 'order' => 702],
            ['start_time' => 2202.77, 'end_time' => 2204.87, 'target_text' => 'We care about everyone, including myself.', 'source_text' => 'Kita mengambil berat tentang semua orang, termasuk diri saya sendiri.', 'order' => 703],
            ['start_time' => 2204.97, 'end_time' => 2207.09, 'target_text' => 'If I\'m wrong, correct me.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya saya salah, tegurlah saya.', 'order' => 704],
            ['start_time' => 2207.19, 'end_time' => 2208.64, 'target_text' => 'I deserve it.', 'source_text' => 'Saya memang layak ditegur.', 'order' => 705],
            ['start_time' => 2208.74, 'end_time' => 2212.65, 'target_text' => 'If I feel bad because I\'m corrected, I\'m not going to get anywhere.', 'source_text' => 'Jika saya berasa tersinggung kerana ditegur, saya tidak akan ke mana-mana.', 'order' => 706],
            ['start_time' => 2212.75, 'end_time' => 2218.35, 'target_text' => 'If you\'re a person who feels bad when someone corrects you, you\'re not going to get anywhere in life.', 'source_text' => 'Jika anda seorang yang mudah berasa kecil hati apabila ditegur oleh orang lain, anda tidak akan berjaya dalam hidup.', 'order' => 707],
            ['start_time' => 2218.45, 'end_time' => 2222.82, 'target_text' => 'If they were right and you were wrong, wallahi, there\'s a chance you\'ll fail.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya teguran mereka itu benar dan anda yang silap, wallahi, ada kemungkinan besar anda akan kecundang.', 'order' => 708],
            ['start_time' => 2222.92, 'end_time' => 2226.58, 'target_text' => 'Imagine you say that 1 + 1 is 3 and you spend your life saying that.', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan anda mendakwa bahawa 1 + 1 adalah 3 dan anda menghabiskan hidup anda dengan mengatakan perkara itu.', 'order' => 709],
            ['start_time' => 2226.68, 'end_time' => 2232.28, 'target_text' => 'A guy comes up to you: "Habibi, let me tell you, it \'s two." Allah knows my heart.', 'source_text' => 'Seseorang datang kepada anda: "Wahai sahabatku, biar saya beritahu anda, jawapannya adalah dua." Lalu anda jawab: "Allah tahu isi hati saya."', 'order' => 710],
            ['start_time' => 2232.38, 'end_time' => 2233.82, 'target_text' => 'How can you say that?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah anda boleh berkata begitu?', 'order' => 711],
            ['start_time' => 2233.91, 'end_time' => 2234.7, 'target_text' => 'I \'m just telling you.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sekadar memberitahu perkara yang betul.', 'order' => 712],
            ['start_time' => 2234.8, 'end_time' => 2238.64, 'target_text' => 'So, when you take your test and you write that 1 + 1 is 3, you have to write underneath: Allah knows my', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, apabila anda mengambil peperiksaan dan anda menulis bahawa 1 + 1 adalah 3, anda terpaksa menulis di bawahnya: Allah tahu isi', 'order' => 713],
            ['start_time' => 2238.74, 'end_time' => 2239.09, 'target_text' => 'heart.', 'source_text' => 'hati saya.', 'order' => 714],
            ['start_time' => 2239.1, 'end_time' => 2242.88, 'target_text' => 'No matter how many times you write that, you\'ll get a grade for being wrong.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak kira berapa kali pun anda menulis begitu, anda tetap akan diberi markah gagal kerana ia adalah salah.', 'order' => 715],
            ['start_time' => 2242.98, 'end_time' => 2244.97, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what we\'re doing in our lives.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah apa yang sedang kita lakukan dalam kehidupan kita seharian.', 'order' => 716],
            ['start_time' => 2245.07, 'end_time' => 2247.71, 'target_text' => 'Someone says to you: "You know what?" "This is haram." What do you mean by haram?', 'source_text' => 'Seseorang berkata kepada anda: "Tahukah anda?" "Perkara ini haram." Apa maksud anda dengan haram?', 'order' => 717],
            ['start_time' => 2247.81, 'end_time' => 2248.96, 'target_text' => 'Allah knows my heart.', 'source_text' => '"Allah tahu apa yang ada dalam hati saya."', 'order' => 718],
            ['start_time' => 2249.06, 'end_time' => 2250.74, 'target_text' => 'So, we\'re eating pork, Allah knows your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, kita makan daging babi, Allah tahu isi hati anda.', 'order' => 719],
            ['start_time' => 2250.84, 'end_time' => 2252.28, 'target_text' => 'You\'re consuming interest, Allah knows your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Anda memakan riba, Allah tahu isi hati anda.', 'order' => 720],
            ['start_time' => 2252.38, 'end_time' => 2254.89, 'target_text' => 'You\'re not dressing properly, Allah knows your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak berpakaian dengan sopan, Allah tahu isi hati anda.', 'order' => 721],
            ['start_time' => 2254.99, 'end_time' => 2257.45, 'target_text' => 'You\'re selling alcohol, Allah knows your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Anda menjual arak, Allah tahu isi hati anda.', 'order' => 722],
            ['start_time' => 2257.55, 'end_time' => 2259.52, 'target_text' => 'You\'re doing everything else, Allah knows your heart.', 'source_text' => 'Anda melakukan segala perkara mungkar yang lain, lalu berdalih Allah tahu isi hati anda.', 'order' => 723],
            ['start_time' => 2259.62, 'end_time' => 2260.84, 'target_text' => 'What\'s the point of Islam?', 'source_text' => 'Jika begitu, apakah gunanya ajaran Islam?', 'order' => 724],
            ['start_time' => 2260.94, 'end_time' => 2263.24, 'target_text' => 'Allah knows the heart, everyone\'s heart.', 'source_text' => 'Allah Maha Mengetahui isi hati, isi hati setiap insan.', 'order' => 725],
            ['start_time' => 2263.34, 'end_time' => 2267.56, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why I say, don\'t be deceived by Satan\'s statement.', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah saya katakan, janganlah terpedaya dengan perangkap syaitan.', 'order' => 726],
            ['start_time' => 2267.66, 'end_time' => 2269.57, 'target_text' => 'What does he tell you?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang syaitan bisikkan kepada anda?', 'order' => 727],
            ['start_time' => 2269.67, 'end_time' => 2273.25, 'target_text' => 'He tells you that the Hadith is correct.', 'source_text' => 'Dia memberitahu anda bahawa hadis itu adalah benar.', 'order' => 728],
            ['start_time' => 2273.35, 'end_time' => 2276.46, 'target_text' => 'Allah looks at your hearts and your actions.', 'source_text' => 'Allah melihat kepada hati kamu dan amalan perbuatan kamu.', 'order' => 729],
            ['start_time' => 2276.56, 'end_time' => 2279.83, 'target_text' => 'He notices how they go hand in hand.', 'source_text' => 'Perhatikan bagaimana kedua-dua perkara itu saling bergandingan.', 'order' => 730],
            ['start_time' => 2279.93, 'end_time' => 2282.65, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t just say one without the other.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan hanya menyebut satu perkara tanpa perkara yang satu lagi.', 'order' => 731],
            ['start_time' => 2282.75, 'end_time' => 2284.71, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t just say heart without actions.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan hanya menyebut tentang hati tanpa amalan zahir.', 'order' => 732],
            ['start_time' => 2284.81, 'end_time' => 2289.15, 'target_text' => 'Because that Hadith didn\'t just mention the heart, and it didn\'t just mention the actions.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana hadis tersebut bukan hanya menyebut tentang hati semata-mata, dan ia juga bukan hanya menyebut tentang amalan semata-mata.', 'order' => 733],
            ['start_time' => 2289.25, 'end_time' => 2290.28, 'target_text' => 'It mentioned both.', 'source_text' => 'Hadis itu menyebut kedua-duanya sekali.', 'order' => 734],
            ['start_time' => 2290.38, 'end_time' => 2296.8, 'target_text' => 'And from there, some of the Muhadditheen have explained that Allah looks at your heart and your action to', 'source_text' => 'Dan daripada situ, sebahagian ahli hadis (Muhaddithin) telah menjelaskan bahawa Allah melihat kepada hati dan amalan anda untuk', 'order' => 735],
            ['start_time' => 2296.9, 'end_time' => 2298.61, 'target_text' => 'see the intention behind the action.', 'source_text' => 'melihat niat di sebalik amalan tersebut.', 'order' => 736],
            ['start_time' => 2298.71, 'end_time' => 2307.86, 'target_text' => 'And if the action is wrong and the heart is misplaced, in the wrong place, you have completely lost.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sekiranya amalan itu salah dan hati pula tersasar di tempat yang salah, anda telah mengalami kerugian sepenuhnya.', 'order' => 737],
            ['start_time' => 2307.96, 'end_time' => 2310.02, 'target_text' => 'But Allah sees both of them.', 'source_text' => 'Namun Allah melihat kedua-duanya sekali.', 'order' => 738],
            ['start_time' => 2310.12, 'end_time' => 2313.72, 'target_text' => 'You need to perform your salah, and Allah will help and guide you.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu mendirikan solat anda, dan Allah akan membantu serta membimbing anda.', 'order' => 739],
            ['start_time' => 2313.82, 'end_time' => 2320.01, 'target_text' => 'If I see someone performing salah in the mosque and I go in, I can\'t say, " Look at this guy, he\'s showing', 'source_text' => 'Jika saya melihat seseorang sedang mendirikan solat di dalam masjid dan saya masuk, saya tidak boleh berkata, "Lihatlah orang ini, dia sedang menunjuk-nunjuk', 'order' => 740],
            ['start_time' => 2320.11, 'end_time' => 2322.25, 'target_text' => 'off." How do I know he\'s showing off?', 'source_text' => '(ria\')." Bagaimana saya boleh tahu dia sedang menunjuk-nunjuk?', 'order' => 741],
            ['start_time' => 2322.35, 'end_time' => 2323.12, 'target_text' => 'It\'s an act.', 'source_text' => 'Itu adalah suatu amalan ibadah.', 'order' => 742],
            ['start_time' => 2323.22, 'end_time' => 2324.47, 'target_text' => 'Allah knows his heart.', 'source_text' => 'Allah Maha Mengetahui isi hatinya.', 'order' => 743],
            ['start_time' => 2324.57, 'end_time' => 2327.16, 'target_text' => 'In that case, it\'s correct to say that Allah knows the heart of man.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam situasi seperti itu, barulah tepat untuk dikatakan bahawa Allah Maha Mengetahui isi hati manusia.', 'order' => 744],
            ['start_time' => 2327.26, 'end_time' => 2328.28, 'target_text' => 'Leave him alone.', 'source_text' => 'Biarkanlah dia beribadah.', 'order' => 745],
            ['start_time' => 2328.38, 'end_time' => 2330.95, 'target_text' => 'But never use it to justify anything.', 'source_text' => 'Namun jangan sesekali menggunakannya untuk menghalalkan apa jua kesalahan.', 'order' => 746],
            ['start_time' => 2331.05, 'end_time' => 2333.51, 'target_text' => 'I want to teach you something, my dear children.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ingin mengajarkan sesuatu kepada anda, wahai anak-anak yang saya kasihi.', 'order' => 747],
            ['start_time' => 2333.61, 'end_time' => 2338.09, 'target_text' => 'When someone corrects you, you should say, "Jazakum Allahu Khair." Thank you very much." In my case, someone', 'source_text' => 'Apabila seseorang menegur anda, anda sepatutnya berkata, "Jazakumullahu Khairan." Terima kasih banyak-banyak." Dalam kes saya sendiri, masih ada yang menegur', 'order' => 748],
            ['start_time' => 2338.19, 'end_time' => 2339.49, 'target_text' => 'still corrects me to this day.', 'source_text' => 'saya sehingga ke hari ini.', 'order' => 749],
            ['start_time' => 2339.59, 'end_time' => 2342.97, 'target_text' => 'They say, "This guy, you\'ve probably heard this before." He doesn\'t talk about Gaza.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka berkata, "Orang ini, anda mungkin pernah mendengar tuduhan ini sebelum ini." Dia tidak bercakap tentang Gaza.', 'order' => 750],
            ['start_time' => 2343.07, 'end_time' => 2343.97, 'target_text' => 'It doesn\'t do this.', 'source_text' => 'Dia tidak melakukan perkara ini.', 'order' => 751],
            ['start_time' => 2344.07, 'end_time' => 2345.66, 'target_text' => '"He\'s a Zionist." You know what?', 'source_text' => '"Dia seorang Zionis." Tahukah anda apa jawapannya?', 'order' => 752],
            ['start_time' => 2345.76, 'end_time' => 2346.38, 'target_text' => 'That\'s their opinion.', 'source_text' => 'Itu pandangan mereka.', 'order' => 753],
            ['start_time' => 2346.48, 'end_time' => 2348.19, 'target_text' => 'They probably do n\'t know.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka mungkin tidak mengetahui perkara sebenar.', 'order' => 754],
            ['start_time' => 2348.29, 'end_time' => 2351.53, 'target_text' => 'They\'re probably victims of algorithms and don\'t even know it.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka mungkin menjadi mangsa algoritma media sosial tanpa mereka sedari.', 'order' => 755],
            ['start_time' => 2351.64, 'end_time' => 2357.78, 'target_text' => 'But I don\'t want to start a war with my own brothers and sisters because they think badly of me.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi saya tidak mahu memulakan peperangan dengan saudara-saudari saya sendiri semata-mata kerana mereka bersangka buruk terhadap saya.', 'order' => 756],
            ['start_time' => 2357.88, 'end_time' => 2362.72, 'target_text' => 'I\'d rather they think badly of me and the ummah remain united than fight with them and split the ummah in', 'source_text' => 'Saya lebih rela mereka bersangka buruk terhadap saya asalkan ummah kekal bersatu padu, daripada saya berbalah dengan mereka lalu memecahbelahkan ummah kepada', 'order' => 757],
            ['start_time' => 2362.82, 'end_time' => 2364.1, 'target_text' => '20 other ways.', 'source_text' => '20 puak yang lain.', 'order' => 758],
            ['start_time' => 2364.2, 'end_time' => 2366.94, 'target_text' => 'We are not Zionists.', 'source_text' => 'Kita bukan Zionis.', 'order' => 759],
            ['start_time' => 2367.04, 'end_time' => 2372.8, 'target_text' => 'We are definitely pro- Palestine and pro-Gaza, and we have done more than we have announced.', 'source_text' => 'Kita sudah pasti teguh menyokong Palestin dan menyokong Gaza, dan kita telah berbuat jauh lebih banyak daripada apa yang kami war-warkan secara terbuka.', 'order' => 760],
            ['start_time' => 2372.89, 'end_time' => 2378.57, 'target_text' => 'And we will certainly continue to speak out about the genocide that continues to this day.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita sudah tentu akan terus bersuara membantah pembunuhan beramai-ramai (genosid) yang berterusan sehingga ke hari ini.', 'order' => 761],
            ['start_time' => 2378.67, 'end_time' => 2382.39, 'target_text' => 'Even though they say there is a ceasefire, what ceasefire?', 'source_text' => 'Walaupun mereka mengatakan kononnya ada gencatan senjata, gencatan senjata apa?', 'order' => 762],
            ['start_time' => 2382.49, 'end_time' => 2384.58, 'target_text' => 'Every day they are dying.', 'source_text' => 'Setiap hari saudara kita terkorban.', 'order' => 763],
            ['start_time' => 2384.68, 'end_time' => 2386.43, 'target_text' => 'Not just dying, but being massacred and murdered.', 'source_text' => 'Bukan sekadar meninggal dunia biasa, malah dibantai dan dibunuh dengan kejam.', 'order' => 764],
            ['start_time' => 2386.53, 'end_time' => 2388.31, 'target_text' => 'And every day land is being seized.', 'source_text' => 'Dan setiap hari tanah mereka terus dirampas.', 'order' => 765],
            ['start_time' => 2388.41, 'end_time' => 2389.73, 'target_text' => 'Do you know that?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda tentang hakikat itu?', 'order' => 766],
            ['start_time' => 2389.83, 'end_time' => 2393.26, 'target_text' => 'I came here and wanted to tell you, you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Saya datang ke sini dan ingin memberitahu anda, tahukah anda?', 'order' => 767],
            ['start_time' => 2393.36, 'end_time' => 2397.81, 'target_text' => 'Our brothers and sisters are everywhere, but I am very, very aware of what is happening.', 'source_text' => 'Saudara-saudari kita berada di merata tempat, namun saya amat-amat peka terhadap apa yang sedang berlaku.', 'order' => 768],
            ['start_time' => 2397.91, 'end_time' => 2398.45, 'target_text' => 'Believe me.', 'source_text' => 'Percayalah kepada saya.', 'order' => 769],
            ['start_time' => 2398.55, 'end_time' => 2403.62, 'target_text' => 'I will tell you what happened today in Nepal, what happened yesterday in Indonesia, and the last two weeks', 'source_text' => 'Saya boleh memberitahu anda apa yang berlaku hari ini di Nepal, apa yang berlaku semalam di Indonesia, dan dua minggu lepas', 'order' => 770],
            ['start_time' => 2403.72, 'end_time' => 2404.07, 'target_text' => 'in the Philippines.', 'source_text' => 'di Filipina.', 'order' => 771],
            ['start_time' => 2404.08, 'end_time' => 2404.58, 'target_text' => 'I will keep you informed.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sentiasa mengikuti perkembangan maklumat terkini.', 'order' => 772],
            ['start_time' => 2404.68, 'end_time' => 2406.11, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what it\'s about.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah peranan yang kita pikul.', 'order' => 773],
            ['start_time' => 2406.21, 'end_time' => 2412.46, 'target_text' => 'There were earthquakes, landslides, tsunamis, there was so much more there, and so much destruction and flooding.', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat gempa bumi, tanah runtuh, tsunami, terdapat begitu banyak lagi musibah di sana, serta kemusnahan dan banjir yang teruk.', 'order' => 774],
            ['start_time' => 2412.56, 'end_time' => 2415.1, 'target_text' => 'Do you know this?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda mengenai perkara ini?', 'order' => 775],
            ['start_time' => 2415.2, 'end_time' => 2416.26, 'target_text' => 'So, it\'s worldwide.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, ini berlaku di seluruh dunia.', 'order' => 776],
            ['start_time' => 2416.36, 'end_time' => 2417.68, 'target_text' => 'I belong to a charity.', 'source_text' => 'Saya menganggotai sebuah badan kebajikan.', 'order' => 777],
            ['start_time' => 2417.78, 'end_time' => 2420.59, 'target_text' => 'I work with an international aid organization.', 'source_text' => 'Saya bekerjasama rapat dengan organisasi bantuan kemanusiaan antarabangsa.', 'order' => 778],
            ['start_time' => 2420.69, 'end_time' => 2423.03, 'target_text' => 'Do you really think I don\'t know that?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda benar-benar fikir saya tidak mengetahui perkara-perkara tersebut?', 'order' => 779],
            ['start_time' => 2423.14, 'end_time' => 2426.22, 'target_text' => 'If you didn\'t see something, who does that platform belong to?', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda tidak melihat sesuatu hantaran, siapakah pemilik platform media sosial berkenaan?', 'order' => 780],
            ['start_time' => 2426.32, 'end_time' => 2427.63, 'target_text' => 'Why didn\'t you see it?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapakah anda tidak melihatnya?', 'order' => 781],
            ['start_time' => 2427.73, 'end_time' => 2432.5, 'target_text' => 'You know, there\'s something called " shadow banning," there\'s something called removal, there\'s something called...', 'source_text' => 'Anda tahu, ada sesuatu yang dipanggil "shadow banning" (sekatan bayangan), ada sesuatu yang dipanggil penyingkiran kandungan, ada sesuatu yang dipanggil...', 'order' => 782],
            ['start_time' => 2432.6, 'end_time' => 2433.86, 'target_text' => 'there are so many things.', 'source_text' => 'terdapat begitu banyak perkara di sebalik tabir.', 'order' => 783],
            ['start_time' => 2433.96, 'end_time' => 2435.69, 'target_text' => 'It doesn\'t belong to you or me.', 'source_text' => 'Platform itu bukan kepunyaan anda mahupun saya.', 'order' => 784],
            ['start_time' => 2435.79, 'end_time' => 2437.67, 'target_text' => 'Anyway, I don\'t want to get into that.', 'source_text' => 'Walau apa pun, saya tidak mahu memanjangkan isu tersebut.', 'order' => 785],
            ['start_time' => 2437.77, 'end_time' => 2441.72, 'target_text' => 'All I\'m saying is, even when people say something to me, I just say jazakallah khair.', 'source_text' => 'Apa yang ingin saya katakan ialah, walaupun apabila orang melemparkan kata-kata kepada saya, saya hanya menjawab jazakallahu khair.', 'order' => 786],
            ['start_time' => 2441.82, 'end_time' => 2443.37, 'target_text' => 'Dude, please do dua for me.', 'source_text' => 'Saudaraku, tolonglah doakan kebaikan untuk saya.', 'order' => 787],
            ['start_time' => 2443.47, 'end_time' => 2444.01, 'target_text' => 'I\'m weak.', 'source_text' => 'Saya seorang insan yang serba lemah.', 'order' => 788],
            ['start_time' => 2444.11, 'end_time' => 2444.66, 'target_text' => 'That\'s it.', 'source_text' => 'Itu sahaja.', 'order' => 789],
            ['start_time' => 2444.76, 'end_time' => 2446.7, 'target_text' => 'End it there and move on.', 'source_text' => 'Noktahkan di situ dan teruskan melangkah ke hadapan.', 'order' => 790],
            ['start_time' => 2446.8, 'end_time' => 2447.67, 'target_text' => 'I\'m weak.', 'source_text' => 'Saya seorang yang lemah.', 'order' => 791],
            ['start_time' => 2447.77, 'end_time' => 2450.05, 'target_text' => 'That\'s the best way to end the discussion.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah cara yang terbaik untuk menamatkan sebarang perbalahan.', 'order' => 792],
            ['start_time' => 2450.15, 'end_time' => 2451.81, 'target_text' => 'Someone says, "You know what?" You didn\'t do this.', 'source_text' => 'Seseorang berkata, "Tahukah anda?" Anda tidak melakukan perkara ini.', 'order' => 793],
            ['start_time' => 2451.91, 'end_time' => 2457.18, 'target_text' => '"You didn\'t do that." The other day at one of the masses, I asked the people, I said, "Please give me some', 'source_text' => '"Anda tidak melakukan perkara itu." Pada suatu hari di salah satu perjumpaan jemaah, saya bertanya kepada orang ramai, saya berkata, "Sila berikan saya sedikit', 'order' => 794],
            ['start_time' => 2457.28, 'end_time' => 2458.82, 'target_text' => 'advice." Many people raised their hands.', 'source_text' => 'nasihat." Ramai jemaah yang mengangkat tangan.', 'order' => 795],
            ['start_time' => 2458.93, 'end_time' => 2461.58, 'target_text' => 'And one of the brothers gave me some very good advice.', 'source_text' => 'Dan salah seorang saudara kita telah memberikan nasihat yang sangat bernas kepada saya.', 'order' => 796],
            ['start_time' => 2461.68, 'end_time' => 2466.28, 'target_text' => 'And I said, " Thank you very much." Wallahi, what he said touched my heart.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya berkata, "Terima kasih banyak-banyak." Wallahi, apa yang beliau katakan benar-benar menyentuh hati saya.', 'order' => 797],
            ['start_time' => 2466.38, 'end_time' => 2468.77, 'target_text' => 'But I was willing to listen to anything.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana saya sentiasa bersedia untuk mendengar apa jua pandangan.', 'order' => 798],
            ['start_time' => 2468.87, 'end_time' => 2474.92, 'target_text' => 'Imagine if I asked you, "Give me some advice." Many of you are dying to tell me something to correct me.', 'source_text' => 'Bayangkan sekiranya saya bertanya kepada anda, "Berikan saya sedikit teguran." Ramai antara anda pasti berkobar-kobar mahu menyampaikan sesuatu untuk memperbetulkan saya.', 'order' => 799],
            ['start_time' => 2475.02, 'end_time' => 2477.63, 'target_text' => 'Perhaps you have heard something, seen something.', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin anda pernah mendengar sesuatu, melihat sesuatu khabar.', 'order' => 800],
            ['start_time' => 2477.73, 'end_time' => 2481.95, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, I am willing to listen to you and I want to be corrected, because I believe that the only way we', 'source_text' => 'Wallahi, saya bersedia mendengar teguran anda dan saya ingin dibetulkan, kerana saya yakin bahawa satu-satunya cara kita', 'order' => 801],
            ['start_time' => 2482.05, 'end_time' => 2485.43, 'target_text' => 'can surpass the whole world is by accepting correction.', 'source_text' => 'boleh mengatasi seluruh dunia adalah dengan berlapang dada menerima teguran.', 'order' => 802],
            ['start_time' => 2485.53, 'end_time' => 2487.65, 'target_text' => 'Otherwise, you will get nowhere.', 'source_text' => 'Jika tidak, anda tidak akan ke mana-mana.', 'order' => 803],
            ['start_time' => 2487.75, 'end_time' => 2490.46, 'target_text' => 'When I was reading the Quran, I thought I knew everything.', 'source_text' => 'Semasa saya membaca al-Quran dahulu, saya menyangka saya sudah mengetahui segalanya.', 'order' => 804],
            ['start_time' => 2490.56, 'end_time' => 2493.31, 'target_text' => 'I went to another teacher and he corrected what I already knew.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pergi berguru dengan seorang guru lain dan beliau memperbetulkan apa yang saya sangka saya sudah tahu.', 'order' => 805],
            ['start_time' => 2493.41, 'end_time' => 2497.18, 'target_text' => 'And then I went to a third teacher, and he corrected what I learned from the second.', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian saya pergi berguru dengan guru yang ketiga, dan beliau memperbetulkan pula apa yang telah saya pelajari daripada guru kedua.', 'order' => 806],
            ['start_time' => 2497.28, 'end_time' => 2501.58, 'target_text' => 'And then I obtained the ijaza, and I made sure that that ijaza was of a very high level.', 'source_text' => 'Dan selepas itu barulah saya memperoleh ijazah sanad, dan saya memastikan bahawa ijazah sanad itu berada pada tahap yang sangat tinggi.', 'order' => 807],
            ['start_time' => 2501.68, 'end_time' => 2502.3, 'target_text' => 'And What happened?', 'source_text' => 'Dan apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 808],
            ['start_time' => 2502.39, 'end_time' => 2505.1, 'target_text' => 'Now we\'ve learned something we truly didn\'t imagine.', 'source_text' => 'Kini kita telah mempelajari sesuatu yang benar-benar tidak pernah kita bayangkan sebelumnya.', 'order' => 809],
            ['start_time' => 2505.2, 'end_time' => 2508.14, 'target_text' => 'And when we were young, we wouldn\'t have believed it.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ketika kita masih muda, kita mungkin tidak akan mempercayainya.', 'order' => 810],
            ['start_time' => 2508.24, 'end_time' => 2509.39, 'target_text' => 'Why not, you know?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa tidak, anda tahu?', 'order' => 811],
            ['start_time' => 2509.49, 'end_time' => 2510.49, 'target_text' => 'I\'m reading the Quran.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sedang membaca al-Quran.', 'order' => 812],
            ['start_time' => 2510.59, 'end_time' => 2512.52, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes we hear people reading the Quran.', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala kita mendengar orang membaca al-Quran.', 'order' => 813],
            ['start_time' => 2512.62, 'end_time' => 2513.35, 'target_text' => 'And you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan tahukah anda apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 814],
            ['start_time' => 2513.45, 'end_time' => 2515.42, 'target_text' => 'In my mind, I say that this person needs correction.', 'source_text' => 'Di dalam hati saya, saya berkata bahawa orang ini memerlukan pembetulan (teguran tajwid).', 'order' => 815],
            ['start_time' => 2515.52, 'end_time' => 2517.77, 'target_text' => 'Someone with love should approach them.', 'source_text' => 'Seseorang yang penuh kasih sayang sepatutnya mendekati mereka.', 'order' => 816],
            ['start_time' => 2517.87, 'end_time' => 2523.03, 'target_text' => 'Beautiful voice, beautiful tone, beautiful melody, but without tajweed, without pronunciation.', 'source_text' => 'Suara yang merdu, taranum yang indah, alunan lagu yang sedap, namun tanpa tajwid, tanpa sebutan makhraj yang betul.', 'order' => 817],
            ['start_time' => 2523.13, 'end_time' => 2524.36, 'target_text' => 'How could you tell?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah anda boleh mengetahuinya?', 'order' => 818],
            ['start_time' => 2524.46, 'end_time' => 2528.26, 'target_text' => 'Innamal ya\'rifu fadlihi minan nas idawuhu.', 'source_text' => 'Innama ya\'rifu fadlahu minan-nasi zawuhu (Hanya orang yang berilmu memahami nilai orang yang berilmu).', 'order' => 819],
            ['start_time' => 2528.36, 'end_time' => 2530.78, 'target_text' => 'What does that mean?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah maksudnya itu?', 'order' => 820],
            ['start_time' => 2530.88, 'end_time' => 2537.04, 'target_text' => 'In fact, people of a certain virtue are only recognized by people of similar virtue.', 'source_text' => 'Hakikatnya, orang yang memiliki keutamaan tertentu hanya akan dikenali oleh mereka yang mempunyai keutamaan yang setaraf.', 'order' => 821],
            ['start_time' => 2537.14, 'end_time' => 2541.42, 'target_text' => 'It takes a Qari of the Quran to recognize another Qari of the Quran.', 'source_text' => 'Hanya seorang qari al-Quran yang dapat menilai kehebatan seorang qari al-Quran yang lain.', 'order' => 822],
            ['start_time' => 2541.52, 'end_time' => 2544.5, 'target_text' => 'The rest of the audience says, "Masha\'Allah!" Takbir!', 'source_text' => 'Jemaah yang lain hanya bersorak, "Masya-Allah! Takbir!"', 'order' => 823],
            ['start_time' => 2544.6, 'end_time' => 2548.49, 'target_text' => '"And the sheikh sitting in front says, \'You know what?\'" He could not pronounce his qa.', 'source_text' => '"Tetapi syeikh yang duduk di hadapan berkata, \'Tahukah anda?\' Beliau tidak dapat menyebut huruf qaf dengan tepat.', 'order' => 824],
            ['start_time' => 2548.59, 'end_time' => 2557.76, 'target_text' => 'Instead of qalb, he says kalb." I corrected a brother who said that and he got angry with me.', 'source_text' => 'Sebaliknya daripada qalb (hati), dia menyebut kalb (anjing)." Saya pernah menegur seorang saudara yang membaca begitu dan dia memarahi saya.', 'order' => 825],
            ['start_time' => 2557.86, 'end_time' => 2564.64, 'target_text' => 'I said to him, "Habibi, if you know Arabic, you\'ll know that what you said is haram." It is not allowed.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berkata kepadanya, "Wahai sahabatku, jika anda tahu bahasa Arab, anda akan faham bahawa apa yang anda sebutkan itu tidak dibenarkan (haram)." Ia tidak dibenarkan.', 'order' => 826],
            ['start_time' => 2564.74, 'end_time' => 2567.38, 'target_text' => 'Qalb means heart and kalb means dog.', 'source_text' => 'Qalb bermaksud hati dan kalb bermaksud anjing.', 'order' => 827],
            ['start_time' => 2567.48, 'end_time' => 2568.64, 'target_text' => 'And you\'re saying kalb.', 'source_text' => 'Dan anda menyebut kalb.', 'order' => 828],
            ['start_time' => 2568.74, 'end_time' => 2569.52, 'target_text' => 'Come on, man.', 'source_text' => 'Tenanglah, sahabatku.', 'order' => 829],
            ['start_time' => 2569.62, 'end_time' => 2570.27, 'target_text' => 'Relax.', 'source_text' => 'Bertenanglah.', 'order' => 830],
            ['start_time' => 2570.37, 'end_time' => 2571.01, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t feel bad.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan berasa kecil hati.', 'order' => 831],
            ['start_time' => 2571.11, 'end_time' => 2572.4, 'target_text' => 'It is the word of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Ini adalah kalamullah (firman Allah).', 'order' => 832],
            ['start_time' => 2572.5, 'end_time' => 2573.65, 'target_text' => 'You need to be corrected.', 'source_text' => 'Anda perlu diperbetulkan.', 'order' => 833],
            ['start_time' => 2573.75, 'end_time' => 2578.62, 'target_text' => 'When the Imam stands up, no matter who the Imam is, the Imam of the Haram, if someone corrects him from behind', 'source_text' => 'Apabila imam bangun mengimami solat, tidak kira siapa pun imam itu, walau Imam Masjidil Haram sekalipun, jika seseorang menegurnya dari belakang', 'order' => 834],
            ['start_time' => 2578.72, 'end_time' => 2580.24, 'target_text' => 'and he feels bad, what happens?', 'source_text' => 'dan dia berasa tersinggung, apa yang akan berlaku?', 'order' => 835],
            ['start_time' => 2580.34, 'end_time' => 2581.02, 'target_text' => 'Do they feel bad?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah mereka berasa kecil hati?', 'order' => 836],
            ['start_time' => 2581.12, 'end_time' => 2581.71, 'target_text' => 'They don\'t feel bad.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka langsung tidak berasa kecil hati.', 'order' => 837],
            ['start_time' => 2581.81, 'end_time' => 2582.95, 'target_text' => 'Do you know what I love?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa yang saya kagumi?', 'order' => 838],
            ['start_time' => 2583.05, 'end_time' => 2585.19, 'target_text' => 'When he was young, he used to lead the Tarawih.', 'source_text' => 'Ketika masih muda dahulu, seseorang biasa mengimamkan Tarawih.', 'order' => 839],
            ['start_time' => 2585.29, 'end_time' => 2587.48, 'target_text' => 'From the age of 14, I was an Imam in the mosque.', 'source_text' => 'Sejak usia 14 tahun, saya sudah menjadi imam di masjid.', 'order' => 840],
            ['start_time' => 2587.58, 'end_time' => 2588.54, 'target_text' => 'He used to run the Tarawih.', 'source_text' => 'Beliau biasa memimpin solat Tarawih.', 'order' => 841],
            ['start_time' => 2588.64, 'end_time' => 2593.52, 'target_text' => 'In some cases he recited the entire Quran, and in others a part of it.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam beberapa keadaan beliau membaca seluruh al-Quran, dan dalam keadaan lain sebahagian daripadanya.', 'order' => 842],
            ['start_time' => 2593.62, 'end_time' => 2596.64, 'target_text' => 'And when someone corrects us, they don\'t even give you a moment before they shoot.', 'source_text' => 'Dan apabila seseorang menegur kita, mereka langsung tidak memberi ruang sesaat pun sebelum terus membetulkan.', 'order' => 843],
            ['start_time' => 2596.74, 'end_time' => 2598.41, 'target_text' => 'And we used to feel bad.', 'source_text' => 'Dan dahulu kami pernah berasa kecil hati.', 'order' => 844],
            ['start_time' => 2598.51, 'end_time' => 2603.04, 'target_text' => 'We used to think, "Hey, at least give me a few seconds." "When you know this guy is just tripping." And', 'source_text' => 'Kami berfikir, "Tolonglah beri saya beberapa saat dahulu." "Bila anda tahu orang ini cuma tersasul sedikit." Dan', 'order' => 845],
            ['start_time' => 2603.14, 'end_time' => 2605.06, 'target_text' => 'then I went to Mecca.', 'source_text' => 'kemudian saya pergi ke Mekah.', 'order' => 846],
            ['start_time' => 2605.16, 'end_time' => 2608.37, 'target_text' => 'When I went to Mecca, it was during Ramadan in 1988.', 'source_text' => 'Semasa saya pergi ke Mekah, ia adalah pada bulan Ramadan tahun 1988.', 'order' => 847],
            ['start_time' => 2608.47, 'end_time' => 2610.42, 'target_text' => 'There were three Imams in Mecca.', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat tiga orang imam di Mekah ketika itu.', 'order' => 848],
            ['start_time' => 2610.52, 'end_time' => 2613.89, 'target_text' => 'They used to read the entire Tarawih, one day each, taking turns.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka mengimamkan keseluruhan solat Tarawih, bergilir-gilir seorang satu hari.', 'order' => 849],
            ['start_time' => 2613.99, 'end_time' => 2615.38, 'target_text' => 'Do you know who they were?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda siapakah mereka?', 'order' => 850],
            ['start_time' => 2615.48, 'end_time' => 2617.71, 'target_text' => 'On the first day, Sheikh Abdur Rahman Al Sudais.', 'source_text' => 'Pada hari pertama, Sheikh Abdur Rahman Al-Sudais.', 'order' => 851],
            ['start_time' => 2617.81, 'end_time' => 2620.0, 'target_text' => 'On the second day, Sheikh Ali Abdullah Jaber.', 'source_text' => 'Pada hari kedua, Sheikh Ali Abdullah Jaber.', 'order' => 852],
            ['start_time' => 2620.1, 'end_time' => 2623.62, 'target_text' => 'And on the third day, Sheikh Ali Abdur Rahman Al Huthaify.', 'source_text' => 'Dan pada hari ketiga, Sheikh Ali Abdur Rahman Al-Huthaify.', 'order' => 853],
            ['start_time' => 2623.72, 'end_time' => 2626.45, 'target_text' => 'This was in Mecca in 1988, right?', 'source_text' => 'Ini berlaku di Mekah pada tahun 1988, betul?', 'order' => 854],
            ['start_time' => 2626.55, 'end_time' => 2629.35, 'target_text' => 'Those were the three Imams who used to rotate.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka bertiga itulah para imam yang sentiasa bergilir.', 'order' => 855],
            ['start_time' => 2629.45, 'end_time' => 2630.29, 'target_text' => 'So, what happened?', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, apa yang berlaku?', 'order' => 856],
            ['start_time' => 2630.39, 'end_time' => 2635.49, 'target_text' => 'When someone makes a mistake, they correct it and carry on as if nothing happened.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila seseorang melakukan kesilapan bacaan, mereka terus membetulkannya dan meneruskan solat seolah-olah tiada apa yang berlaku.', 'order' => 857],
            ['start_time' => 2635.59, 'end_time' => 2638.62, 'target_text' => 'They continue, nobody feels bad, the tone doesn\'t change.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka terus membaca, tiada siapa yang berasa kecil hati, nada suara langsung tidak berubah.', 'order' => 858],
            ['start_time' => 2638.72, 'end_time' => 2642.8, 'target_text' => 'When I was corrected, the tone changed, I felt annoyed and wanted to give up.', 'source_text' => 'Dahulu apabila saya ditegur, nada suara saya berubah, saya berasa jengkel dan rasa mahu berputus asa.', 'order' => 859],
            ['start_time' => 2642.9, 'end_time' => 2644.37, 'target_text' => 'Okay, you made two or three mistakes.', 'source_text' => 'Baiklah, anda telah melakukan dua atau tiga kesilapan bacaan.', 'order' => 860],
            ['start_time' => 2644.47, 'end_time' => 2648.96, 'target_text' => 'Now I\'m feeling down and, you know, deflated.', 'source_text' => 'Kini saya mula rasa sedih dan patah semangat.', 'order' => 861],
            ['start_time' => 2649.06, 'end_time' => 2649.12, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa begitu?', 'order' => 862],
            ['start_time' => 2649.13, 'end_time' => 2651.06, 'target_text' => 'Who are you trying to impress by saying you didn\'t make any mistakes?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah yang anda cuba kagumkan dengan mengatakan anda tidak melakukan sebarang kesilapan?', 'order' => 863],
            ['start_time' => 2651.16, 'end_time' => 2652.86, 'target_text' => 'No, I want to impress Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, saya hanya mahu mencari keredaan Allah.', 'order' => 864],
            ['start_time' => 2652.96, 'end_time' => 2657.27, 'target_text' => 'Oh Allah, I was corrected and I accepted the correction because this is Your word.', 'source_text' => 'Ya Allah, saya ditegur dan saya menerima teguran itu kerana ini adalah firman-Mu.', 'order' => 865],
            ['start_time' => 2657.37, 'end_time' => 2658.84, 'target_text' => 'It\'s nobody else\'s book.', 'source_text' => 'Ia bukan kitab kepunyaan sesiapa pun.', 'order' => 866],
            ['start_time' => 2658.94, 'end_time' => 2661.22, 'target_text' => 'I felt good.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berasa lega dan tenang.', 'order' => 867],
            ['start_time' => 2661.32, 'end_time' => 2662.86, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 868],
            ['start_time' => 2662.97, 'end_time' => 2666.19, 'target_text' => 'So alhamdulillah, feel good when someone corrects you.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi alhamdulillah, berlapang dadalah apabila seseorang memperbetulkan anda.', 'order' => 869],
            ['start_time' => 2666.29, 'end_time' => 2670.83, 'target_text' => 'After that I learned: now correct me, I won\'t feel bad because I realized it, you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Selepas peristiwa itu saya belajar: sekarang tegurlah saya, saya tidak akan berkecil hati kerana saya telah sedar, tahukah anda?', 'order' => 870],
            ['start_time' => 2670.93, 'end_time' => 2672.54, 'target_text' => 'Do you want to be an Imam of the Haram?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda mahu menjadi seorang Imam di Masjidil Haram?', 'order' => 871],
            ['start_time' => 2672.64, 'end_time' => 2674.2, 'target_text' => 'You shouldn\'t feel bad when you are corrected.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tidak sepatutnya berasa tersinggung apabila diperbetulkan.', 'order' => 872],
            ['start_time' => 2674.3, 'end_time' => 2675.85, 'target_text' => 'To this day they are still enthusiastic.', 'source_text' => 'Sehingga ke hari ini mereka masih bersemangat.', 'order' => 873],
            ['start_time' => 2675.95, 'end_time' => 2680.5, 'target_text' => 'You correct any of them, subhanallah, they will accept the correction and carry on as if nothing happened, because', 'source_text' => 'Jika anda menegur mana-mana antara mereka, subhanallah, mereka akan menerima teguran itu dan meneruskan bacaan seperti biasa, kerana', 'order' => 874],
            ['start_time' => 2680.6, 'end_time' => 2681.78, 'target_text' => 'they are human beings.', 'source_text' => 'mereka hanyalah manusia biasa.', 'order' => 875],
            ['start_time' => 2681.88, 'end_time' => 2684.67, 'target_text' => 'And sometimes many mistakes occur in the Haram.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kadangkala banyak kesilapan bacaan berlaku di Masjidil Haram.', 'order' => 876],
            ['start_time' => 2684.77, 'end_time' => 2685.08, 'target_text' => 'Many.', 'source_text' => 'Banyak kesilapan.', 'order' => 877],
            ['start_time' => 2685.09, 'end_time' => 2686.74, 'target_text' => 'Because they are all human.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana mereka semua adalah manusia.', 'order' => 878],
            ['start_time' => 2686.84, 'end_time' => 2690.81, 'target_text' => 'The point I\'m making here is that we shouldn\'t make excuses when we\'re corrected.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara utama yang ingin saya tekankan di sini ialah kita tidak sepatutnya memberi alasan apabila ditegur.', 'order' => 879],
            ['start_time' => 2690.91, 'end_time' => 2692.51, 'target_text' => 'I want to correct myself.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mahu memperbetulkan diri saya.', 'order' => 880],
            ['start_time' => 2692.61, 'end_time' => 2696.53, 'target_text' => 'I need that scale, on judgment day, to tip to the right side.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mahu timbangan neraca itu, pada hari kiamat kelak, condong berat ke sebelah kanan.', 'order' => 881],
            ['start_time' => 2696.63, 'end_time' => 2700.51, 'target_text' => 'So keep doing many, many, many good deeds with the help and will of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Maka teruskanlah melakukan banyak, banyak, banyak amalan kebaikan dengan pertolongan dan keizinan Allah.', 'order' => 882],
            ['start_time' => 2700.61, 'end_time' => 2703.74, 'target_text' => 'So, we began seeking Allah\'s forgiveness.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, kita bermula dengan memohon keampunan Allah (istighfar).', 'order' => 883],
            ['start_time' => 2703.84, 'end_time' => 2705.5, 'target_text' => 'Secondly, be humble.', 'source_text' => 'Keduanya, bersikaplah rendah diri (tawaduk).', 'order' => 884],
            ['start_time' => 2705.6, 'end_time' => 2711.31, 'target_text' => 'Become someone who is not arrogant, because with arrogance you will not get far in life.', 'source_text' => 'Jadilah seorang yang tidak sombong, kerana dengan sifat takbur anda tidak akan pergi jauh dalam hidup.', 'order' => 885],
            ['start_time' => 2711.41, 'end_time' => 2718.07, 'target_text' => 'La ilaha illallah Muhammad Rasul Allah Muhammad Rasul Allah Muhammad Rasul Allah Muhammad Rasul Allah.', 'source_text' => 'La ilaha illallah Muhammad Rasulullah Muhammad Rasulullah Muhammad Rasulullah Muhammad Rasulullah.', 'order' => 886],
            ['start_time' => 2718.16, 'end_time' => 2721.73, 'target_text' => 'He who has even a drop of pride in his heart will not enter paradise.', 'source_text' => 'Sesiapa yang mempunyai walau sebesar zarah sifat sombong di dalam hatinya tidak akan masuk ke dalam syurga.', 'order' => 887],
            ['start_time' => 2721.83, 'end_time' => 2722.33, 'target_text' => 'Eliminate pride.', 'source_text' => 'Hapuskanlah sifat sombong.', 'order' => 888],
            ['start_time' => 2722.43, 'end_time' => 2723.1, 'target_text' => 'Who am I?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah saya?', 'order' => 889],
            ['start_time' => 2723.2, 'end_time' => 2724.01, 'target_text' => 'I am your brother.', 'source_text' => 'Saya hanyalah saudara anda.', 'order' => 890],
            ['start_time' => 2724.11, 'end_time' => 2724.76, 'target_text' => 'May Allah bless.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah merahmati.', 'order' => 891],
            ['start_time' => 2724.86, 'end_time' => 2730.32, 'target_text' => 'If I finish this talk, wallahi, if the mosque were perhaps half full or a quarter full, I would probably have', 'source_text' => 'Jika saya selesai menyampaikan ceramah ini, wallahi, jika masjid ini mungkin separuh penuh atau suku penuh, saya mungkin akan', 'order' => 892],
            ['start_time' => 2730.42, 'end_time' => 2734.48, 'target_text' => 'sat down afterwards, greeted everyone and, you know, shaken people\'s hands and so on.', 'source_text' => 'duduk selepas itu, menyapa semua orang dan bersalaman dengan para jemaah.', 'order' => 893],
            ['start_time' => 2734.58, 'end_time' => 2735.49, 'target_text' => 'But I have a duty.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi saya mempunyai satu kewajipan.', 'order' => 894],
            ['start_time' => 2735.59, 'end_time' => 2736.54, 'target_text' => 'This is a mosque.', 'source_text' => 'Ini adalah sebuah masjid.', 'order' => 895],
            ['start_time' => 2736.64, 'end_time' => 2737.07, 'target_text' => 'It\'s full.', 'source_text' => 'Ia amat padat.', 'order' => 896],
            ['start_time' => 2737.17, 'end_time' => 2739.32, 'target_text' => 'If I greet them, there will be a stampede.', 'source_text' => 'Jika saya bersalaman dengan mereka, akan berlaku rempuhan (tolak-menolak).', 'order' => 897],
            ['start_time' => 2739.42, 'end_time' => 2741.2, 'target_text' => 'There will be injured people, children, and others.', 'source_text' => 'Akan ada orang yang cedera, kanak-kanak, dan lain-lain.', 'order' => 898],
            ['start_time' => 2741.3, 'end_time' => 2742.48, 'target_text' => 'It is my duty to leave.', 'source_text' => 'Adalah menjadi tanggungjawab saya untuk beredar segera.', 'order' => 899],
            ['start_time' => 2742.58, 'end_time' => 2743.77, 'target_text' => 'Do you know what I do?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa yang saya lakukan?', 'order' => 900],
            ['start_time' => 2743.87, 'end_time' => 2746.14, 'target_text' => 'I get invited to a wedding, for example.', 'source_text' => 'Sebagai contoh, saya dijemput ke majlis perkahwinan.', 'order' => 901],
            ['start_time' => 2746.24, 'end_time' => 2750.2, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t prioritize going to weddings, but sometimes we have to go.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sebenarnya tidak mengutamakan menghadiri majlis perkahwinan, tetapi kadangkala kita perlu hadir.', 'order' => 902],
            ['start_time' => 2750.3, 'end_time' => 2753.88, 'target_text' => 'So, if I go to the wedding, I\'ll tell my brother, "Brother, I\'ll go, but I\'ll leave immediately." "I will', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, jika saya hadir ke majlis perkahwinan itu, saya akan beritahu sahabat saya, "Saudaraku, saya akan hadir, tetapi saya akan terus beredar selepas itu."', 'order' => 903],
            ['start_time' => 2753.98, 'end_time' => 2758.88, 'target_text' => 'go, give a talk, officiate, and then leave." "No, but why?" I said, "No, I have something to do." What', 'source_text' => '"Saya akan hadir, menyampaikan sedikit tazkirah, mendoakan keberkatan, kemudian terus pulang." "Tidak, tetapi mengapa begitu?" Saya kata, "Tidak, saya ada urusan penting." Mengapa', 'order' => 904],
            ['start_time' => 2758.98, 'end_time' => 2760.52, 'target_text' => 'did I do?', 'source_text' => 'saya berbuat demikian?', 'order' => 905],
            ['start_time' => 2760.62, 'end_time' => 2763.46, 'target_text' => 'That day belongs to the bride and groom.', 'source_text' => 'Hari tersebut adalah milik eksklusif pasangan pengantin lelaki dan perempuan.', 'order' => 906],
            ['start_time' => 2763.56, 'end_time' => 2770.2, 'target_text' => 'I\'m going to go there just for a few \'likes\' and clicks that people get, the focus will shift towards me.', 'source_text' => 'Jika saya berada di sana, semata-mata kerana mengejar beberapa tanda \'suka\' dan perhatian orang ramai, fokus majlis akan beralih kepada diri saya.', 'order' => 907],
            ['start_time' => 2770.3, 'end_time' => 2773.01, 'target_text' => 'And everyone wants to take pictures, and they want to do that.', 'source_text' => 'Dan semua orang akan mahu bergambar, dan mereka sibuk mengejar perkara itu.', 'order' => 908],
            ['start_time' => 2773.11, 'end_time' => 2773.96, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t need all that.', 'source_text' => 'Saya langsung tidak memerlukan semua itu.', 'order' => 909],
            ['start_time' => 2774.06, 'end_time' => 2775.44, 'target_text' => 'And they don\'t need all that.', 'source_text' => 'Dan pasangan pengantin itu juga tidak memerlukan gangguan sedemikian.', 'order' => 910],
            ['start_time' => 2775.54, 'end_time' => 2776.17, 'target_text' => 'They don\'t know.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka mungkin tidak menyedarinya.', 'order' => 911],
            ['start_time' => 2776.27, 'end_time' => 2779.32, 'target_text' => 'They\'re excited: "We\'ve invited this guy to the wedding." What did I do?', 'source_text' => 'Mereka sangat teruja: "Kami telah menjemput penceramah ini ke majlis perkahwinan kami." Apakah tindakan saya?', 'order' => 912],
            ['start_time' => 2779.42, 'end_time' => 2782.32, 'target_text' => 'I left as a blessing for myself and everyone else.', 'source_text' => 'Saya beredar segera demi membawa kebaikan dan keberkatan buat diri saya dan orang lain.', 'order' => 913],
            ['start_time' => 2782.42, 'end_time' => 2784.32, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t need the food.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tidak memerlukan hidangan makanan itu.', 'order' => 914],
            ['start_time' => 2784.42, 'end_time' => 2787.26, 'target_text' => 'Simply put, mashallah, I delivered what I had to deliver and left.', 'source_text' => 'Secara ringkasnya, masya-Allah, saya telah menyampaikan apa yang perlu disampaikan lalu meminta diri.', 'order' => 915],
            ['start_time' => 2787.36, 'end_time' => 2789.95, 'target_text' => 'Now, the focus remains on the people where it\'s supposed to be.', 'source_text' => 'Kini, tumpuan majlis kekal sepenuhnya kepada pihak yang sepatutnya diraikan.', 'order' => 916],
            ['start_time' => 2790.05, 'end_time' => 2791.86, 'target_text' => 'It\'s their big day, their big day.', 'source_text' => 'Hari itu adalah hari bahagia mereka yang paling bermakna.', 'order' => 917],
            ['start_time' => 2791.96, 'end_time' => 2793.54, 'target_text' => 'You wonder why I left.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin tertanya-tanya mengapa saya segera beredar.', 'order' => 918],
            ['start_time' => 2793.64, 'end_time' => 2796.39, 'target_text' => 'Between Allah and me, I know why I left.', 'source_text' => 'Antara saya dengan Allah, saya tahu niat sebenar mengapa saya beredar.', 'order' => 919],
            ['start_time' => 2796.49, 'end_time' => 2797.52, 'target_text' => 'The same applies here.', 'source_text' => 'Begitu jugalah keadaannya di sini hari ini.', 'order' => 920],
            ['start_time' => 2797.62, 'end_time' => 2801.06, 'target_text' => 'I\'m going to leave right after my talk and I\'ll be gone.', 'source_text' => 'Saya akan terus beredar sebaik sahaja selesai menyampaikan ceramah ini dan saya akan berlepas pulang.', 'order' => 921],
            ['start_time' => 2801.16, 'end_time' => 2802.54, 'target_text' => 'Before you know it, the man is gone.', 'source_text' => 'Sedar-sedar sahaja, penceramah sudah tiada.', 'order' => 922],
            ['start_time' => 2802.64, 'end_time' => 2803.01, 'target_text' => 'Why?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapa?', 'order' => 923],
            ['start_time' => 2803.02, 'end_time' => 2803.81, 'target_text' => 'Who am I?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah saya ini?', 'order' => 924],
            ['start_time' => 2803.91, 'end_time' => 2806.69, 'target_text' => 'If there were any virtue in shaking my hand, I would do it for everyone.', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya terdapat apa-apa fadhilat istimewa dengan bersalaman dengan saya, pasti saya akan bersalaman dengan setiap jemaah.', 'order' => 925],
            ['start_time' => 2806.79, 'end_time' => 2807.57, 'target_text' => 'There is no virtue.', 'source_text' => 'Namun tiada sebarang fadhilat luar biasa.', 'order' => 926],
            ['start_time' => 2807.67, 'end_time' => 2810.47, 'target_text' => 'Giving me your hand doesn\'t mean anything.', 'source_text' => 'Bersalaman dengan saya tidak membawa sebarang erti keramat.', 'order' => 927],
            ['start_time' => 2810.57, 'end_time' => 2813.49, 'target_text' => 'I repeat, janaza ba Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Saya ulang sekali lagi, nilainya di sisi Allah tidak lebih daripada sayap nyamuk.', 'order' => 928],
            ['start_time' => 2813.59, 'end_time' => 2816.06, 'target_text' => 'So I\'m a human being just like you.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi saya hanyalah seorang manusia biasa sama seperti anda.', 'order' => 929],
            ['start_time' => 2816.16, 'end_time' => 2817.49, 'target_text' => 'You\'re probably better than me.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin jauh lebih mulia di sisi Allah berbanding diri saya.', 'order' => 930],
            ['start_time' => 2817.59, 'end_time' => 2819.1, 'target_text' => 'But I\'m only here to remind you.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berada di sini hanyalah untuk saling mengingatkan.', 'order' => 931],
            ['start_time' => 2819.2, 'end_time' => 2820.65, 'target_text' => 'Perhaps you\'d like to hear me out.', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin anda sudi mendengar perkongsian saya.', 'order' => 932],
            ['start_time' => 2820.75, 'end_time' => 2822.53, 'target_text' => 'And maybe you\'d like to hear a few things.', 'source_text' => 'Dan mungkin anda ingin mendengar beberapa mutiara nasihat.', 'order' => 933],
            ['start_time' => 2822.63, 'end_time' => 2823.31, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a reminder.', 'source_text' => 'Ia hanyalah sebuah peringatan.', 'order' => 934],
            ['start_time' => 2823.41, 'end_time' => 2826.27, 'target_text' => 'I need this reminder more than you do.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sendiri lebih memerlukan peringatan ini berbanding anda semua.', 'order' => 935],
            ['start_time' => 2826.37, 'end_time' => 2827.95, 'target_text' => 'But mashallah, I don\'t care.', 'source_text' => 'Namun masya-Allah, saya tidak kisah.', 'order' => 936],
            ['start_time' => 2828.05, 'end_time' => 2830.9, 'target_text' => 'We can shake hands because it is a good Sunnah.', 'source_text' => 'Kita boleh bersalaman kerana ia merupakan suatu sunnah yang mulia.', 'order' => 937],
            ['start_time' => 2831.0, 'end_time' => 2837.01, 'target_text' => 'But you know there\'s a downside and there might be pushing and shoving and a lot of chaos.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi apabila anda tahu wujud kemudaratan seperti tolak-menolak dan kekecohan yang tidak diingini,', 'order' => 938],
            ['start_time' => 2837.11, 'end_time' => 2842.23, 'target_text' => 'The best thing you can do is say bismillah, salaam alaikum my brothers, my sisters, and go on your way.', 'source_text' => 'perkara terbaik yang boleh anda lakukan ialah mengucapkan bismillah, salam alaikum wahai saudara dan saudariku, lalu meneruskan perjalanan.', 'order' => 939],
            ['start_time' => 2842.33, 'end_time' => 2843.11, 'target_text' => 'Do you feel it?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda dapat merasakannya?', 'order' => 940],
            ['start_time' => 2843.21, 'end_time' => 2844.43, 'target_text' => 'Do you understand what I\'m saying?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda faham apa yang saya maksudkan?', 'order' => 941],
            ['start_time' => 2844.53, 'end_time' => 2846.62, 'target_text' => 'May Allah grant us the Jannah.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mengurniakan kita Syurga.', 'order' => 942],
            ['start_time' => 2846.72, 'end_time' => 2849.22, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty grant us the Jannah.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa mengurniakan kita Jannah.', 'order' => 943],
            ['start_time' => 2849.32, 'end_time' => 2850.98, 'target_text' => 'The second point I\'m making is that you must be humble.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara kedua yang saya tekankan ialah anda wajib bersikap rendah hati (tawaduk).', 'order' => 944],
            ['start_time' => 2851.08, 'end_time' => 2856.85, 'target_text' => 'Third thing, the third thing when you want to change your life and want the scales to tip in the right way,', 'source_text' => 'Perkara ketiga, perkara ketiga apabila anda mahu mengubah kehidupan anda dan mahukan neraca timbangan condong ke arah kebaikan,', 'order' => 945],
            ['start_time' => 2856.95, 'end_time' => 2859.26, 'target_text' => 'learn to pray five times a day.', 'source_text' => 'belajarlah untuk mendirikan solat lima waktu sehari semalam.', 'order' => 946],
            ['start_time' => 2859.36, 'end_time' => 2862.99, 'target_text' => 'Learn to pray five times a day.', 'source_text' => 'Belajarlah untuk menunaikan solat lima waktu secara konsisten.', 'order' => 947],
            ['start_time' => 2863.09, 'end_time' => 2871.92, 'target_text' => 'Strive hard, very hard, because that is the only pillar of Islam after the shahada that no one has an excuse', 'source_text' => 'Berusahalah bersungguh-sungguh, kerana solat adalah satu-satunya rukun Islam selepas syahadah yang mana tiada seorang pun ada alasan', 'order' => 948],
            ['start_time' => 2872.02, 'end_time' => 2873.28, 'target_text' => 'not to fulfill.', 'source_text' => 'untuk meninggalkannya.', 'order' => 949],
            ['start_time' => 2873.38, 'end_time' => 2875.98, 'target_text' => 'Do you understand what I mean?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda memahami apa yang saya maksudkan?', 'order' => 950],
            ['start_time' => 2876.08, 'end_time' => 2877.3, 'target_text' => 'I said it before.', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah menyatakannya sebelum ini.', 'order' => 951],
            ['start_time' => 2877.4, 'end_time' => 2879.07, 'target_text' => 'I can tell you quickly.', 'source_text' => 'Biar saya jelaskan secara ringkas.', 'order' => 952],
            ['start_time' => 2879.18, 'end_time' => 2881.1, 'target_text' => 'How many pillars are there in Islam?', 'source_text' => 'Berapakah rukun yang ada di dalam Islam?', 'order' => 953],
            ['start_time' => 2881.2, 'end_time' => 2881.6, 'target_text' => 'Five.', 'source_text' => 'Lima rukun.', 'order' => 954],
            ['start_time' => 2881.67, 'end_time' => 2881.99, 'target_text' => 'Five.', 'source_text' => 'Lima.', 'order' => 955],
            ['start_time' => 2882.0, 'end_time' => 2884.76, 'target_text' => 'When you want to enter Islam, what do you say?', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda mahu memeluk Islam, apakah yang anda lafazkan?', 'order' => 956],
            ['start_time' => 2884.86, 'end_time' => 2885.39, 'target_text' => 'The shahada, right?', 'source_text' => 'Dua kalimah syahadah, betul bukan?', 'order' => 957],
            ['start_time' => 2885.49, 'end_time' => 2886.89, 'target_text' => 'So that first pillar is done.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi rukun yang pertama telah terlaksana.', 'order' => 958],
            ['start_time' => 2886.99, 'end_time' => 2888.07, 'target_text' => 'There is no commitment.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada komitmen kewangan atau fizikal yang berat.', 'order' => 959],
            ['start_time' => 2888.17, 'end_time' => 2890.04, 'target_text' => 'That \'s the gateway to faith, isn\'t it?', 'source_text' => 'Itu adalah pintu gerbang menuju keimanan, bukan?', 'order' => 960],
            ['start_time' => 2890.14, 'end_time' => 2891.34, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s start from the bottom.', 'source_text' => 'Mari kita mulakan dari bahagian paling bawah.', 'order' => 961],
            ['start_time' => 2891.44, 'end_time' => 2892.76, 'target_text' => 'The last pillar is the Hajj.', 'source_text' => 'Rukun yang terakhir ialah ibadah Haji.', 'order' => 962],
            ['start_time' => 2892.86, 'end_time' => 2895.17, 'target_text' => 'If you don\'t have money, does this apply to you?', 'source_text' => 'Sekiranya anda tiada kemampuan kewangan, adakah ia wajib ke atas anda?', 'order' => 963],
            ['start_time' => 2895.27, 'end_time' => 2898.56, 'target_text' => 'I believe it\'s a pillar, but I didn\'t fulfill it because I don\'t have to.', 'source_text' => 'Saya beriman bahawa ia adalah rukun, tetapi saya tidak melakukannya kerana saya tidak berkemampuan.', 'order' => 964],
            ['start_time' => 2898.66, 'end_time' => 2899.06, 'target_text' => 'Zakat.', 'source_text' => 'Zakat pula.', 'order' => 965],
            ['start_time' => 2899.14, 'end_time' => 2904.12, 'target_text' => 'Zakat, you believe it as a pillar, but if you don\'t have wealth, is it applicable for you to fulfill it?', 'source_text' => 'Zakat, anda beriman bahawa ia adalah rukun, tetapi jika anda tiada lebihan harta, adakah anda diwajibkan mengeluarkannya?', 'order' => 966],
            ['start_time' => 2904.22, 'end_time' => 2904.49, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak.', 'order' => 967],
            ['start_time' => 2904.5, 'end_time' => 2906.28, 'target_text' => 'Let\'s move on to the next one.', 'source_text' => 'Mari kita beralih ke rukun seterusnya.', 'order' => 968],
            ['start_time' => 2906.38, 'end_time' => 2906.78, 'target_text' => 'Fast.', 'source_text' => 'Puasa.', 'order' => 969],
            ['start_time' => 2906.88, 'end_time' => 2908.91, 'target_text' => 'Fasting is a very important pillar.', 'source_text' => 'Ibadah puasa adalah rukun yang sangat penting.', 'order' => 970],
            ['start_time' => 2909.01, 'end_time' => 2915.01, 'target_text' => 'I believe that, but if you are not well or are sick and cannot fast, does Allah force you to fast?', 'source_text' => 'Saya meyakininya, tetapi sekiranya anda tidak sihat atau uzur dan tidak mampu berpuasa, adakah Allah memaksa anda berpuasa?', 'order' => 971],
            ['start_time' => 2915.11, 'end_time' => 2915.33, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak sama sekali.', 'order' => 972],
            ['start_time' => 2915.34, 'end_time' => 2916.38, 'target_text' => 'You can pay a fidya.', 'source_text' => 'Anda boleh membayar fidyah.', 'order' => 973],
            ['start_time' => 2916.48, 'end_time' => 2918.27, 'target_text' => 'There are other ways to handle it.', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat cara rukhsah lain untuk menguruskannya.', 'order' => 974],
            ['start_time' => 2918.37, 'end_time' => 2919.68, 'target_text' => 'But it comes to prayer.', 'source_text' => 'Namun apabila menyentuh perihal solat.', 'order' => 975],
            ['start_time' => 2919.78, 'end_time' => 2922.55, 'target_text' => 'You can\'t pray it standing up, what do you do?', 'source_text' => 'Jika anda tidak mampu solat berdiri, apa yang anda lakukan?', 'order' => 976],
            ['start_time' => 2922.65, 'end_time' => 2923.17, 'target_text' => 'You sit down.', 'source_text' => 'Anda solat secara duduk.', 'order' => 977],
            ['start_time' => 2923.27, 'end_time' => 2924.72, 'target_text' => 'You can\'t sit down, what do you do?', 'source_text' => 'Jika tidak mampu solat duduk, apa yang anda lakukan?', 'order' => 978],
            ['start_time' => 2924.82, 'end_time' => 2925.25, 'target_text' => 'You lie down.', 'source_text' => 'Anda solat secara baring.', 'order' => 979],
            ['start_time' => 2925.35, 'end_time' => 2928.31, 'target_text' => 'You can\'t use water for wudu, what do you do?', 'source_text' => 'Jika anda tidak boleh menggunakan air untuk wuduk, apa yang anda lakukan? Bertayamum.', 'order' => 980],
            ['start_time' => 2928.41, 'end_time' => 2930.44, 'target_text' => 'But you will always have to pray.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi anda tetap wajib mendirikan solat.', 'order' => 981],
            ['start_time' => 2930.54, 'end_time' => 2930.94, 'target_text' => 'Prayer.', 'source_text' => 'Solat.', 'order' => 982],
            ['start_time' => 2930.95, 'end_time' => 2933.88, 'target_text' => 'So you want to build a connection with Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi anda ingin membina hubungan erat dengan Allah.', 'order' => 983],
            ['start_time' => 2933.98, 'end_time' => 2935.43, 'target_text' => 'Do you know what Allah says?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda apa yang Allah firmankan?', 'order' => 984],
            ['start_time' => 2935.53, 'end_time' => 2941.62, 'target_text' => 'Allah says that there is nothing more beloved to Me than those things which I made obligatory.', 'source_text' => 'Allah berfirman bahawa tiada amalan yang lebih Aku cintai daripada perkara-perkara yang telah Aku fardukan.', 'order' => 985],
            ['start_time' => 2941.72, 'end_time' => 2943.44, 'target_text' => 'That is a Hadith Qudsi.', 'source_text' => 'Itu adalah sebuah Hadis Qudsi.', 'order' => 986],
            ['start_time' => 2943.54, 'end_time' => 2947.31, 'target_text' => 'There is nothing more beloved to Me than those things I made obligatory.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada perkara yang lebih Aku sukai melainkan apa yang telah Aku wajibkan ke atas hamba-Ku.', 'order' => 987],
            ['start_time' => 2947.41, 'end_time' => 2951.31, 'target_text' => 'If I did something I had to do, it means it\'s what I love most.', 'source_text' => 'Jika saya melakukan sesuatu yang diwajibkan ke atas saya, bermakna itulah amalan yang paling Allah cintai.', 'order' => 988],
            ['start_time' => 2951.41, 'end_time' => 2954.73, 'target_text' => 'And one of the first things he made mandatory was the five sentences.', 'source_text' => 'Dan salah satu amalan terawal yang difardukan ke atas kita ialah solat lima waktu.', 'order' => 989],
            ['start_time' => 2954.83, 'end_time' => 2956.68, 'target_text' => 'So you want to connect with Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi anda mahu terhubung dengan Allah.', 'order' => 990],
            ['start_time' => 2956.78, 'end_time' => 2957.65, 'target_text' => 'I know we are weak.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sedar kita semua insan yang lemah.', 'order' => 991],
            ['start_time' => 2957.75, 'end_time' => 2959.81, 'target_text' => 'I know we all have weaknesses.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tahu kita semua mempunyai kelemahan diri.', 'order' => 992],
            ['start_time' => 2959.91, 'end_time' => 2966.92, 'target_text' => 'My brothers, my sisters, my beloved children, I strongly encourage you to take your prayer seriously.', 'source_text' => 'Wahai saudara-saudaraku, saudari-saudariku, dan anak-anak yang saya kasihi, saya sangat menggalakkan anda untuk menjaga solat anda dengan bersungguh-sungguh.', 'order' => 993],
            ['start_time' => 2967.02, 'end_time' => 2968.48, 'target_text' => 'Your life will change.', 'source_text' => 'Kehidupan anda pasti akan berubah.', 'order' => 994],
            ['start_time' => 2968.58, 'end_time' => 2969.83, 'target_text' => 'Be a proud Muslim.', 'source_text' => 'Jadilah seorang Muslim yang bangga dengan agamanya.', 'order' => 995],
            ['start_time' => 2969.93, 'end_time' => 2971.99, 'target_text' => 'Be a person whose identity is known.', 'source_text' => 'Jadilah seorang insan yang jelas identiti keislamannya.', 'order' => 996],
            ['start_time' => 2972.09, 'end_time' => 2975.29, 'target_text' => 'So what if they don\'t treat you well?', 'source_text' => 'Jadi bagaimana jika orang lain melayan anda dengan buruk?', 'order' => 997],
            ['start_time' => 2975.39, 'end_time' => 2978.21, 'target_text' => 'They did not treat the Prophet Muhammad well, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him.', 'source_text' => 'Dahulu mereka juga tidak melayan Nabi Muhammad dengan baik, selawat dan salam ke atas baginda.', 'order' => 998],
            ['start_time' => 2978.31, 'end_time' => 2979.2, 'target_text' => 'He took it as an honor.', 'source_text' => 'Baginda menganggap cabaran itu sebagai satu kemuliaan.', 'order' => 999],
            ['start_time' => 2979.3, 'end_time' => 2981.81, 'target_text' => 'He did not compromise his faith.', 'source_text' => 'Baginda tidak pernah menggadaikan pegangan agamanya.', 'order' => 1000],
            ['start_time' => 2981.91, 'end_time' => 2984.41, 'target_text' => 'They were tortured in Mecca.', 'source_text' => 'Para sahabat diseksa dengan kejam di Mekah.', 'order' => 1001],
            ['start_time' => 2984.51, 'end_time' => 2986.89, 'target_text' => 'They did not compromise their faith.', 'source_text' => 'Namun mereka tidak pernah sesekali menggadaikan keimanan mereka.', 'order' => 1002],
            ['start_time' => 2986.99, 'end_time' => 2988.49, 'target_text' => 'So, they might not like you.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, orang lain mungkin tidak menyukai anda.', 'order' => 1003],
            ['start_time' => 2988.59, 'end_time' => 2988.99, 'target_text' => 'And?', 'source_text' => 'Lalu apa masalahnya?', 'order' => 1004],
            ['start_time' => 2989.01, 'end_time' => 2990.22, 'target_text' => 'I will continue to pray.', 'source_text' => 'Saya akan terus istiqamah mendirikan solat.', 'order' => 1005],
            ['start_time' => 2990.32, 'end_time' => 2992.36, 'target_text' => 'I am still myself, I am a Muslim without apology.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tetap diri saya yang sebenar, saya seorang Muslim tanpa perlu meminta maaf.', 'order' => 1006],
            ['start_time' => 2992.46, 'end_time' => 2995.99, 'target_text' => 'And I will prove to you that Islam is an amazing and beautiful religion.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya akan membuktikan kepada anda bahawa Islam adalah agama yang amat luar biasa dan penuh keindahan.', 'order' => 1007],
            ['start_time' => 2996.09, 'end_time' => 2999.98, 'target_text' => 'We are taught to help Muslims, non-Muslims, whoever they may be.', 'source_text' => 'Kita diajar untuk membantu orang Islam, orang bukan Islam, sesiapa sahaja tanpa mengira latar belakang.', 'order' => 1008],
            ['start_time' => 3000.08, 'end_time' => 3002.8, 'target_text' => 'I gave you an example at the beginning of this talk about a dog.', 'source_text' => 'Saya telah memberikan satu contoh kepada anda pada awal ceramah ini mengenai seekor anjing.', 'order' => 1009],
            ['start_time' => 3002.9, 'end_time' => 3005.78, 'target_text' => 'And I told them that we should', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya telah berpesan kepada mereka bahawa kita wajib', 'order' => 1010],
            ['start_time' => 3005.88, 'end_time' => 3007.37, 'target_text' => 'be kind to animals, take care of them, and so on.', 'source_text' => 'berbuat baik kepada binatang, menjaga kebajikan haiwan, dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 1011],
            ['start_time' => 3007.47, 'end_time' => 3011.54, 'target_text' => 'I even said that with a pig, you should be kind to the pig.', 'source_text' => 'Malah saya turut menyatakan bahawa terhadap seekor babi sekalipun, anda wajib berlaku ihsan kepadanya.', 'order' => 1012],
            ['start_time' => 3011.64, 'end_time' => 3013.49, 'target_text' => 'May Almighty Allah honor us all.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Kuasa memuliakan kita semua.', 'order' => 1013],
            ['start_time' => 3013.59, 'end_time' => 3015.35, 'target_text' => 'May Allah Almighty bless us all.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa merahmati kita semua.', 'order' => 1014],
            ['start_time' => 3015.45, 'end_time' => 3016.37, 'target_text' => 'That\'s how you start.', 'source_text' => 'Begitulah cara anda memulakan langkah perubahan.', 'order' => 1015],
            ['start_time' => 3016.47, 'end_time' => 3018.28, 'target_text' => 'And that is how you draw closer to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan begitulah cara anda mendekatkan diri kepada Allah.', 'order' => 1016],
            ['start_time' => 3018.38, 'end_time' => 3020.9, 'target_text' => 'And that is how the doors begin to open.', 'source_text' => 'Dan dengan cara itulah pintu-pintu rahmat mula terbuka luas.', 'order' => 1017],
            ['start_time' => 3021.0, 'end_time' => 3022.35, 'target_text' => 'Simple beginnings, an easy start.', 'source_text' => 'Permulaan yang ringkas, langkah awal yang mudah.', 'order' => 1018],
            ['start_time' => 3022.45, 'end_time' => 3024.32, 'target_text' => 'We start with Allah Subhana Wa Ta\'ala.', 'source_text' => 'Kita mulakan segalanya kerana Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta\'ala.', 'order' => 1019],
            ['start_time' => 3024.41, 'end_time' => 3026.77, 'target_text' => 'And Allah will open the gates one after another.', 'source_text' => 'Dan Allah akan membuka pintu-pintu kemudahan satu demi satu.', 'order' => 1020],
            ['start_time' => 3026.87, 'end_time' => 3029.93, 'target_text' => 'And Allah will grant us the goodness of this world and the next.', 'source_text' => 'Dan Allah akan mengurniakan kepada kita kebaikan di dunia dan kebaikan di akhirat.', 'order' => 1021],
            ['start_time' => 3030.03, 'end_time' => 3036.82, 'target_text' => 'So we seek Allah\'s forgiveness, we humble ourselves, we begin our prayer, and then Allah will open our doors.', 'source_text' => 'Maka kita memohon keampunan Allah, kita merendahkan diri kita, kita memulakan solat kita, dan kemudian Allah akan membuka jalan keluar buat kita.', 'order' => 1022],
            ['start_time' => 3036.93, 'end_time' => 3039.69, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t make excuses when you\'ve done something wrong.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan sesekali mencari alasan apabila anda telah melakukan sesuatu kesilapan.', 'order' => 1023],
            ['start_time' => 3039.79, 'end_time' => 3044.36, 'target_text' => 'Always ask Allah: "O Allah, strengthen me to do what is obligatory.', 'source_text' => 'Sentiasalah berdoa kepada Allah: "Ya Allah, berikanlah aku kekuatan untuk melaksanakan apa yang diwajibkan.', 'order' => 1024],
            ['start_time' => 3044.46, 'end_time' => 3049.04, 'target_text' => 'O Allah, strengthen me to do what is pleasing to You.', 'source_text' => 'Ya Allah, berikanlah aku kekuatan untuk melakukan apa yang Engkau redai.', 'order' => 1025],
            ['start_time' => 3049.14, 'end_time' => 3057.47, 'target_text' => 'And O Allah, strengthen me to forsake what is displeasing to You." May Allah Almighty bless you all.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ya Allah, berikanlah aku kekuatan untuk meninggalkan apa yang mendatangkan kemurkaan-Mu." Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa merahmati anda semua.', 'order' => 1026],
            ['start_time' => 3057.57, 'end_time' => 3058.79, 'target_text' => 'These brothers have risen up.', 'source_text' => 'Saudara-saudara kita ini sudah mula berdiri.', 'order' => 1027],
            ['start_time' => 3058.89, 'end_time' => 3060.42, 'target_text' => 'They want me to leave Aberdeen.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka mahu saya beredar meninggalkan Aberdeen segera.', 'order' => 1028],
            ['start_time' => 3060.52, 'end_time' => 3064.85, 'target_text' => 'I said something that seems to have offended some people.', 'source_text' => 'Adakah saya tersilap kata sehingga menyinggung perasaan sesetengah orang?', 'order' => 1029],
            ['start_time' => 3064.95, 'end_time' => 3066.4, 'target_text' => 'I did it?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah saya melakukannya?', 'order' => 1030],
            ['start_time' => 3066.5, 'end_time' => 3067.61, 'target_text' => 'No, I didn\'t do it.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, saya tidak berbuat demikian.', 'order' => 1031],
            ['start_time' => 3067.72, 'end_time' => 3068.24, 'target_text' => 'Come on, guys.', 'source_text' => 'Tenanglah semua sahabat.', 'order' => 1032],
            ['start_time' => 3068.34, 'end_time' => 3068.69, 'target_text' => 'Masha\'Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 1033],
            ['start_time' => 3068.7, 'end_time' => 3070.06, 'target_text' => 'May Allah bless you all.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah merahmati anda semua.', 'order' => 1034],
            ['start_time' => 3070.16, 'end_time' => 3070.44, 'target_text' => 'Masha\'Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 1035],
            ['start_time' => 3070.45, 'end_time' => 3072.89, 'target_text' => 'Can I ask you a question?', 'source_text' => 'Bolehkah saya bertanyakan satu soalan kepada anda?', 'order' => 1036],
            ['start_time' => 3072.99, 'end_time' => 3074.86, 'target_text' => 'What\'s your name?', 'source_text' => 'Siapakah nama anda?', 'order' => 1037],
            ['start_time' => 3074.96, 'end_time' => 3075.15, 'target_text' => 'Yunus.', 'source_text' => 'Yunus.', 'order' => 1038],
            ['start_time' => 3075.16, 'end_time' => 3075.56, 'target_text' => 'Masha\'Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah.', 'order' => 1039],
            ['start_time' => 3075.61, 'end_time' => 3079.23, 'target_text' => 'What brought you here today?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang membawa anda hadir ke sini pada hari ini?', 'order' => 1040],
            ['start_time' => 3079.9, 'end_time' => 3081.63, 'target_text' => 'What was the reason?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah puncanya?', 'order' => 1041],
            ['start_time' => 3081.73, 'end_time' => 3083.75, 'target_text' => 'It seems you arrived a little early, didn\'t you?', 'source_text' => 'Nampaknya anda tiba agak awal, bukan?', 'order' => 1042],
            ['start_time' => 3083.85, 'end_time' => 3091.14, 'target_text' => 'Yes, I wanted to become enlightened, and I wanted to become enlightened, he says, and something else, I\'m about', 'source_text' => 'Ya, saya ingin mendapatkan pencerahan ilmu, dan saya mahu membimbing jiwa saya, katanya, dan satu perkara lagi, saya bakal', 'order' => 1043],
            ['start_time' => 3091.24, 'end_time' => 3096.32, 'target_text' => 'to start university and I want to make sure I live in accordance with Alhamdulillah.', 'source_text' => 'memulakan pengajian di universiti dan saya mahu memastikan saya menjalani kehidupan mengikut panduan alhamdulillah.', 'order' => 1044],
            ['start_time' => 3096.42, 'end_time' => 3100.75, 'target_text' => 'Mashallah, the brother says that he wanted to become enlightened and everything else he said after that is', 'source_text' => 'Masya-Allah, saudara kita menyatakan bahawa beliau mahu mendapatkan pencerahan dan segala yang beliau katakan selepas itu adalah', 'order' => 1045],
            ['start_time' => 3100.85, 'end_time' => 3101.53, 'target_text' => 'related to that.', 'source_text' => 'berkaitan dengannya.', 'order' => 1046],
            ['start_time' => 3101.62, 'end_time' => 3104.06, 'target_text' => 'Do you feel, do you feel a little better?', 'source_text' => 'Adakah anda berasa, adakah anda berasa lebih tenang dan bersemangat sekarang?', 'order' => 1047],
            ['start_time' => 3104.16, 'end_time' => 3104.32, 'target_text' => 'Yes, I am.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, saya merasakannya.', 'order' => 1048],
            ['start_time' => 3104.33, 'end_time' => 3105.9, 'target_text' => 'May Allah bless us all.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah merahmati kita semua.', 'order' => 1049],
            ['start_time' => 3106.0, 'end_time' => 3110.65, 'target_text' => 'The reason I ask is because many young people come and I always ask them what made them come and why they', 'source_text' => 'Sebab utama saya bertanya adalah kerana ramai anak muda yang hadir dan saya sentiasa bertanya apa yang mendorong mereka hadir dan mengapa mereka', 'order' => 1050],
            ['start_time' => 3110.75, 'end_time' => 3111.05, 'target_text' => 'came.', 'source_text' => 'datang ke sini.', 'order' => 1051],
            ['start_time' => 3111.06, 'end_time' => 3113.68, 'target_text' => 'I hope it\'s never to take a picture with you.', 'source_text' => 'Saya berharap niatnya bukanlah semata-mata untuk bergambar bersama.', 'order' => 1052],
            ['start_time' => 3113.78, 'end_time' => 3116.69, 'target_text' => 'Because that won\'t get you anywhere.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana gambar itu tidak akan membawa anda ke mana-mana.', 'order' => 1053],
            ['start_time' => 3116.79, 'end_time' => 3124.15, 'target_text' => 'Wallahi, whether you take a picture or not, I like to use the term that means that in the eyes of Allah', 'source_text' => 'Wallahi, sama ada anda bergambar atau tidak, saya suka menggunakan perumpamaan bahawa di sisi Allah,', 'order' => 1054],
            ['start_time' => 3124.25, 'end_time' => 3126.32, 'target_text' => 'you are not worth the weight of a fly.', 'source_text' => 'dunia dan kemasyhuran ini tidak bernilai walau seberat sayap lalat.', 'order' => 1055],
            ['start_time' => 3126.42, 'end_time' => 3127.68, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what it is.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah hakikat yang sebenar.', 'order' => 1056],
            ['start_time' => 3127.78, 'end_time' => 3132.17, 'target_text' => 'So, inshallah, if we can, I don\'t mind a photo or two, but if you can\'t get it, don\'t bother.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, insya-Allah, jika ada kesempatan, saya tidak keberatan untuk mengambil satu atau dua keping gambar, tetapi jika tidak berpeluang, jangan risaukan.', 'order' => 1057],
            ['start_time' => 3132.27, 'end_time' => 3133.44, 'target_text' => 'We will walk out, inshallah.', 'source_text' => 'Kita akan beredar keluar, insya-Allah.', 'order' => 1058],
            ['start_time' => 3133.54, 'end_time' => 3138.09, 'target_text' => 'The young people who are here and that I see, wallahi, it moves me a lot to see so many young people.', 'source_text' => 'Anak-anak muda yang berada di sini dan yang saya saksikan ini, wallahi, amat menyentuh hati saya melihat begitu ramai golongan muda.', 'order' => 1059],
            ['start_time' => 3138.19, 'end_time' => 3140.27, 'target_text' => 'How many of you are under 30 years old?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa ramai antara anda yang berumur di bawah 30 tahun?', 'order' => 1060],
            ['start_time' => 3140.37, 'end_time' => 3141.76, 'target_text' => 'Raise your hand.', 'source_text' => 'Sila angkat tangan anda.', 'order' => 1061],
            ['start_time' => 3141.86, 'end_time' => 3142.74, 'target_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 1062],
            ['start_time' => 3142.84, 'end_time' => 3143.79, 'target_text' => 'That\'s most of the mosque.', 'source_text' => 'Hampir seluruh jemaah masjid mengangkat tangan.', 'order' => 1063],
            ['start_time' => 3143.89, 'end_time' => 3145.23, 'target_text' => 'That\'s a very good sign.', 'source_text' => 'Itu adalah petanda yang sangat baik.', 'order' => 1064],
            ['start_time' => 3145.33, 'end_time' => 3150.02, 'target_text' => 'May Allah bless this wonderful community, inshallah, and may Allah subhanahu wa ta\'ala grant us ease and kindness.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah memberkati komuniti yang hebat ini, insya-Allah, dan semoga Allah Subhanahu Wa Ta\'ala mengurniakan kemudahan dan rahmat-Nya kepada kita.', 'order' => 1065],
